ion of database management tools | Operate database management systems to analyze data and perform data mining analysis | May lead, coordinate or supervise other workers in this group", "employment_requirement": "A bachelor''s degree or college program, usually in computer science, computer engineering, or mathematics is usually required", "top_3_code": "ICe", "leadership": "3", "critical_thinking": "4", "problem_solving": "4", "analytical_thinking": "5", "attention_to_detail": "5", "collaboration": "4", "evaluation": "4", "decision_making": "4", "stress_tolerance": "3"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'esco', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
