mplete Coursera''s Machine Learning course by Andrew Ng", "Experiment with Scikit-learn in financial predictions", "Read ''Hands-On Machine Learning with Scikit-Learn, Keras, and TensorFlow'' by Aur\u00e9lien G\u00e9ron"], "children": [{"id": "career-data-scientist", "label": "Data Scientist in Finance", "type": "outcome", "level": 0, "actions": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "skill-financial-theory", "label": "Understand Financial Theory", "type": "skill", "level": 0, "actions": ["Read ''Principles of Corporate Finance'' by Brealey, Myers, and Allen", "Attend online lectures from Yale''s Financial Markets course", "Follow financial markets through Bloomberg and CNBC"], "children": [{"id": "skill-quantitative-analysis", "label": "Develop Quantitative Analysis Skills", "type": "skill", "level": 0, "actions": ["Read ''Quantitative Financial Analytics: The Path to Investment Profits'' by Edward E. Qian", "Use R to perform statistical analysis on stock data", "Complete exercises from ''Quantitative Finance for Dummies''"], "children": [{"id": "skill-risk-management", "label": "Explore Risk Management", "type": "skill", "level": 0, "actions": ["Study ''Risk Management and Financial Institutions'' by John Hull", "Analyze risk metrics using Python", "Participate in workshops on financial risk management"], "children": [{"id": "career-risk-analyst", "label": "Risk Analyst", "type": "outcome", "level": 0, "actions": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "skill-algorithmic-trading", "label": "Learn Algorithmic Trading", "type": "skill", "level": 0, "actions": ["Enroll in Udemy''s Algorithmic Trading course", "Build a simple trading bot using Python", "Simulate trading strategies using QuantConnect"], "children": [{"id": "skill-advanced-python", "label": "Advanced Python for Finance", "type": "skill", "level": 0, "actions": ["Read ''Python for Finance'' by Yves Hilpisch", "Develop a trading algorithm using OOP principles", "Optimize Python code for performance in trading"], "children": [{"id": "career-quant-t