\"assist clients with personal development\", \"type\": \"skill\", \"originuri\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/98b32477-cccd-47ea-8c85-d4a16b18af08\", \"uuidhistory\": \"03a93930-9edd-43a6-8657-a5048f1c3750\\n2528dee4-f0dc-49ff-ba82-46e811456d51\", \"skilltype\": \"skill/competence\", \"reuselevel\": \"sector-specific\", \"preferredlabel\": \"assist clients with personal development\", \"altlabels\": \"assist with personal development of clients\\naid clients with personal development\\nhelp clients with personal development\\nassist client with personal development\\nassisting clients with personal development\\nassist clients with personal development\", \"description\": \"Help clients determine what they want to do with their lives and assist in setting personal and professional goals, by prioritising and planning the steps necessary to reach these goals.\", \"definition\": \"\", \"scopenote\": \"\", \"islocalized\": \"false\"}, \"is_anchor\": true, \"depth\": 0, \"graph_id\": \"abd1bceb-2f47-45d5-8e65-fd79a87af412\", \"challenge\": \"Recherchez et suivez un tutoriel en ligne sur assist clients with personal development. Pratiquez les concepts appris pendant au moins 3 heures.\", \"xp_reward\": 44, \"visible\": true, \"revealed\": true, \"state\": \"active\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"skillgroup::key_1018\": {\"id\": \"skillgroup::key_1018\", \"type\": \"skillgroup\", \"label\": \"developing objectives and strategies\", \"metadata\": {\"label\": \"developing objectives and strategies\", \"type\": \"skillgroup\", \"originuri\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6ee936b0-4e0c-4e04-97c7-1f4ee9230d67\", \"uuidhistory\": \"3a012fff-b177-4cf7-950f-8ebb35fe3510\\nf020253a-e05c-4447-82bd-777648b45045\", \"code\": \"S4.1.0\", \"preferredlabel\": \"developing objectives and strategies\", \"altlabels\": \"strategic planning\\ndeveloping objectives and strategies\", \"description\": \"Envisioning a future state and developing strategies, goals, objectives and action plans t