o achieve it.\", \"scopenote\": \"\"}, \"is_anchor\": false, \"depth\": 1, \"graph_id\": \"32c6b5d6-d77b-48ea-b7d9-c58d34d8e526\", \"challenge\": \"Recherchez et suivez un tutoriel en ligne sur developing objectives and strategies. Pratiquez les concepts appris pendant au moins 3 heures.\", \"xp_reward\": 29, \"visible\": false, \"revealed\": false, \"state\": \"locked\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"occupation::key_16131\": {\"id\": \"occupation::key_16131\", \"type\": \"occupation\", \"label\": \"strategic planning manager\", \"metadata\": {\"label\": \"strategic planning manager\", \"type\": \"occupation\", \"originuri\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/4f49df98-98b8-4a9e-98ad-9c5557817eba\", \"uuidhistory\": \"8c3c9ea3-8453-4409-9419-d9ca909dab20\\ne86026ef-9489-4599-a13f-5325397c2113\", \"occupationgroupcode\": \"1213\", \"code\": \"1213.2.2\", \"preferredlabel\": \"strategic planning manager\", \"altlabels\": \"strategic planning manager\\nstrategic manager\\nbusiness continuity strategy director\\ncorporate strategist\\nbusiness continuity planning director\\nstrategy manager\\nstrategic development manager\\ninnovation and strategy specialist\\nplanning manager\\nstrategy adviser\\nstrategic business planning manager\", \"description\": \"Strategic planning managers create, together with a team of managers, the strategic plans of the company as a whole, and provide coordination in the implementation per department. They help to interpret the overall plan and create a detailed plan for each one of the departments and branches. They ensure consistency in the implementation.\", \"definition\": \"\", \"scopenote\": \"\", \"regulatedprofessionnote\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated\", \"occupationtype\": \"escooccupation\", \"islocalized\": \"false\"}, \"is_anchor\": false, \"depth\": 1, \"graph_id\": \"32c6b5d6-d77b-48ea-b7d9-c58d34d8e526\", \"challenge\": \"Recherchez et suivez un tutoriel en ligne sur strategic planning manager. Pratiquez les concepts appris pendant au moins 3 heures.\", \"xp_reward\": 32, \"visible\": false, \"revealed\": false, \"state\": \"locked\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"occupation::key_17610\": {\"id\": \"occupation::key_17610\", \"type\": \"occupation\", \"label\": \"policy officer\", \"metadata\": {\"label\": \"policy officer\", \"type\": \"occupation\", \"originuri\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/caf7b8fb-b2d6-46b7-bffa-bea7f8e4aed8\", \"uuidhistory\": \"4e10bba3-027a-4326-9a9f-2eeba0d8c0f8\\nf63c7116-8f24-4e24-80e2-5e0e6ac022e4\", \"occupationgroupcode\": \"2422\", \"code\": \"2422.12\", \"preferredlabel\": \"policy officer\", \"altlabels\": \"policy analyst\\nhealth policy officer\\npolicy researcher\\npolicy coordinator\\npolicy manager\\nstrategy advisor\\npolicy officer\\nstrategy manager\\npolicy advisor\", \"description\": \"Policy officers research, analyse and develop policies in various public sectors, and shape and implement these policies to improve the existing regulation around the sector. They evaluate effects of existing policies and report findings to the government and members of the public. Policy officers work closely with partners, external organisations or other stakeholders and provide them with regular updates.\", \"definition\": \"\", \"scopenote\": \"\", \"regulatedprofessionnote\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated\", \"occupationtype\": \"escooccupation\", \"islocalized\": \"false\"}, \"is_anchor\": false, \"depth\": 1, \"graph_id\": \"32c6b5d6-d77b-48ea-b7d9-c58d34d8e526\", \"challenge\": \"Recherchez et suivez un tutoriel en ligne sur policy officer. Pratiquez les concepts appris pendant au moins 3 heures.\", \"xp_reward\": 23, \"visible\": false, \"revealed\": false, \"state\": \"locked\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"skillgroup::key_1119\": {\"id\": \"skillgroup::key_1119\", \"type\": \"skillgroup\", \"label\": \"collaborating and liaising\", \"metadata\": {\"label\": \"collaborating and liaising\", \"type\": \"skillgroup\", \"originuri\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/af84405b-896d-4ed3-9462-077ea9a2a188\", \"uuidhistory\": \"ed2a8e7c-a98d-4885-8c03-a594784da771\\na8fc43d3-0ef2-47af-8f36-43ec997ed7b1\", \"code\": \"S1.2.5\", \"preferredlabel\": \"collaborating and liaising\", \"altlabels\": \"collaborating and liaising\", \"description\": \"Reaching out to outside agencies, clients and other organisational units to facilitate exchange of information. Collaborating and engaging with external and internal agencies and departments to adapt the timing and nature of the activities.\", \"scopenote\": \"Examples: \\n- contact event speakers\\n- liaise with auditors\"}, \"is_anchor\": false, \"depth\": 1, \"graph_id\": \"32c6b5d6-d77b-48ea-b7d9-c58d34d8e526\", \"challenge\": \"Recherchez et suivez un tutoriel en ligne sur collaborating and liaising. Pratiquez les concepts appris pendant au moins 3 heures.\", \"xp_reward\": 37, \"visible\": false, \"revealed\": false, \"state\": \"locked\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"occupation::key_16303\": {\"id\": \"occupation::key_16303\", \"type\": \"occupation\", \"label\": \"career guidance advisor\", \"metadata\": {\"label\": \"career guidance advisor\", \"type\": \"occupation\", \"originuri\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/5d0cc30d-068a-424c-8463-f42872a7149e\", \"uuidhistory\": \"61d8ffee-ade6-4f68-ae44-59c8d73c0d03\\n9e99e511-7f0c-4b10-9cd5-f912d921fd80\", \"occupationgroupcode\": \"2423\", \"code\": \"2423.1\", \"preferredlabel\": \"career guidance advisor\", \"altlabels\": \"school careers advisor\\ncareers officer\\ncareer coach\\ncareer guidance advisor\\ncareers advisor\\ncareer guidance education advisor\\neducational advisor\\ncareer guidance practitioner\\nmentor for prior learning\\ncareer guidance counsellor\\nschool career guidance advisor\\ncounsellor in career guidance\", \"description\": \"Career guidance advisors provide guidance and advice to adults and students on making educational, training and occupational choices and assist people in managing their careers, through career planning and career exploration. They help identify options for future careers, assist beneficiaries in the development of their curriculum and help people reflect on their ambitions, interests and qualifications. Career guidance advisors may provide advice on various career planning issues and make suggestions for lifelong learning if necessary, including study recommendations. They may also assist the individual in the search for a job or provide guidance and advice to prepare a candidate for recognition of prior learning.\", \"definition\": \"\", \"scopenote\": \"\", \"regulatedprofessionnote\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated\", \"occupationtype\": \"escooccupation\", \"islocalized\": \"false\"}, \"is_anchor\": false, \"depth\": 1, \"graph_id\": \"32c6b5d6-d77b-48ea-b7d9-c58d34d8e526\", \"challenge\": \"Recherchez et suivez un tutoriel en ligne sur career guidance advisor. Pratiquez les concepts appris pendant au moins 3 heures.\", \"xp_reward\": 25, \"visible\": false, \"revealed\": false, \"state\": \"locked\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"skillgroup::key_1020\": {\"id\": \"skillgroup::key_1020\", \"type\": \"skillgroup\", \"label\": \"developing objectives and strategies\", \"metadata\": {\"label\": \"developing objectives and strategies\", \"type\": \"skillgroup\", \"originuri\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6f89dcbe-4315-4533-8801-3aadf9190b86\", \"uuidhistory\": \"dd768f6d-6448-4a29-a920-04aa403ab586\\nffb2fd3a-5bcb-46e9-bea9-0f7d68c20417\", \"code\": \"S4.1\", \"preferredlabel\": \"developing objectives and strategies\", \"altlabels\": \"strategic planning\\ndeveloping objectives and strategies\", \"description\": \"Envisioning a future state and developing strategies, goals, objectives and action plans to achieve it.\", \"scopenote\": \"\"}, \"is_anchor\": false, \"depth\": 2, \"graph_id\": \"32c6b5d6-d77b-48ea-b7d9-c58d34d8e526\", \"challenge\": \"Recherchez et suivez un tutoriel en ligne sur developing objectives and strategies. Pratiquez les concepts appris pendant au moins 3 heures.\", \"xp_reward\": 22, \"visible\": false, \"revealed\": false, \"state\": \"locked\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"skill::key_1671\": {\"id\": \"skill::key_1671\", \"type\": \"skill\", \"label\": \"accounting department processes\", \"metadata\": {\"label\": \"accounting department processes\", \"type\": \"skill\", \"originuri\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/08371fe9-c658-4f6a-966f-71dbb0ab683d\", \"uuidhistory\": \"918d75a6-92b1-4d23-b0bf-87999db63a90\\n2fcb7822-2f81-4233-a2f8-c33bea3ca7ca\", \"skilltype\": \"knowledge\", \"reuselevel\": \"sector-specific\", \"preferredlabel\": \"accounting department processes\", \"altlabels\": \"accounting department processes\\naccounting processes\\naccounts department processes\\naccounting department procedures, accounting department methods\\naccounting department process\", \"description\": \"The different processes, duties, jargon, role in an organisation, and other specificities of the accounting department within an organisation such as bookkeeping, invoices, recording, and taxing.\", \"definition\": \"\", \"scopenote\": \"\", \"islocalized\": \"false\"}, \"is_anchor\": false, \"depth\": 2, \"graph_id\": \"32c6b5d6-d77b-48ea-b7d9-c58d34d8e526\", \"challenge\": \"Recherchez et suivez un tutoriel en ligne sur accounting department processes. Pratiquez les concepts appris pendant au moins 3 heures.\", \"xp_reward\": 39, \"visible\": false, \"revealed\": false, \"state\": \"locked\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"skill::key_11964\": {\"id\": \"skill::key_11964\", \"type\": \"skill\", \"label\": \"policy analysis\", \"metadata\": {\"label\": \"policy analysis\", \"type\": \"skill\", \"originuri\": \"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c5449667-9b40-4114-8d74-f51177669984\", \"uuidhistory\": \"7233b73f-0bf1-4e9a-beeb-b01f4715b669\\nf552b824-fd45-4fa2-953a-5ac7e66d186b\", \"skilltype\": \"knowledge\", \"reuselevel