presentations\ngiving presentations to the public\nconduct presentations to the public\npublic presentations giving\ngiving public presentations\nconducting presentations to the public\nconducting public presentations", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/fd446407-b08e-49da-b8e3-7e7c79618c3f", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Speak in public and interact with those present. Prepare notices, plans, charts, and other information to support the presentation.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "eb5d6d37-bda7-4264-8436-1f831c414eea\nc3355cf2-eb66-45cf-a95d-72728557c6be", "preferredlabel": "conduct public presentations"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Prepare and deliver a 15-minute presentation on a topic of your choice to a live audience of at least 10 people. The presentation should include visual aids and engage the audience through storytelling and interactive elements.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 53, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Effective Communication", "applications": ["Conducting presentations and public speaking", "Negotiating and resolving conflicts", "Collaborating with team members and stakeholders"], "justification": "Given the lack of specific information, strong communication skills are fundamental for any career path. They are essential for expressing ideas, collaborating with others, and building professional relationships.", "esco_description": "The skill of effective communication enables individuals to convey information clearly and concisely, actively listen to others, and adapt their communication style to different audiences. It involves articulating ideas, providing feedback, and fostering open dialogue in professional settings.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_5960", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "adapt to changing situations", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "cognitive", "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "adapt to changing situations", "altlabels": "adapting to changing situations\nadapting to a changing situation\nmodify to changing situations\nadapt to changing situations\nadjust to changing situations\nadapt to a changing situation\ntailor to changing situations\nalter to changing situations", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/5592ab32-4e7a-4cda-8e64-ca36d5de8a10", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Change approach to situations based on unexpected and sudden changes in people''s needs and mood or in trends; shift strategies, improvise and naturally adapt to those circumstances.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5e049b47-c427-4c40-8d9c-571bdd82d47c\n44582882-6023-4d87-a2b6-b3c9ecf3f0bb", "preferredlabel": "adapt to changing situations"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Passer une semaine dans une ville étrangère sans maîtriser la langue locale ni connaître la culture, en s''adaptant aux situations changeantes et en trouvant des solutions créatives pour communiquer, se déplacer et s''intégrer.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 82, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Adaptability", "applications": ["Adapting to new technologies and software", "Adjusting to changes in work processes and procedures", "Thriving in diverse and dynamic work environments"], "justification": "As a young professional entering the workforce, the ability to adapt to new situations and learn quickly will be crucial. This skill will support their career trajectory by enabling them to thrive in diverse environments and roles.", "esco_description": "Adaptability is the capability to adjust to new conditions and challenges, and to remain productive in changing environments. It involves quickly learning new processes, systems, and ways of working.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_8161", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "think critically", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "cognitive", "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "think critically", "altlabels": "weigh information\nassess information\ncheck facts\nevaluate important information\nevaluating information\ndetect bias\nevaluate opinions\nconsider alternative views\nassess facts\nassess opinions\nevaluate information and its sources\nevaluate information\ndistinguish fact from opinion\nevaluate truth\nassess processes\nverify information\ncritically evaluate information and its sources\nevaluate facts\nreview information\napply critical thinking\nthink critically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7dd94ad3-13d6-43fe-8b94-51fcbf67ced9", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Make and defend judgements based on internal evidence and external criteria. Critically evaluate the credibility and reliability of information before using or passing it on to others. Develop independent and critical thinking.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b49909ff-d5a7-4485-ba38-51806d8f3841\n9cedb574-55f2-4e23-b3fe-3180a0c22259", "preferredlabel": "think critically"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Select a complex social issue and critically analyze its various aspects, root causes, and potential solutions. Present your findings in a comprehensive report or presentation, highlighting the logical reasoning and evidence-based arguments.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 54, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Critical Thinking", "applications": ["Evaluating complex situations and making informed decisions", "Identifying and solving problems using logical reasoning", "Formulating effective strategies based on thorough analysis"], "justification": "Developing strong critical thinking skills will empower this individual to analyze problems, make informed decisions, and contribute meaningfully to their chosen industry. It is a foundational cognitive skill that is universally valuable.", "esco_description": "Analyzing and evaluating information to make reasoned judgments and decisions. It involves logical reasoning, problem-solving, and the ability to think systematically.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_13611", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "plan", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "leadership", "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "plan", "altlabels": "implement planning\ncomplete planning\nperform planning\nplanning performance\nplan activities\nperformance planning\nundertake planning\nplan ", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/e49f4158-9d4c-425d-bf32-dfe89b19840a", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Manage one''s time schedule and resources in order to finish tasks in a timely manner.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "0ea91738-1902-48d5-9c7a-94dfcf5025ef\n59e4b409-876b-44f2-890a-c4da1873082b", "preferredlabel": "plan "}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Développer un plan stratégique pour lancer une entreprise fictive dans un secteur de votre choix. Le plan doit inclure l''analyse de marché, la stratégie de produit, la stratégie de marketing, la planification financière et le plan opérationnel.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 55, "confidence": 0.7, "esco_label": "Time Management", "applications": ["Meeting project deadlines", "Balancing multiple tasks", "Optimizing work schedules"], "justification": "With no specific industry or job title provided, time management is a universally important skill. It will help them stay organized, meet deadlines, and balance their personal and professional responsibilities.", "esco_description": "Organizing and prioritizing tasks efficiently to meet deadlines and achieve objectives. It involves setting goals, planning, and allocating time effectively.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_2671", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "creatively use digital technologies", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "technical", "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "creatively use digital technologies", "altlabels": "creatively use digital technologies", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/1a4cc54f-1e53-442b-a6d2-1682dc8ef8f9", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Use digital tools and technologies to create knowledge and to innovate processes and products. Engage individually and collectively in cognitive processing to understand and resolve conceptual problems and problem situations in digital environments.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "56d5fadc-2a7e-4869-8fa7-be3eddd4240e\ne90f73d2-4acb-4487-826b-22074dc44f42", "preferredlabel": "creatively use digital technologies"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Develop a prototype for a mobile application that solves a real-world problem. The prototype should include a user interface design, basic functionality, and a brief project plan for implementation.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 51, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Digital Literacy", "applications": ["Using digital tools for research and data analysis", "Creating and editing digital content such as documents, presentations, and multimedia", "Communicating and collaborating through digital platforms and tools"], "justification": "In today''s digital age, having a strong foundation in digital literacy is essential for almost any career. This skill encompasses the ability to use digital tools, navigate online platforms, and adapt to technological advancements.", "esco_description": "Utilizing digital technologies to access, manage, integrate, evaluate, create, and communicate information effectively and ethically.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17344", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "advertising media planner", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "2431.10.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "advertising media planner", "altlabels": "media coordinator\nmedia manager\nmedia planning strategist\nmedia planner\njunior media planner\nmedia planner/buyer\nmedia planning manager\ndigital media planner\nsenior media planner\nadvertising media planner\nmedia planning expert\nmedia planning executive", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/b55718eb-e8ff-4485-8ad0-bbac32cbd77b", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Advertising media planners advise on the best communication media platforms to convey ideas. They analyse advertising plans in order to assess the aim and objective of the marketing strategy. They assess the potential and response rate that different communication channels might have on the transmission of a message related to a product, company, or brand.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "910c3859-7725-4279-9ddd-668519383c39\nd82296cb-80d4-491b-bf89-9b34fd0bfefa", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "advertising media planner", "occupationgroupcode": "2431", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Élaborez une stratégie publicitaire complète pour promouvoir un produit ou un service sur une plateforme numérique, en tenant compte des différents médias, des audiences cibles et des objectifs de performance.", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 84, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16121", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "advertising manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "1222.1.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "advertising manager", "altlabels": "advertising account planner\npromotions manager\nadvertising manager\nadvertising coordinator\nadvertising executive\nadvertising and promotions manager\ncampaigns coordinator\npromotions coordinator\nadvertising campaign manager\nmarketing communication manager\nadvertising director\nadvertising agency manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/4ebf2dae-c326-4627-befe-fbc91410f432", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Advertising managers perform the implementation of the advertising initiatives planned in the strategic marketing plan. They organise and prepare the resources needed to launch advertising campaigns and operations in advertising agencies. They prepare and align the communication channels, negotiate contracts, and ensure that operations adhere to budgets.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "1ce67cbf-dd6e-4a36-ad4d-05046fa8b5da\n8adb931a-494a-47e2-9768-dc3ad6ad91b1", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "advertising manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1222", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "Planifiez, exécutez et optimisez une campagne publicitaire sur les réseaux sociaux pour promouvoir un produit ou un service. Analysez les performances en termes de portée, d''engagement et de conversion, et apportez des ajustements pour maximiser les résultats.", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 97, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17485", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "public relations officer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "2432.9", "type": "occupation", "label": "public relations officer", "altlabels": "public relations coordinator\npress relations officer\npress consultant\npublic relations officer\ncommunications officer\npress secretary\nmedia relations officer\npublic affairs officer\npublic information officer\nmedia consultant\nmedia coordinator", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/c0489e22-6a1b-4e52-974a-eb71bbb42134", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Public relations officers represent a company or organisation to stakeholders and the public. They use communications strategies to promote an understanding of the activities and image of their clients in a favourable way.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "098cfb50-a19d-487c-a2a7-c5967dd43841\n3aea8dc0-284e-47d9-a893-7b737b5e3d4b", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "public relations officer", "occupationgroupcode": "2432", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "Organisez et menez une campagne de relations publiques intensive visant à obtenir une couverture médiatique positive dans au moins cinq grands médias nationaux ou internationaux.", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 66, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16479", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "public relations manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "1222.1.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "public relations manager", "altlabels": "public relations specialist\ncommunications manager\nspokesperson\ncommunications officer\npublic information manager\nmarketing and communications manager\n​public relations consultant\npublic affairs manager\npublicity manager\nmedia relations manager\npress office manager\npublic information coordinator\ncorporate profiler\ncorporate affairs manager\npublic relations manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/6cc19251-763b-4de1-b4f7-526c9ff732d2", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Public relations managers strive to convey and maintain a desired image or reputation of a company, individual, governmental institution, or organisation in general to the public and stakeholders at large. They use all sorts of media and events to promote the positive image of products, humanitarian causes or organisations. They attempt to ensure that all public communications portray clients the way they want to be perceived.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "36d8c71e-da3c-4cc3-b041-2ea8e5d5c628\neb2edab0-207d-4f81-962a-e3551ecd17da", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "public relations manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1222", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "Organize and execute a media relations campaign to promote a specific company event or product launch. This includes identifying target media outlets, crafting press releases, pitching stories to journalists, and securing media coverage.", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 75, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_11674", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "adapt existing designs to changed circumstances", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "adapt existing designs to changed circumstances", "altlabels": "adapt existing designs to circumstances that changed\nadapt existing designs to changing circumstances\nmodify designs according to changed circumstances\nvary existing designs to circumstances that changed\nadapt existing designs to changed circumstances", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c0733631-0c5e-4b5c-a291-aad52ca493ce", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Adapt an existing design to changed circumstances and ensure that the artistic quality of the original design is reflected in the final result.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "2db5dd3d-323a-4d39-ab1a-643db80ebd52\nc1a11eec-be88-4ad3-8c1e-eb48acf2a974", "preferredlabel": "adapt existing designs to changed circumstances"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15519", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "tanner", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "7535.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "tanner", "altlabels": "tanning worker\nchrome-tanning drum operator\ndrum tender\nretanning machine operator\nspray finishing machine operator\ntanning straightener\nbeamhouse operator\npit tanner\ntanning drum operator\ntanning vacuum dryer\ntanner\ntanning machine operator\ntawer\ndrum operator", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/1ce76c3b-edee-41b4-88c2-5db9b70d8bf0", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Tanners program and use tannery drums. They perform the work according to the work instructions, verify the physical and chemical characteristics of the hide, skin, or leather and of the liquid floats, e.g. pH, temperature, chemicals concentration, during the process. They use the drum for washing the hide or skin, removing the hair (not in the case of hides and skins tanned with the hair or wool on), bating, tanning, retanning, dyeing and milling.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "9be8f81e-f653-4922-9f78-e9ed3c286326\nc0af066a-98ba-4d63-8c62-c824f0bb1cfe", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "tanner", "occupationgroupcode": "7535", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_4914", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "identify technological needs", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "identify technological needs", "altlabels": "identify needs and technological responses\nidentify technological needs", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/42fcf80d-7b45-40f3-bd2f-5411c4c0dfa0", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Assess needs and identify digital tools and possible technological responses to address them. Adjust and customise digital environments to personal needs (e.g. accessibility).", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "ded20c6c-cc8f-4dee-a6f1-3e9945059b11\n7485a84c-1f62-4e5e-812e-ee4845ec1f59", "preferredlabel": "identify technological needs"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "The challenge is to conduct a comprehensive assessment of the technological needs within a specific industry or organization, identify potential areas for improvement, and propose actionable solutions. This could involve interviewing key stakeholders, analyzing current technology infrastructure, and researching industry best practices.", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 51, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16696", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "leather finishing operator", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "8155.1.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "leather finishing operator", "altlabels": "plating machine operator\nfinisher\nspray booth operator\nmilling drum operator\nfinishing range operator\nfinishing machinist\nleather finishing coating machine operator\nleather finishing operator\nfinishing operators\nleather embossing machine operator", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/7d99ed04-fda7-4f35-9f02-0db18078159c", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Leather finishing operators use machines for finishing leather according to the required specifications for surface characteristics, as provided by the client. Surface characteristics refer to colour nuance, quality, pattern and special properties, such as waterproofness, antiflame retardance, antifogging of the leather. They arrange the dosage of finishing mixes to apply to the leather and do the routine maintenance of the machinery.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "844a24ee-440e-46aa-9354-f012119b5ac0\n7aac1f26-641b-478d-b5d4-787936046730", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "leather finishing operator", "occupationgroupcode": "8155", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14326", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "monitor title procedures", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "monitor title procedures", "altlabels": "monitor property rights\nmonitor property title transfers\nmonitor property right procedures\nmonitor title procedures\nmonitor property right transfers", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f1621a21-ea45-4ee0-b738-5a5ca3882184", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Monitor the bundle of rights of a property and investigate all the parties involved in the current procedure, such as the transfer of a deed in the transfer of ownership of a property or the provision of all the documents serving as evidence of title, to ensure that all documentation and procedures occur according to legislation and contractual agreements.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5a177a99-56c2-408b-89e7-234b418aa750\nd4d7176d-353b-462c-957b-e3cfeed99e36", "preferredlabel": "monitor title procedures"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "The challenge is to review and document the title procedures for a real estate transaction, including researching local laws and regulations, compiling a comprehensive guide, and presenting it to a panel of experienced professionals for feedback.", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 67, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_11850", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "monitor loan portfolio", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "monitor loan portfolio", "altlabels": "monitor loan portfolio\nmonitor investment portfolio\nmonitor mortgage portfolio\nmonitor credit portfolio", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c35b19ad-b06f-44e8-be9f-c20c68750346", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Control the ongoing credit commitments in order to detect anomalies related to the schedules, refinancing, approval limits etc., and to identify improper disbursements.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "f603e2c3-6f88-4892-8373-cb833ab899b0\nd077c225-fc58-4475-81a8-d5c7d7012a60", "preferredlabel": "monitor loan portfolio"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_15121", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "assess your competencies in leading community arts", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "assess your competencies in leading community arts", "altlabels": "assess your competencies in leading dance\nassess your competencies in leading community arts\nevaluate your competencies in leading music\nevaluate your competencies in leading visual arts\nevaluate your competencies in leading community arts\nassess your competencies in leading visual arts\nevaluate your competencies in leading dance\nassess your competencies in leading theatre\nevaluate your competencies in leading theatre\nassess your competencies in leading music", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ff755c48-8597-4735-98ef-bc6081072c86", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "occupation-specific", "description": "Evaluate and communicate your skills in leading community activities, especially any other complementary experience that may be advantageous.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "e1143de8-ec41-4903-9a04-538aea8f8afc\n2575602f-5bdf-43aa-a908-6a35e9d91a7e", "preferredlabel": "assess your competencies in leading community arts"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_6629", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "identify suspicious behaviour", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "identify suspicious behaviour", "altlabels": "identify suspicious behavior\nspot suspicious behaviour\nspot suspect behaviour\nidentify behaviour which is suspicious\nidentify distrustful behaviour\nidentify suspect behaviour\nspot distrustful behaviour\nidentify suspicious behaviour", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/61a3f3ea-d34c-478d-9b41-c8adb09e6631", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Rapidly spot and identify individuals or customers who behave suspiciously and keep them under close observation.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a2905889-ec8e-48d7-ba93-5d601a5725a7\n9efe8405-eb70-461b-8e7a-dd364f737e22", "preferredlabel": "identify suspicious behaviour"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "Durant une semaine, observez et consignez toute activité suspecte dans votre quartier. Cela peut inclure des comportements inhabituels, des interactions louches ou tout autre signe de comportement suspect.", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 81, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1009", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "planning and organising", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "T2.2", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "planning and organising", "altlabels": "organisational skills\nplanning activities\nplanning abilities\nwork planning\nplanning skills\nplanning and organising", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/66fdc34c-2326-4baa-b8ff-7a1d1015fe3a", "scopenote": "", "description": "Direct activities and tasks, establish schedules and coordinate the activities of groups and individuals to complete objectives on time and within budget.  ", "uuidhistory": "94fa35f2-9d28-4ebd-be8a-392f668ad05e\n1a2578ad-848e-4e1d-b90c-8cc063f9b311", "preferredlabel": "planning and organising"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Pendant une semaine, planifie et organise chaque heure de tes journées pour maximiser ton efficacité. Utilise des outils de gestion du temps et de planification pour optimiser tes tâches et atteindre tous tes objectifs professionnels et personnels.", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 42, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_3495", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "plan art educational activities", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "plan art educational activities", "altlabels": "plan art educational activities\nplan art activities that are educational\nimplement educational art activities\ncoordinate educational art events\nplan educational art activities", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/28c4b670-ae54-4120-97b0-b20c4c470cc4", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Plan and implement artistic facilities, performance, venues and museum-related educational activities and events.", "islocalized":