tion officer\nbodyguard\npersonal safety worker\npersonal protection officer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/f8e435dd-7aa9-4d7a-97c3-b3b5789b6b25", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Bodyguards offer protection to their clients against injury, attacks and harassment. They accompany individuals such as politicians and actors to various events and gatherings. Bodyguards observe the surrounding environment, anticipate threats and respond to security emergencies. They may carry and use guns.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "68c02a82-dc5f-47d3-8cc9-fc0c763c37d3\n57742628-a2f7-4148-a9d9-8ad08adda4e3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "bodyguard", "occupationgroupcode": "5414", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16544", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "store detective", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "3411.8.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "store detective", "altlabels": "SD\nstore detective\nloss prevention agent\nretail loss investigator\nasset protection officer\nloss prevention officer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/71c3a49a-e55e-42ce-bd3f-31f37d3cfab6", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Store detectives monitor the activities in the store in order to prevent and detect shoplifting. Once the individual is caught red-handed, they take all the legal measures, including announcing the police.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "70f82623-1dbe-4253-b242-9f83371ab5e6\ncdab7a8c-5812-4956-9fe6-a4f25aa8a762", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "store detective", "occupationgroupcode": "3411", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_7139", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "organise information, objects and resources", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "organise information, objects and resources", "altlabels": "structure information\norganise resources\nhave organisational skills\ndemonstrate organizational skills\nrecord information\ntake in information\norganise information, objects and resources", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6b305973-8993-475f-bd8a-daf037c61401", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Understand your tasks and the processes that go with them. Organize information, objects and resources using systematic methods and according to given standards and ensure that the task is mastered. ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "08328b82-f310-4d0f-b5f1-80683a8b47b6\na0e813dd-5d79-46cc-87fe-f273ba5fe99c", "preferredlabel": "organise information, objects and resources"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1053", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "thinking skills and competences", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "T2", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "thinking skills and competences", "altlabels": "cognitive skills and competences\nuse of reason and logic\nthinking skills and competences", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/8267ecb5-c976-4b6a-809b-4ceecb954967", "scopenote": "", "description": "Skills and competences relating to the ability to apply the mental processes of gathering, conceptualizing, analysing, synthesizing, and/or evaluating information gathered from, or generated by, observation, experience, reflection, reasoning, or communication. They include the ability to evaluate and use information of different kinds to plan activities, achieve goals, solve problems, deal with issues and perform complex tasks in routine and novel ways.", "uuidhistory": "b1109b38-659a-42c5-94f3-51e2a8c37127\n7530b797-2536-40fb-a5dc-def572992988", "preferredlabel": "thinking skills and competences"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_8765", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "develop educational activities", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "develop educational activities", "altlabels": "develop activities to educate\ndevelop educational workshops\ndevelop educational activities\nparticipate in activities related to arts education\ndevelop activities that are educational", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/88cc9573-e12f-4915-a915-5c3ee19891cb", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Develop speeches, activities and workshops in order to foster access and comprehension to the artistic creation processes. It can address a particular cultural and artistic event such as a show or an exhibition, or it can be related to a specific discipline (theatre, dance, drawing, music, photography etc.). Liaise with storytelles, craftspeople and artists.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "04e4a83f-e7e3-4029-a942-32469a323af4\n9073a96f-b501-40a9-81ff-4a50f6c2a2f2", "preferredlabel": "develop educational activities"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15976", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "drawing artist", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "2651.6", "type": "occupation", "label": "drawing artist", "altlabels": "cartoon artist\nstreet artist\ndrawing artist\nvisual art expert\nartist\nillustrator", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/42ff9e52-1f56-427d-b772-b9328c39b98a", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Drawing artists express concepts by providing a drawn representation corresponding to the idea.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5d4c2100-0325-42e1-86d5-d27bdd62eb51\nf959dff7-8b7f-4998-9278-fdbd36ecb7d8", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "drawing artist", "occupationgroupcode": "2651", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1041", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "developing educational programmes", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "S4.1.6", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "developing educational programmes", "altlabels": "developing educational programmes", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7e0b93e0-0de7-4607-b07f-27a6828d3ff0", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- develop curriculum\n- construct individual learning plans\n- develop training programmes", "description": "Developing education and training programs, plans, or procedures for society in general, specific groups or tailored to an individual''s learning needs.", "uuidhistory": "7ac2b79c-f6a6-43cd-980b-11ca6e206966\n773469f7-bf54-4c56-a75a-5a568f5361a9", "preferredlabel": "developing educational programmes"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16984", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "conceptual artist", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visibl