04472f5025e", "preferredlabel": "using digital tools for collaboration and productivity"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_3176", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "identify digital competence gaps", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "identify digital competence gaps", "altlabels": "identify digital competence gaps", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/238343b1-7b51-42b3-a9ed-cf24d3a236e7", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Understand where one’s own digital competence needs to be improved or updated. Be able to support others with their digital competence development. Seek opportunities for self-development and keep up-to-date with the digital evolution.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a3753d49-186d-4400-922f-08af9de3ae47\n7e3f4866-565b-401a-8c59-d5c582fdeb63", "preferredlabel": "identify digital competence gaps"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17110", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "sign maker", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "7316.4", "type": "occupation", "label": "sign maker", "altlabels": "traffic sign maker\nsign installer\nsignboard writer\nroad sign maker\nsign writer\nsign maintenance worker\nsign maker\nsignboard maker\nsignwriter\nadvertising sign maker\nroad sign installer\nroad sign maintenance worker", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/a1b4eb5e-45d4-441b-a7e8-795ac5cf6fbf", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Sign makers design and develop signs for a variety of uses such as flyers, traffic signs, billboards and business signs. They use different materials and techniques and if necessary they install the sign on site. Furthermore they also perform maintenance and repairs.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5163fb20-d39f-4f58-aea4-75c68a73b568\n4b3e188e-acbc-46f6-b804-ed3df5499456", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "sign maker", "occupationgroupcode": "7316", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15271", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "automated fly bar operator", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "3435.4", "type": "occupation", "label": "automated fly bar operator", "altlabels": "automation operator & programmer\nautomated fly bar operator\nlead automation operator\nautomated fly bar technician\nautomation programmer & operator\ntheatre automated rigging operator\nautomation programmer and operator\nstage automation operator\nautomation operator and programmer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/08edf4c5-3551-4690-9d09-f9b8b9194c90", "scopenote": "Includes rigging operators. \n Includes people working in event and rental activities.", "definition": "", "description": "Automated fly bar operators control the movements of sets and other elements in a performance based on the artistic or creative concept, in interaction with the performers. Their work is influenced by and influences the results of other operators. Therefore, the operators work closely together with the designers, operators and performers. Automated fly bar operators prepare and supervise the setup, program the equipment and operate automated fly bar systems, rigging systems or systems for horizontal movement. Their work is based on plans, instructions and calculations. The manipulation of heavy loads close to or above performers and audience makes this a high risk occupation. \n \n ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "c87abbec-3582-414e-9260-76c1c260d8ca\n2227e3e9-87d7-4a02-a0bc-0c56cdc86f89", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "automated fly bar operator", "occupationgroupcode": "3435", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_2455", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "understand artistic concepts", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "understand artistic concepts", "altlabels": "understand artistic concepts\ninterpret artist''s concept\nunderstand an artist''s concept\nuse artistic concepts\nunderstand concepts of art", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/1633770e-5606-4422-b293-6c8c551fe663", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Interpret an artist''s explanation or demonstration of their artistic concepts, inceptions and processes and strive to share their vision.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "1e477be4-b6ef-4eb1-8cf4-7def41bce0f3\n9f913265-7dc1-4046-bfe3-55d52e4b6511", "preferredlabel": "understand artistic concepts"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17099", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "pyrotechnic designer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "3435.19", "type": "occupation", "label": "pyrotechnic designer", "altlabels": "pyrotechnician & choreographer\npyro designer\npyrotechnical designer\npyrotechnician and choreographer\npyrotechnic designer\npyrotechnic operator and choreographer\npyro-designer\npyrotechnic operator & choreographer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/a0ebd342-8f89-4947-893d-fee9468cf001", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Pyrotechnic designers develop a pyrotechnical design concept for a performance and supervise the execution of it. Their work is based on research and artistic vision. Their design is influenced by and influences other designs and must be conform with these designs and the overall artistic vision. Therefore, the pyrotechnic designers work closely with artistic directors, operators and the artistic team. During rehearsals and performance they coach the operators to obtain optimal timing and manipulation. Pyrotechnic designers develop plans, cue lists and other documentation to support the operators and production crew. Pyrotechnic designers sometimes also work as autonomous artists, creating pyrotechnical art outside a performance context.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "1f56ba1c-0f8e-4f69-af19-f506c719814b\n574e07be-2501-4acb-b344-75793d26ce42", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "pyrotechnic designer", "occupationgroupcode": "3435", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_4962", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "digital marketing techniques", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "digital marketing techniques", "altlabels": "web marketing techniques\non-line marketing techniques\nonline marketing techniques\ndigital marketing techniques", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/43dfbe7f-9e10-4871-b171-e5076737b4cf", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "The marketing techniques used on the web to reach and engage with stakeholders, customers and clients.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "53e05415-b086-47ee-bc43-039c22d99ba9\n34fa4fe5-b1ca-46b6-9330-e279d9c53c41", "preferredlabel": "digital marketing techniques"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_937", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "developing financial, business or marketing plans", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "S4.1.2", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "developing financial, business or marketing plans", "altlabels": "developing financial, business or marketing plans", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/37272760-957a-4c34-b4f3-780ee285334d", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- Develop business case\n- Draw up marketing and sales plan\n- Create a financial plan", "description": "Envision and develop strategies and plans for companies and organisations aimed at purposes such as establishing new markets, refurbishing the equipment and machinery of a company, implementing pricing strategies, and restoring or maintaining financial viability.", "uuidhistory": "4666888d-a4b0-41d0-87f3-425bf2e563c2\n55304a64-8d3c-46e8-bd46-4aed8d4116da", "preferredlabel": "developing financial, business or marketing plans"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14183", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "mobile marketing", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "mobile marketing", "altlabels": "cell phone  marketing\nmobile marketing", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ef069fe6-305b-4452-8f7d-0c572e98effc", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "The study of marketing which uses mobile devices as a communication channel. This approach can provide potential customers with personalised information (using location or time context) which promotes products, services or ideas.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "c11ea43d-7b32-4969-a07c-32fb2f9be991\ncee947d7-bb00-4d91-a265-06a94aada97f", "preferredlabel": "mobile marketing"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_1723", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "plan marketing strategy", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "plan marketing strategy", "altlabels": "plan marketing strategies\narrange marketing strategy\norganise marketing strategy\nplanning a marketing strategy\nplan a marketing strategy\nplan marketing strategy\nproject marketing strategy\ndesign marketing strategy", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/08fd2839-670c-4f16-8024-97437f2035ab", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Determine the objective of the marketing strategy whether it is for establishing image, implementing a pricing strategy, or raising awareness of the product. Establish approaches of marketing actions to ensure that goals are achieved efficiently and over a long term.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "400443a9-a367-4b83-aa47-6094ce0ed5e2\n432ee6b9-cb0e-4f8e-ba1b-c36818af3b8c", "preferredlabel": "plan marketing strategy"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_2894", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "develop musical ideas", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "develop musical ideas", "altlabels": "develop musical ideas\ndevelop ideas for music\ninvent musical ideas\ngenerate musical ideas\ndeveloping musical ideas\nproduce musical ideas", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/1e3e7f8b-6416-43ed-af07-a1fb71c5e292", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Explore and develop musical concepts based on sources such as imagination or environmental sounds.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "2ca04d63-9542-4cb3-a330-3980cc57166e\n310fa8fa-4ec5-4d53-8c5a-0fb635a3a0a2", "preferredlabel": "develop musical ideas"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_12014", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "think creatively", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "think creatively", "altlabels": "visualise completed work\nanticipate needs\ninnovate\nbrainstorming\nthink creatively\nwork conceptually\nfind new ideas\nvisualise completed project\nuse imagination\ndesign\nseek out questions\nthinking creatively\nexperiment\nthink in a creative way\nshow originality\ninnovative thinking", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c624c6a3-b0ba-4a31-a296-0d433fe47e41", "scopenote": "Includes people performing activities outside the artistic or aesthetic contexts.", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Generate new ideas or combine existing ones to develop innovative, novel solutions.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5b341dba-9fe5-4a1d-885f-7604660821e7\naa81944e-216a-4920-8fa3-c798352fc30f", "preferredlabel": "think creatively"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15957", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "body artist", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "3435.5", "type": "occupation", "label": "body artist", "altlabels": "tattoo studio assistant\nhenna artist\ntattooist\ntattoo artist\nbody piercer\ntattooer\ntattoo studio attendant\nbody artist", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/40da2fc6-8cb4-4cd3-8fe3-899715905070", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Body artists decorate clients'' skin temporarily or permanently. They use various techniques such as tattooing or piercing. Body artists follow clients'' preferences in terms of tattoo''s or piercing''s design and body surface and apply it safely. They also advise on methods to avoid infection following the procedures on clients'' bodies.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "9f6514d6-9f08-4b2e-a433-052121f5753e\nd604e63e-fcab-4e27-a881-29a3a97c6c55", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "body artist", "occupationgroupcode": "3435", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16194", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "advertising assistant", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "4419.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "advertising assistant", "altlabels": "executive advertising assistant\nadvertising space clerk\nadvertising trainee\nadvertising assistant\npublicity assistant\nadvertising campaign assistant\nadvertising clerk", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/54cba39a-5bb8-4e4c-89cd-d6097d3c6c3a", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Advertising assistants provide support in all the operations carried out in advertising departments or advertising agencies. They ensure that administrative activities are handle and sort out. They communicate with the staff of the advertisement department and with external clients. Moreover, they have understanding of the operations in advertising as to assist with the pragmatic implementation of plans and tasks carried out by managers and consultants and for being involved in creating content for use both on-line or in print.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "0723526f-7a78-413c-babe-23131c81c555\n3e87c44a-9fcf-452f-bc37-24f33a304d10", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "advertising assistant", "occupationgroupcode": "4419", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17724", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "occupation::key_17724", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "358e9c63-9619-4227-a7bd-8019e970367a", "metadata": {"code": "2166.5", "type": "occupation", "label": "digital artist", "node_id": "occupation::key_17724", "altlabels": "digital compositor\ndigital games artist\ndigital sculptor\ncomputer-generated imagery artist\ndigital designer and animator\ncomputer artist\ndigital artist\ndigital matte painter\nspecial effects digital artist\ndigital environment artist\ndigital scupltress\ndigital matte artist\n3D digital artist\n3D digital matte painter", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/d5c4ab26-c293-4f4d-ad89-fe776f49a67f", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Digital artists create art which applies digital technology as an essential part of the creative process. Digital art is usually created using computers or more specialised digital equipment. It may be enjoyed using the same instruments, shared over the internet, or presented using more traditional media.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "26ee9d3f-a98f-4ef1-913f-c48919f0205b\nbb2f924a-4234-41b4-afe5-8c3989ca48ce", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "p