on Skills", "esco_description": "The skill of effective communication enables individuals to convey information clearly and concisely, actively listen to others, and adapt their communication style to different audiences. It involves articulating ideas, providing feedback, and fostering open dialogue in professional settings."}, {"id": "skill::key_5960", "score": 0.37645411500000003, "category": "cognitive", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "adapt to changing situations", "node_id": "skill::key_5960", "altlabels": "adapting to changing situations\nadapting to a changing situation\nmodify to changing situations\nadapt to changing situations\nadjust to changing situations\nadapt to a changing situation\ntailor to changing situations\nalter to changing situations", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/5592ab32-4e7a-4cda-8e64-ca36d5de8a10", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Change approach to situations based on unexpected and sudden changes in people''s needs and mood or in trends; shift strategies, improvise and naturally adapt to those circumstances.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5e049b47-c427-4c40-8d9c-571bdd82d47c\n44582882-6023-4d87-a2b6-b3c9ecf3f0bb", "preferredlabel": "adapt to changing situations"}, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Adaptability", "applications": ["Adapting to new technologies and software", "Adjusting to changes in work processes and procedures", "Thriving in diverse and dynamic work environments"], "justification": "As a young professional entering the workforce, the ability to adapt to new situations and learn quickly will be crucial. This skill will support their career trajectory by enabling them to thrive in diverse environments and roles.", "original_label": "Adaptability", "esco_description": "Adaptability is the capability to adjust to new conditions and challenges, and to remain productive in changing environments. It involves quickly learning new processes, systems, and ways of working."}, {"id": "skill::key_8161", "score": 0.294193685, "category": "cognitive", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "think critically", "node_id": "skill::key_8161", "altlabels": "weigh information\nassess information\ncheck facts\nevaluate important information\nevaluating information\ndetect bias\nevaluate opinions\nconsider alternative views\nassess facts\nassess opinions\nevaluate information and its sources\nevaluate information\ndistinguish fact from opinion\nevaluate truth\nassess processes\nverify information\ncritically evaluate information and its sources\nevaluate facts\nreview information\napply critical thinking\nthink critically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7dd94ad3-13d6-43fe-8b94-51fcbf67ced9", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Make and defend judgements based on internal evidence and external criteria. Critically evaluate the credibility and reliability of information before using or passing it on to others. Develop independent and critical thinking.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b49909ff-d5a7-4485-ba38-51806d8f3841\n9cedb574-55f2-4e23-b3fe-3180a0c22259", "preferredlabel": "think critically"}, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Critical Thinking", "applications": ["Evaluating complex situations and making informed decisions", "Identifying and solving problems using logical reasoning", "Formulating effective strategies based on thorough analysis"], "justification": "Developing strong critical thinking skills will empower this individual to analyze problems, make informed decisions, and contribute meaningfully to their chosen industry. It is a foundational cognitive skill that is universally valuable.", "original_label": "Critical Thinking", "esco_description": "Analyzing and evaluating information to make reasoned judgments and decisions. It involves logical reasoning, problem-solving, and the ability to think systematically."}, {"id": "skill::key_13611", "score": 0.28703421399999995, "category": "leadership", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "plan", "node_id": "skill::key_13611", "altlabels": "implement planning\ncomplete planning\nperform planning\nplanning performance\nplan activities\nperformance planning\nundertake planning\nplan ", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/e49f4158-9d4c-425d-bf32-dfe89b19840a", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Manage one''s time schedule and resources in order to finish tasks in a timely manner.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "0ea91738-1902-48d5-9c7a-94dfcf5025ef\n59e4b409-876b-44f2-890a-c4da1873082b", "preferredlabel": "plan "}, "confidence": 0.7, "esco_label": "Time Management", "applications": ["Meeting project deadlines", "Balancing multiple tasks", "Optimizing work schedules"], "justification": "With no specific industry or job title provided, time management is a universally important skill. It will help them stay organized, meet deadlines, and balance their personal and professional responsibilities.", "original_label": "Time Management", "esco_description": "Organizing and prioritizing tasks efficiently to meet deadlines and achieve objectives. It involves setting goals, planning, and allocating time effectively."}, {"id": "skill::key_2671", "score": 0.278332055, "category": "technical", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "creatively use digital technologies", "node_id": "skill::key_2671", "altlabels": "creatively use digital technologies", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/1a4cc54f-1e53-442b-a6d2-1682dc8ef8f9", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Use digital tools and technologies to create knowledge and to innovate processes and products. Engage individually and collectively in cognitive processing to understand and resolve conceptual problems and problem situations in digital environments.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "56d5fadc-2a7e-4869-8fa7-be3eddd4240e\ne90f73d2-4acb-4487-826b-22074dc44f42", "preferredlabel": "creatively use digital technologies"}, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Digital Literacy", "applications": ["Using digital tools for research and data analysis", "Creating and editing digital content such as documents, presentations, and multimedia", "Communicating and collaborating through digital platforms and tools"], "justification": "In today''s digital age, having a strong foundation in digital literacy is essential for almost any career. This skill encompasses the ability to use digital tools, navigate online platforms, and adapt to technological advancements.", "original_label": "Digital Literacy", "esco_description": "Utilizing digital technologies to access, manage, integrate, evaluate, create, and communicate information effectively and ethically."}], "generation_method": "graph_traversal"}', '2025-06-10 05:46:01.100927');
