lable", "visible": true, "category": "leadership", "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "apply strategic thinking", "altlabels": "apply strategic thinking techniques\napply strategic thinking\napply techniques for strategic thinking\nmove strategically\nthink strategically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6c870993-9341-438b-91c0-c7fe4f96d8f5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Apply generation and effective application of business insights and possible opportunities, in order to achieve competitive business advantage on a long-term basis.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a71b991a-32ab-4549-be36-4e1937acc883\n964c1d63-681d-4f91-9a0a-0ab87a57fcd8", "preferredlabel": "apply strategic thinking"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "The challenge is to analyze a real-life case study of a business problem and develop a strategic plan to address it. The participant will need to consider various factors such as market conditions, competition, and internal capabilities to formulate a well-reasoned strategic solution.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 27, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Entrepreneurial Thinking", "applications": ["Identifying new business opportunities", "Developing innovative solutions to economic challenges", "Taking calculated risks to drive business growth"], "justification": "As the user aims to create companies and build relations between things, an entrepreneurial mindset would support their career goal. This skill aligns with the user''s leadership qualities, creativity, and interest in business and leadership (Holland RIASEC - Enterprising).", "esco_description": "The ability to identify opportunities, take calculated risks, and drive innovation in business and economic contexts. It involves a proactive mindset, strategic decision-making, and a focus on creating value and seizing opportunities.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_13533", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "motivate others", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "interpersonal", "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "motivate others", "altlabels": "inspire others\nmotivate others\nstimulate action\nenergise others\nempower others\nencourage others\nmotivating others\nmotivate staff and colleages", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/e2d44a9b-f28c-489e-9861-b654b5ded507", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Direct other people''s behaviour by providing them with a convincing reason for action.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "59bee618-e902-4c5f-af76-6e70b8b95df3\na8ca50f4-0f97-4961-8d3a-4a5f5f163790", "preferredlabel": "motivate others"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Trouvez et partagez chaque jour une citation inspirante avec une personne différente pendant une semaine, en expliquant pourquoi elle vous motive.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 50, "confidence": 0.9, "esco_label": "Influencing Others", "applications": ["Negotiating contracts and agreements", "Building consensus in team decision-making", "Motivating and persuading others to achieve organizational objectives"], "justification": "The user''s ability to attract attention, make connections, and understand others'' motives highlights their strength in interpersonal influence. Developing this skill further would enhance the user''s capacity to inspire and lead others, aligning with their career aspirations and natural abilities.", "esco_description": "Influencing others involves persuading and convincing individuals or groups to adopt a certain course of action or belief through effective communication and interpersonal skills. It requires the ability to build rapport, negotiate, and inspire others to achieve common goals.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14407", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "forecast economic trends", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "technical", "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "forecast economic trends", "altlabels": "project economic trends\neconomic trend forecasting\nforecast economic trends\nanalyse economic trends\npredict economic trends\nforecasting of economic trends\neconomic trend forecasts", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f2a34d6b-131a-4b8f-a110-898b9c91d18f", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Gather and analyse economic data in order to predict economic trends and events.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5e187514-cb05-4521-94d0-8f854d9e197b\nbb6b2ce8-10c6-4707-b1b4-1bfb511fffd4", "preferredlabel": "forecast economic trends"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Collectez des données sur l''évolution du PIB, du chômage, et des dépenses publiques dans votre région au cours des 5 dernières années. Analysez ces données pour identifier les tendances économiques et prévoir les perspectives à court terme.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 30, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Data Analysis", "applications": ["Interpreting economic indicators to inform policy decisions", "Developing forecasting models for economic trends", "Evaluating the impact of economic policies and market changes"], "justification": "Considering the user''s interest in economics, hands-on practicality, and analytical nature, developing data analysis skills would provide a solid foundation for understanding and interpreting numerical information in complex business and economic contexts.", "esco_description": "Analyzing data to identify trends, patterns, and insights, enabling evidence-based decision-making and strategic planning.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_1648", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "creative", "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "altlabels": "propose technical solutions to business problems\npropose ICT solutions to business problems", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/07e51c60-763a-4335-b4ec-70a15f66d328", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Suggest how to solve business issues, using ICT means, so that business processes are improved.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "57bfedf4-70e2-4736-a01e-ed696a50518a\n2949f643-88a5-411e-83d2-109f0749a45a", "preferredlabel": "propose ICT solutions to business problems"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Identify a local business and propose an ICT solution to improve their operations or address a specific challenge. This could involve implementing a new software, optimizing their network infrastructure, or developing a custom application.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 22, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Problem Solving", "applications": ["Developing new business strategies in the economics industry", "Designing and implementing innovative economic models", "Creating unique solutions to economic challenges"], "justification": "Given the user''s high creativity rating, interest in philosophy, and desire to work in complex environments, developing creative problem-solving skills would allow them to approach challenges with innovative solutions and align with their natural strengths.", "esco_description": "The ability to identify and analyze complex problems, and develop innovative and effective solutions using a creative approach.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1018", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "developing objectives and strategies", "notes"