/4c715719-3c3f-4058-ba00-9b2ef34848e8", "scopenote": "Includes people working in public relations departments. \nIncludes people working with larger companies'' relations with shareholders and investors through marketing and communication.", "definition": "", "description": "Investor relations managers disseminate the investment strategy of the company and monitor the reactions of the investment community towards it. They use marketing, financial, communications, and security law expertise to ensure transparent communication to the larger community. They respond to inquiries from shareholders and investors in relation to the company''s financial stability, stocks, or corporate policies.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "1763e7f5-248f-4e7e-b8d7-dabc4aafe8e6\n71438621-f76d-44f9-8ed3-c216be5878d3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "investor relations manager", "occupationgroupcode": "2412", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15612", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "corporate investment banker", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "2412.6.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "corporate investment banker", "altlabels": "operational investment banker\ninvestment banking associate\ninvestment banker\ncorporate investment adviser\ncorporate investment strategist\ncorporate banker\ncorporate investment banker", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/244a79eb-122b-4bee-8065-b4c39efce4ff", "scopenote": "Includes people performing activities to monitor the compliance of legal regulations and to advise on financial transactions and deals. \nIncludes people performing research and analysis. \nExcludes people performing investor relations management.", "definition": "", "description": "Corporate investment bankers offer strategic advice on financial services to companies and other institutions. They ensure that legal regulations are being followed by their clients in their efforts of raising any capital. They provide technical expertise and information on mergers and acquisitions, bonds and shares, privatisations and reorganisation, raising capital and security underwriting, including equity and debt markets.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "e4a8aaef-b4d3-4d33-a383-3034fe444e9a\n09ced50a-6413-4e74-8f31-2de05f0726e5", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "corporate investment banker", "occupationgroupcode": "2412", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17687", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "corporate banking manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "2412.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "corporate banking manager", "altlabels": "cash management officer\ncorporate banking officer\ncorporate banking centre manager\ncash management adviser\ncorporate banker\ncash management manager\ncommercial banking accounts officer\ncorporate banking manager\nbusiness banking officer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/d2d451cc-e839-4192-be54-d7724814aa03", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Corporate banking managers offer advice on a broad range of financial goods and services such as securities services, credit services, cash management, insurance products, leasing, information on merges and acquisitions and capital markets activities, to institutions and organisations.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "c67bce40-172f-4e07-8fa7-8abad20697da\n5bbe0b6d-807f-42ba-bda8-55c642f862bf", "occupationtype": "e