b09184-9feb-459e-b942-699d2c8992fc\n37680638-ff24-46ef-869d-51deba2ca45c", "preferredlabel": "delegate responsibilities"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_10918", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "build team spirit", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "build team spirit", "altlabels": "design team building\nplan team building\nproject team building\narrange team building\norganise a team\nbuild teams\nbuild team spirit", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b19e0820-a96f-4c0a-a724-3c056180c1b3", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Build a relationship of mutual trust, respect and cooperation among members of the same team.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "081bbfac-4b71-4f43-95d5-50112e322e43\n6ac9f232-25bd-4219-b2d4-c58ad028bdcf", "preferredlabel": "build team spirit"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_901", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "giving feedback", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "S1.8.3", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "giving feedback", "altlabels": "giving feedback", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/23cfb269-eec1-4011-8e57-c86203ce9fd7", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- provide feedback on job performance\n- give constructive feedback", "description": "Providing founded feedback on the performance of subordinates, co-workers and students through both criticism and praise in a respectful, clear, and consistent manner. Highlighting achievements as well as mistakes and set up methods of formative assessment.", "uuidhistory": "94f890f5-db44-4269-8cad-51324e8fdb18\n7a802c76-6b6c-4878-82a2-792d18bb4141", "preferredlabel": "giving feedback"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17961", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "minister of religion", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "2636.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "minister of religion", "altlabels": "nun\nspiritual leader\npastor\nminister of the church\npriest\nmember of the clergy\nreligious minister\nchurch minister\nminister of religion\ndeacon\nmonk\nordained clergyman\nbishop", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/ed256ed0-0432-4969-8544-3e5e01a517a9", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Ministers of religion lead religious organisations or communities, perform spiritual and religious ceremonies and provide spiritual guidance to members of a particular religious group. They may undertake missionary work, pastoral or preaching work, or work within a religious order or community, such as a monastery or convent. Ministers of religion perform duties such as leading worship services, giving religious education, officiating at funerals and marriages, counselling congregation members and offer a range of other community services, both in conjunction with the organisation they work for, and through their own personal day to day activities.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "fd04b352-4b47-49e1-b365-590e4905929e\ne4491189-03bc-4aea-acb2-72c53ae5241e", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "minister of religion", "occupationgroupcode": "2636", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17152", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "chaplain", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "2636.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "chaplain", "altlabels": "imam\nchaplain\nuniversity chaplain\nlay representative\nprison chaplain\nhospital chaplain\nrabbi\nmilitary chaplain", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/a4dd6eae-ca75-456f-829d-333671a7c186", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Chaplains perform religious activities in secular institutions. They perform counselling services and provide spiritual and emotional support to the people in the institution, as well as cooperate with priests or other religious officials to support religious activities in the community.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "cac94741-0d6e-4ed1-9d1a-71795c5d14d0\n466d04c9-eddb-4bbc-8413-389b5c5692de", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "chaplain", "occupationgroupcode": "2636", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16415", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "pastoral worker", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "3413.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "pastoral worker", "altlabels": "parish worker\nlay worker\nchurch pastoral worker\nministry pastoral worker\npastoral worker\nreligious worker", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/665266cb-50dd-44a5-a920-ab04c67e251a", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Pastoral workers support religious communities. They provide spiritual education and guidance and implement programmes such as charity works and religious rites. Pastoral workers also assist ministers and help participants in the religious community with social, cultural or emotional problems.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "38668099-df36-44f2-9f21-bcc5317d8aec\n592fd3bb-8f92-42fb-8765-38ac63dcf5ca", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "pastoral worker", "occupationgroupcode": "3413", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1130", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "leading and motivating", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "S4.5.0", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "leading and motivating", "altlabels": "leadership\nleading and motivating", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b7e752ec-7b2e-46e6-ac24-8b1233609c31", "scopenote": "Excludes:\n- Managing, leading or supervising a team or its members.\n\nExamples:\n- Motivate employees\n- Provide leadership\n- Lead board meetings", "description": "Reinforcing an organization''s vision, inspiring and enthusing others to achieve positive outcomes. The focus of this group is on skills in motivating and inspiring others, rather than on managing and supervising a team.", "uuidhistory": "2292ff76-8385-448d-a2cb-be900376cf49\neb25c0a3-5a3b-4b31-af1e-8cd45119eff5", "preferredlabel": "leading and motivating"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17760", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "business coach", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "2424.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "business coach", "altlabels": "professional development coach\nleadership coach\nbusiness development coach\npractitioner of business coaching\ncoach in business development\nbusiness leadership coach\npersonal development coach\nbusiness coach\ncorporate coach\nexecutive coach", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/d9612966-e295-4d81-ba2b-9f36bad0b392", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Business coaches guide employees of a company or other institution in order to improve their personal effectiveness, increase their job satisfaction, and positively impact their career development in the business setting. They do this by leading the coachee (the person who is being coached) to resolution of their challenges by their own means. Business coaches aim to address specific tasks or reach specific goals, as opposed to overall development.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "804d485e-bdc2-4c6f-a796-af0f984715f8\na5c56e8c-cd93-431b-b8b5-f5b987255590", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "business coach", "occupationgroupcode": "2424", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16523", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "marketing manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "1221.3.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "marketing manager", "altlabels": "sales and marketing manager\npromotions manager\ntelemarketing manager\nmarket development manager\nmarketing director\nmarketing and promotions manager\nmarketing manager\nadvertising sales manager\nmarketing executive\nmarket manager\nproduct marketing manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/6fcf4638-e7c7-4978-9302-9a7b63a3d57c", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Marketing managers carry out the implementation of efforts related to the marketing operations in a company. They develop marketing strategies and plans by detailing cost and resources needed. They analyse the profitability of these plans, develop pricing strategies, and strive to raise awareness on products and companies among targeted customers.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "dfe24c26-b6a0-4d18-9c0b-4475aca161a5\n09d60a71-c124-4922-b983-5cfc3d5e2673", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "marketing manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1221", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16476", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "chief executive officer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "1120.3", "type": "occupation", "label": "chief executive officer", "altlabels": "managing director\nsenior executive officer\nCEO\nchief executive officer\npresident\nchairman", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/6c3fd65e-2d24-47d8-bc22-9e93512bdcc2", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Chief executive officers hold the highest ranking in a pyramidal corporate structure. They are able to hold a complete idea of the functioning of the business, its departments, risks, and stakeholders. They analyse different kinds of information and create links among them for decision-making purposes. They serve as a  communication link with the board of directors for reporting and implementation of the overall strategy.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "c9b0ed99-513c-4b95-b129-7c05bc5b37d6\need36ec6-490d-4ba3-a58e-7d92135fb679", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "chief executive officer", "occupationgroupcode": "1120", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15935", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "sports coach", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "3422.3", "type": "occupation", "label": "sports coach", "altlabels": "sports instruction practitioner\nsport coach for performance\nsports instructor\nsports trainer for the elderly\ncoach of sport\nsport coach for participation\nchildren sports trainer\ncoach in sports\nsports trainer\ninstructor in sport\nsports coach\nsport coach\npractitioner of sports coaching\nsports coach for children", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/3e9c1262-4fe2-4eb1-bf94-4fe64498393a", "scopenote": "Includes people performing scouting and recruiting activities. \n Includes people performing instruction activities of non-team sports such as martial arts or yoga. \n Excludes <a resource=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/11695786-9fb7-4895-b161-0480419107e4\" typeOf=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/model#Occupation\" href=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/11695786-9fb7-4895-b161-0480419107e4\"><span property=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label\" xml:lang=\"en\">sports instructor</span></a>.", "definition": "", "description": "Sports coaches provide instruction in the sport of their specialisation in a recreational context to non-age-specific and age specific participants. They identify already acquired skills and implement suitable training programmes for the groups or individuals they teach in order to develop participants'' physical and psychological fitness. They create the most optimal environment for the growth of participant skills and enable them to maximise their performance, while fostering good sportsmanship and character in all participants. Sports coaches also track the participant progress and provide personalised instruction where needed. They supervise sports facilities and changing rooms and maintain uniforms and equipment.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a2051642-90fc-44a5-9c70-0273378d42e8\nd028a808-d6bc-47d6-8ab2-6fb58b0aa9c1", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "sports coach", "occupationgroupcode": "3422", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15893", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "football coach", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "3422.3.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "football coach", "altlabels": "football trainer\nfootball team manager\nsoccer coach\nassociation football coach\nfootball instructor\nfootball team coach\nfootball team trainer\nfootball manager\nfootball team instructor\nfootball coach", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/3b43dafb-8c6b-4906-9fe5-bc218aacad55", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Football coaches train amateur or professional football teams of either youths or adults. Football coaches develop and execute training plans and improve or maintain their players physical condition, football technique and tactical abilities. They prepare their team for competitions and choose the line-up and tactics for a game. During a game coaches may give instructions from the sidelines and are in charge of substituting players. ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "d8ec6ab9-23f5-461f-9408-aaeecd8629cc\nd9fd3900-e7ba-4f9f-ac43-dc557a0f922a", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "football coach", "occupationgroupcode": "3422", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17315", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "tennis coach", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "3422.4.7", "type": "occupation", "label": "tennis coach", "altlabels": "mini tennis coach\ntennis coach\ntennis trainer\nperformance tennis coach\ncardio tennis coach\ntennis teacher\ntennis instructor\nhead tennis coach", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/b3086ad2-1f3c-4a60-9bdb-8b4746989d4b", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": " Tennis coaches advise and guide individuals and groups on playing tennis. They conduct lessons and teach the rules and techniques of the sport such as grips, strokes and serves. They motivate their clients and help improve their performance.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "27810504-e33e-4a30-a150-119d3e5d608d\n5f6c5060-43bc-412a-9fbf-45368dcef50a", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "tennis coach", "occupationgroupcode": "3422", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17102", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "physical education teacher secondary school", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "2330.1.15", "type": "occupation", "label": "physical education teacher secondary school", "altlabels": "high school PE teacher\nphysical education teacher high school\nPE teacher in secondary school\nphysical education tutor secondary school\nsecondary school teacher of physical education\nhigh school physical education teacher\nPE teacher\nphysical education teacher\nteacher of physical education in secondary schools\nsecondary school physical education tutor\nphysical education teacher secondary school", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/a10849c1-f0d8-4600-bca6-9549c2517650", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Physical education teachers at secondary schools provide education to students, commonly children and young adults, in a secondary school setting. They are usually subject teachers, specialised and instructing in their own field of study, physical education . They prepare lesson plans and materials, monitor the students’ progress, assist individually when necessary, and evaluate the students’ knowledge and performance on the subject of physical education through practical, usually physical, tests and examinations.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "6bd731df-eb2e-4d84-a44e-9d16894ac46e\nd40e7256-afd3-45d3-b073-3f87f576cb1f", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "physical education teacher secondary school", "occupationgroupcode": "2330", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_11964", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "policy analysis", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "policy analysis", "altlabels": "policy analysis", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c5449667-9b40-4114-8d74-f51177669984", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Understanding of the basic tenets of policymaking in a specific sector, its implementation processes and its consequences.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "7233b73f-0bf1-4e9a-beeb-b01f4715b669\nf552b824-fd45-4fa2-953a-5ac7e66d186b", "preferredlabel": "policy analysis"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_2215", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "international trade", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "international trade", "altlabels": "international trading\nworld wide trade\ninternational commerce\ninternational trade\nglobal trade", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/11cbcf7f-8dc3-4c9a-9ec1-37f51b5cbc19", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The economic practise and study field that address the exchange of goods and services across geographic borders. The general theories and schools of thought around the implications of international trade in terms of exports, imports, competitivity, GDP, and role of multinational companies.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a296d8cb-1b41-4c49-9d67-196990bb38ae\n05d1d5ed-ec68-4813-acb9-d80f5f2eabef", "preferredlabel": "international trade"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_3073", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "international tariffs", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "international tariffs", "altlabels": "international cargo tariffs\ninternational duties\ninternational tariffs on transported goods\ninternational duties on transported goods\nimport-export duties\ninternational taxes\ninternational levies\nimport-export taxes\nimport-export levies\ninternational tariffs\nimport-export tariffs\ninternational cargo duties", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/21a3967a-dca2-4efa-9e5f-943f15527a47", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Know international tariffs, taxes, or duties that must be paid on a particular class of import or export materials.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "7e9fc490-e608-4574-9079-79ee310eef23\n3e0bed61-60d7-4d19-9c5d-0258c4bd8fe9", "preferredlabel": "international tariffs"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_4353", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "advise on economic development", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "advise on economic development", "altlabels": "instruct on economic development\nhelp with fiscal policy\nrecommend economic progress\ncommend economic development\ninstruct on economic progress\nadvise on economic development\nhelp with economic development\nrecommend economic development\ncommend economic progress", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/384ed14c-bf1f-4a65-aef6-6e711f43c4ce", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Advise organisations and institutions on the factors and steps they could take which would promote and ensure economic stability and growth.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "9f3514ba-f4cd-4099-a8f5-bdbfde9bfe60\nd8f78e1e-6fb3-41a0-b310-1a8e0d960dfd", "preferredlabel": "advise on economic development"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15410", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "commercial sales representative", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "5a1478de-2757-4edd-a8c0-d051cf2419fb", "metadata": {"code": "3322.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "commercial sales representative", "altlabels": "technical and commercial sales executive\nterritory manager\ncommercial sales representative\nsales and marketing consultant\nsales executive\nfield sales consultant\nbusiness development representative\ncommercial sales consultant\nsales and marketing executive\nfield sales executive\ncommercial saleswoman\ntechnical and commercial sales consultant\ncommercial sales executive\ncommercial salesperson\nfield sales representative\ncommercial salesman\ntechnical and commercial sales representative\nsales consultant\nsales representative", 