gic Thinking", "esco_description": "Strategic thinking involves analyzing complex situations, identifying key issues, and developing long-term plans to achieve organizational goals."}, {"id": "skill::key_7226", "score": 0.309822917, "category": "leadership", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "apply strategic thinking", "node_id": "skill::key_7226", "altlabels": "apply strategic thinking techniques\napply strategic thinking\napply techniques for strategic thinking\nmove strategically\nthink strategically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6c870993-9341-438b-91c0-c7fe4f96d8f5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Apply generation and effective application of business insights and possible opportunities, in order to achieve competitive business advantage on a long-term basis.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a71b991a-32ab-4549-be36-4e1937acc883\n964c1d63-681d-4f91-9a0a-0ab87a57fcd8", "preferredlabel": "apply strategic thinking"}, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Entrepreneurial Thinking", "applications": ["Identifying new business opportunities", "Developing innovative solutions to economic challenges", "Taking calculated risks to drive business growth"], "justification": "As the user aims to create companies and build relations between things, an entrepreneurial mindset would support their career goal. This skill aligns with the user''s leadership qualities, creativity, and interest in business and leadership (Holland RIASEC - Enterprising).", "original_label": "Entrepreneurial Mindset", "esco_description": "The ability to identify opportunities, take calculated risks, and drive innovation in business and economic contexts. It involves a proactive mindset, strategic decision-making, and a focus on creating value and seizing opportunities."}, {"id": "skill::key_13533", "score": 0.303159297, "category": "interpersonal", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "motivate others", "node_id": "skill::key_13533", "altlabels": "inspire others\nmotivate others\nstimulate action\nenergise others\nempower others\nencourage others\nmotivating others\nmotivate staff and colleages", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/e2d44a9b-f28c-489e-9861-b654b5ded507", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Direct other people''s behaviour by providing them with a convincing reason for action.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "59bee618-e902-4c5f-af76-6e70b8b95df3\na8ca50f4-0f97-4961-8d3a-4a5f5f163790", "preferredlabel": "motivate others"}, "confidence": 0.9, "esco_label": "Influencing Others", "applications": ["Negotiating contracts and agreements", "Building consensus in team decision-making", "Motivating and persuading others to achieve organizational objectives"], "justification": "The user''s ability to attract attention, make connections, and understand others'' motives highlights their strength in interpersonal influence. Developing this skill further would enhance the user''s capacity to inspire and lead others, aligning with their career aspirations and natural abilities.", "original_label": "Interpersonal Influence", "esco_description": "Influencing others involves persuading and convincing individuals or groups to adopt a certain course of action or belief through effective communication and interpersonal skills. It requires the ability to build rapport, negotiate, and inspire others to achieve common goals."}, {"id": "skill::key_14407", "score": 0.304641187, "category": "technical", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "forecast economic trends", "node_id": "skill::key_14407", "altlabels": "project economic trends\neconomic trend forecasting\nforecast economic trends\nanalyse economic trends\npredict economic trends\nforecasting of economic trends\neconomic trend forecasts", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f2a34d6b-131a-4b8f-a110-89