ing and implementing innovative economic models", "Creating unique solutions to economic challenges"], "justification": "Given the user''s high creativity rating, interest in philosophy, and desire to work in complex environments, developing creative problem-solving skills would allow them to approach challenges with innovative solutions and align with their natural strengths.", "original_label": "Creative Problem Solving", "esco_description": "The ability to identify and analyze complex problems, and develop innovative and effective solutions using a creative approach."}], "generation_method": "graph_traversal"}', '2025-06-10 05:47:26.767467');
