", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c68af615-b24c-4719-a199-c4141e08f2bd", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "occupation-specific", "description": "Encourage parties to communicate among them and share their views on events and happenings in order to find cooperation paths.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a7598cf6-f21e-41a5-91e1-37d81bef66e9\nf53fab7a-b3d8-40a5-97f0-b0e4585f65f4", "preferredlabel": "promote communication between parties"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Le défi consiste à convaincre un groupe de personnes de participer à une collecte de fonds pour une cause sociale. Il faudra préparer un discours persuasif, identifier les arguments clés, et présenter la proposition de manière claire et convaincante.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 28}, {"id": "skill::key_11531", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "Entrepreneurial Thinking", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "aff663bd-d57f-4919-ad9c-45332ee14b4a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "show entrepreneurial spirit", "node_id": "skill::key_11531", "altlabels": "identify opportunities\ndemonstrate entrepreneurship\nshow entrepreneurial spirit\ndisplay entrepreneurial spirit\nreveal entrepreneurial spirit\ndemonstrate willingness to take risks\nshowing entrepreneurial spirit\ndemonstrate entrepreneurial spirit\nshowing an entrepreneurial spirit\npursue opportunities\nshow an entrepreneurial spirit\nexhibit entrepreneurial spirit", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/bdcf429c-5ccf-4c3d-bb61-4c987573a35e", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Develop, organise and manage an own business venture, identifying and pursuing opportunities and mobilising resources, keeping in mind a profitability perspective. Demonstrate a proactive attitude and determination to achieve success in business ", "islocalized": "false", "uu