eativity in the team\nstimulating creativity in the team\nencourage creativity in the team\nfacilitate creativity in the team\nsupport creativity in the team\nstimulate creativity in the team", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ccdf3597-5c80-410f-896d-e1bdfa223de9", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Use techniques like brainstorming to stimulate creativity in the team.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "07711af5-ef64-4dc0-ae1a-68848e2c8785\neb601b85-638b-4e85-959b-fbcfadae1ada", "preferredlabel": "stimulate creativity in the team"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Le défi consiste à identifier un problème réel dans votre communauté ou environnement et à proposer une solution innovante pour y faire face. Cela pourrait être lié à l''environnement, à la technologie, à la santé, à l''éducation, ou à tout autre domaine qui vous passionne. Vous devrez présenter votre solution de manière créative et convaincante.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 29}], "anchors": ["skill::key_7226", "skill::key_12039", "skill::key_11531", "skill::key_5129", "skill::key_12391"], "graph_id": "aff663bd-d57f-4919-ad9c-45332ee14b4a", "anchor_metadata": [{"id": "skill::key_7226", "score": 0.20095241100000005, "category": "cognitive", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "apply strategic thinking", "node_id": "skill::key_7226", "altlabels": "apply strategic thinking techniques\napply strategic thinking\napply techniques for strategic thinking\nmove strategically\nthink strategically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6c870993-9341-438b-91c0-c7fe4f96d8f5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Apply generation and effective application of business insights and possible opportunities, in order to achieve competitive business advantage on a long-term basis.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a71b991a-32ab-4549-be36-4e1937acc883\n964c1d63-681d-4f91-9a0a-0ab87a57fcd8", "preferredlabel": "apply strategic thinking"}, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Strategic Thinking", "applications": ["Developing business strategies to gain competitive advantage", "Anticipating market trends and adapting business plans accordingly", "Aligning organizational resources with long-term goals"], "justification": "Given the user''s interest in philosophy and complex environments, strategic thinking will help in analyzing and solving complex problems in business and leadership roles. This skill aligns with the user''s critical thinking and leadership strengths.", "original_label": "Strategic Thinking", "esco_description": "Strategic thinking involves analyzing complex situations, identifying key issues, and developing long-term plans to achieve organizational objectives. It requires the ability to anticipate future trends and challenges, and to make informed decisions based on thorough analysis."}, {"id": "skill::key_12039", "score": 0.357934117, "category": "interpersonal", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "promote communication between parties", "node_id": "skill::key_12039", "altlabels": "encourage communication between parties\npromoting communication between parties\nadvocate communication between parties\npromote communication between parties\npromote intra-party communication", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c68af615-b24c-4719-a199-c4141e08f2bd", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "occupation-specific", "description": "Encourage parties to communicate among them and share their views on events and happenings in order to find cooperation paths.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a7598cf6-f21e-41a5-91e1-37d81bef66e9\nf53fab7a-b3d8-40a5-97f0-b0e4585f65f4", "preferredlabel": "promote communication between parties"}, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Effective Communication", "applications": ["Conducting effective meetings and discussions", "Negotiating and resolving conflicts", "Building rapport and fostering teamwork"], "justification": "The user''s ability to attract attention and understand others'' motives aligns with the need for strong interpersonal communication skills. This skill is crucial for building relations between people and companies, as mentioned in the user''s career goals.", "original_label": "Interpersonal Communication", "esco_description": "The ability to convey information clearly and effectively, listen actively, and engage in productive dialogue with others. It involves understanding and adapting to different communication styles and using verbal and non-verbal cues to convey messages."}, {"id": "skill::key_11531", "score": 0.323475897, "category": "leadership", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "show entrepreneurial spirit", "node_id": "skill::key_11531", "altlabels": "identify opportunities\ndemonstrate entrepreneurship\nshow entrepreneurial spirit\ndisplay entrepreneurial spirit\nreveal entrepreneurial spirit\ndemonstrate willingness to take risks\nshowing entrepreneurial spirit\ndemonstrate entrepreneurial spirit\nshowing an entrepreneurial spirit\npursue opportunities\nshow an entrepreneurial spirit\nexhibit entrepreneurial spirit", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/bdcf429c-5ccf-4c3d-bb61-4c987573a35e", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Develop, organise and manage an own business venture, identifying and pursuing opportunities and mobilising resources, keeping in mind a profitability perspective. Demonstrate a proactive attitude and determination to achieve success in business ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "691675d1-3b75-42e3-bbeb-f9bf54929f95\n452294a2-e93a-4bf7-9c1d-0c66372b8f33", "preferredlabel": "show entrepreneurial spirit"}, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Entrepreneurial Thinking", "applications": ["Developing new business ventures", "Identifying market opportunities for growth", "Driving organizational change and adaptation"], "justification": "Considering the user''s interest in creating companies and working in complex environments, an entrepreneurial mindset will help in identifying opportunities, taking calculated risks, and inspiring others to achieve goals. This skill aligns with the user''s leadership and enterprising interests.", "original_label": "Entrepreneurial Mindset", "esco_description": "The ability to identify opportunities, take calculated risks, and drive innovation in business and economic contexts. It involves a proactive mindset, creativity, and a willingness to challenge the status quo."}, {"id": "skill::key_5129", "score": 0.354718804, "category": "cognitive", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "think analytically", "node_id": "skill::key_5129", "altlabels": "think in an analytical way\ndevelop an analytical approach\nanalytical thinking\nuse logical reasoning\napply structural analysis\napply structured thinking\nthink analytically\nthink logically\napply logical thinking", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/4707da90-9cfc-46ca-8de0-38a0b7bfb137", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Produce thoughts using logic and reasoning in order to identify the strengths and weaknesses of alternative solutions, conclusions or approaches to problems.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "8dc44153-ab3d-4cac-b83d-5436baf86f2a\nd2e6d45b-dc4e-439e-8239-5f9d0e9699e3", "preferredlabel": "think analytically"}, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Analytical Problem-Solving", "applications": ["Conducting economic research and analysis", "Developing economic models and forecasts", "Evaluating policy implications and economic impacts"], "justification": "The user''s high ratings in critical thinking and investigative career interest indicate a strong analytical mindset. Developing analytical problem-solving skills will support the user''s goal of working in complex environments and addressing psychological and numerical aspects of problem-solving.", "original_label": "Analytical Problem-Solving", "esco_description": "Applies logical reasoning and critical thinking to identify and solve complex problems in an analytical manner. Utilizes data, evidence, and systematic approaches to develop effective solutions."}, {"id": "skill::key_12391", "score": 0.36646992, "category": "creative/leadership", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "stimulate creativity in the team", "node_id": "skill::key_12391", "altlabels": "stimulates creativity in the team\nstimulating creativity in the team\nencourage creativity in the team\nfacilitate creativity in the team\nsupport creativity in the team\nstimulate creativity in the team", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ccdf3597-5c80-410f-896d-e1bdfa223de9", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Use techniques like brainstorming to stimulate creativity in the team.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "07711af5-ef64-4dc0-ae1a-68848e2c8785\neb601b85-638b-4e85-959b-fbcfadae1ada", "preferredlabel": "stimulate creativity in the team"}, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Innovative Leadership", "applications": ["Leading cross-functional teams to develop and implement innovative strategies", "Fostering a culture of creativity and experimentation within an organization", "Guiding teams to generate and implement novel solutions to complex challenges"], "justification": "The user''s creativity and leadership strengths can be further enhanced by developing creative leadership skills. This skill will help in inspiring others, making meaningful connections, and leading in complex environments, aligning with the user''s career goals and unique quality of attracting attention and understanding motives.", "original_label": "Creative Leadership", "esco_description": "The ability to lead and inspire teams to generate and implement creative and innovative solutions, fostering a culture of experimentation and forward-thinking."}]}', '2025-06-10 05:52:41.276936');
