label": "import export manager", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "c6177bfe-d2ee-4546-b327-e99f3ce285d0", "metadata": {"code": "1324.3.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "import export manager", "altlabels": "senior export manager\ngraduate international trade compliance manager\nassistant international trade compliance manager\nsenior international trade manager\ntrainee import export manager\nsenior import manager\nimport export manager\ngraduate customs compliance manager\ngraduate import export manager\nsenior customs compliance manager\ntrainee international trade manager\nassistant import manager\nassistant export manager\ngraduate import manager\nassistant customs compliance manager\ntrainee international trade compliance manager\ntrainee import manager\nassistant international trade manager\ngraduate export manager\ntrainee customs compliance manager\ntrainee export manager\nsenior international trade compliance manager\ngraduate international trade manager\nassistant import export manager\nsenior import export manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/b87a7a27-ee74-4e5e-b274-84a3cab27bf4", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Import export managers install and maintain procedures for cross-border business, coordinating internal and external parties.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "fb808c05-845b-43da-9947-ae278a842ae8\nee219eb2-8c98-4302-91b0-89b5703904e1", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "import export manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1324", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_694", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "management and administration", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "c6177bfe-d2ee-4546-b327-e99f3ce285d0", "metadata": {"code": "", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "management and administration", "altlabels": "management and administration", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/isced-f/0413", "scopenote": "", "description": "Management and administration is the study of planning, directing and operating the functions and activities of organizations and institutions. Programmes in management also including administration, economics, finance etc. are included here if emphasis is given to management and administration.\nProgrammes and qualifications with the following main content are classified here:\nAdministration\nEducational management\nEmployment management\nEntrepreneurship\nHealth administration\nLogistic management\nManagement science\nOffice management\nOrganizational theory and behaviour\nPersonnel administration\nPersonnel management\n''Start your own business'' courses\nSupply change management\nTraining management\n\n=== Inclusions:\nStudy of leadership in the context of management is included here.\n\n=== Exclusions:\nTraining in leadership in the context of personal development is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0031 ''Personal skills''.\nStudy of administration in the meaning of office work is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0415 ''Secretarial and office work''.", "uuidhistory": "9aaa99f4-d19b-4042-a645-f375a7c49506\na0c8360b-e40e-4383-92cb-6c0ce4fb9e8d", "preferredlabel": "management and administration"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15654", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "drone pilot", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "c6177bfe-d2ee-4546-b327-e99f3ce285d0", "metadata": {"code": "3153.4", "type": "occupation", "label": "drone pilot", "altlabels": "unmanned aircraft pilot\nremote piloted aircraft (RPA) pilot\ndrone operator\nunmanned aircraft systems operator\nunmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs) pilot\ncivil drone operator\ndrone pilot", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/27a88c48-1d09-4a8c-a82a-a61ea16476d9", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Drone pilots remotely operate unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs). They navigate the drone as well as activate other equipment as cameras, sensors as LIDARS to calculate distances, or any other instrumentation.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "6d347e21-40fc-424a-897d-03772c98b6b5\n04197517-7bb3-4864-9b77-2eccf25a1803", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "drone pilot", "occupationgroupcode": "3153", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1119", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "collaborating and liaising", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "c6177bfe-d2ee-4546-b327-e99f3ce285d0", "metadata": {"code": "S1.2.5", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "collaborating and liaising", "altlabels": "collaborating and liaising", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/af84405b-896d-4ed3-9462-077ea9a2a188", "scopenote": "Examples: \n- contact event speakers\n- liaise with auditors", "description": "Reaching out to outside agencies, clients and other organisational units to facilitate exchange of information. Collaborating and engaging with external and internal agencies and departments to adapt the timing and nature of the activities.", "uuidhistory": "ed2a8e7c-a98d-4885-8c03-a594784da771\na8fc43d3-0ef2-47af-8f36-43ec997ed7b1", "preferredlabel": "collaborating and liaising"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15952", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "mediator", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "c6177bfe-d2ee-4546-b327-e99f3ce285d0", "metadata": {"code": "2619.9", "type": "occupation", "label": "mediator", "altlabels": "alternative dispute resolution coordinator\nmediator\nadvice worker\nlabour mediator\nfamily mediator\nlegal intermediary\nconciliator\nmediation commissioner\nlabor mediator\narbitrator\nconflict mediator", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/403be630-8d1e-43b7-9f07-098aca5bb689", "scopenote": "Excludes people performing resolution of legal process by making the final decision. \n Excludes <a resource=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/666846b2-01ce-43f6-8cb7-f3be09fac4a2\" typeOf=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/model#Occupation\" href=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/666846b2-01ce-43f6-8cb7-f3be09fac4a2\"><span property=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label\" xml:lang=\"en\">ombudsman</span></a>.", "definition": "", "description": "\nMediators resolve disputes between two parties by examining the case, interviewing both parties, and advising on a solution which would be the most beneficial for them. They listen to both parties in order to facilitate communication and find a fair agreement and organise meetings. They aim at resolving disputes through dialogue and alternative solution without having to take the case to litigation and courts. Mediators ensure that the resolution is compliant with legal regulations and is also enforced.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "3de2e976-d6a3-4811-8e95-49798a4d1f26\nf804c80a-dc7a-467e-8852-83a108b1b3e3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "mediator", "occupationgroupcode": "2619", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1195", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "analysing financial and economic data", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "c6177bfe-d2ee-4546-b327-e99f3ce285d0", "metadata": {"code": "S2.7.3", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "analysing financial and economic data", "altlabels": "analysing financial and economic data", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d94e1143-3a3a-4f6a-a881-df93bf56cf23", "scopenote": "Excludes:\n- Risk analysis\n- Using ICT tools to analyse and process data.\n\nExamples:\n- Forecast economic trends\n- Prepare financial projections\n- Consult credit scores", "description": "Analysing and evaluating information and data on finances and on economic and market trends.", "uuidhistory": "5b97c59f-e8fd-4c77-bce9-78570968bb4c\n5ea7fb86-e2e7-4cd1-a4c6-95770db8cebd", "preferredlabel": "analysing financial and economic data"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_9668", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "financial analysis", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "c6177bfe-d2ee-4546-b327-e99f3ce285d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "financial analysis", "altlabels": "economic audit\nfinancial analysis\nbusiness analysis\ncommercial analysis\neconomic analysis\nfiscal audit\nfiscal analysis", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/99571e68-801f-49af-a897-5f75996642e1", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The process of assessing the financial possibilities, means, and status of an organisation or individual by analysing financial statements and reports in order to make well informed business or financial decisions.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "51bd907f-16b1-4853-aede-fc367cc2cbb8\nad156d42-4499-4d0a-8a6d-09fa1aa05165", "preferredlabel": "financial analysis"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_2782", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "pricing strategies", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph