": "apply strategic thinking", "altlabels": "apply strategic thinking techniques\napply strategic thinking\napply techniques for strategic thinking\nmove strategically\nthink strategically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6c870993-9341-438b-91c0-c7fe4f96d8f5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Apply generation and effective application of business insights and possible opportunities, in order to achieve competitive business advantage on a long-term basis.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a71b991a-32ab-4549-be36-4e1937acc883\n964c1d63-681d-4f91-9a0a-0ab87a57fcd8", "preferredlabel": "apply strategic thinking"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "The challenge is to analyze a real-world case study and develop a strategic plan to address a specific business problem. The participant will need to consider various factors, such as market trends, competition, and organizational capabilities, to formulate a well-thought-out strategy.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 50, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Strategic Thinking", "applications": ["Developing business strategies to gain a competitive advantage", "Evaluating market trends and making informed decisions", "Identifying opportunities for organizational growth and sustainability"], "justification": "Given the user''s interest in philosophy, complex environments, and desire to work in a leadership role, strategic thinking aligns with their cognitive strengths and career goals. It involves analyzing situations, understanding connections between various elements, and making decisions that impact others.", "esco_description": "The ability to analyze complex situations, anticipate future trends, and develop long-term plans to achieve organizational goals.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_12645", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "identify new business opportunities", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "leadership", "graph_id": "cdfe83e4-83d0-416b-be7a-2e178c68f3de", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "identify new business opportunities", "altlabels": "diagnose new business opportunities\nidentify a new business opportunity\nidentifying new business opportunities\nclassify new business opportunities\nidentifying a new business opportunity\ndetermine new business opportunities\nidentify new business opportunities\nanalyse new business opportunities", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d207a30b-2f80-4138-9b77-f88d549b8768", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Pursue potential customers or products in order to generate additional sales and ensure growth.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "abdb4e2f-3780-4e3c-bd6d-1282f9d4b531\n184d0ed3-30ec-4414-aa4e-025fc90ecf7c", "preferredlabel": "identify new business opportunities"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Conduct market research to identify potential new business opportunities in a specific industry or market segment. This can include analyzing consumer trends, competitor analysis, and identifying unmet needs or gaps in the market.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 37, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Business Development", "applications": ["Identifying new market segments for expansion", "Developing and implementing sales strategies", "Creating and managing business partnerships"], "justification": "The user''s interest in creating companies and building relations between things, coupled with their leadership skills and desire to work in an enterprising environment, makes entrepreneurship a critical anchor skill. It involves taking initiative, understanding market dynamics, and creating value through innovative solutions.", "esco_description": "Identifying new business opportunities, creating business plans, and implementing strategies to grow a company''s market share.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_12039", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "promote communication between parties", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "interpersonal", "graph_id": "cdfe83e4-83d0-416b-be7a-2e178c68f3de", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "promote communication between parties", "altlabels": "encourage communication between parties\npromoting communication between parties\nadvocate communication between parties\npromote communication between parties\npromote intra-party communication", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c68af615-b24c-4719-a199-c4141e08f2bd", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "occupation-specific", "description": "Encourage parties to communicate among them and share their views on events and happenings in order to find cooperation paths.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a7598cf6-f21e-41a5-91e1-37d81bef66e9\nf53fab7a-b3d8-40a5-97f0-b0e4585f65f4", "preferredlabel": "promote communication between parties"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Organize and participate in at least three language exchange sessions with peers or friends. Spend equal time communicating in each other''s native languages and provide constructive feedback to each other.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 23, "confidence": 0.9, "esco_label": "Effective Communication", "applications": ["Conducting effective meetings and negotiations", "Building and maintaining professional relationships", "Resolving conflicts and addressing concerns"], "justification": "Given the user''s ability to attract attention, make connections, and understand others'' motives, developing strong interpersonal communication skills is essential for their career trajectory. It involves effectively conveying ideas, building relationships, and inspiring others, aligning with their leadership potential.", "esco_description": "The skill of interpersonal communication enables individuals to convey information clearly and effectively, listen actively, and build rapport with others. It involves the ability to articulate thoughts and ideas with confidence and professionalism.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_1648", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "creative", "graph_id": "cdfe83e4-83d0-416b-be7a-2e178c68f3de", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "altlabels": "propose technical solutions to business problems\npropose ICT solutions to business problems", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/07e51c60-763a-4335-b4ec-70a15f66d328", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Suggest how to solve business issues, using ICT means, so that business processes are improved.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "57bfedf4-70e2-4736-a01e-ed696a50518a\n2949f643-88a5-411e-83d2-109f0749a45a", "preferredlabel": "propose ICT solutions to business problems"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Sélectionnez une petite entreprise locale et identifiez un défi ou un problème auquel elle est confrontée. Ensuite, proposez une solution basée sur les technologies de l''information et de la communication pour résoudre ce problème. Présentez votre proposition de manière claire et convaincante.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 28, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Problem Solving", "applications": ["Developing new business strategies in the field of economics", "Designing and implementing innovative economic models", "Creating and optimizing financial processes and systems"], "justification": "With a high creativity rating and interest in complex environments, developing creative problem-solving skills is crucial. This skill involves generating innovative solutions, thinking outside the box, and addressing challenges in a unique and impactful way, aligning with the user''s cognitive strengths and career aspirations.", "esco_description": "The ability to creatively identify, analyze, and solve complex problems by generating innovative and effective solutions.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14407", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "forecast economic trends", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "technical", "graph_id": "cdfe83e4-83d0-416b-be7a-2e178c68f3de", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "forecast economic trends", "altlabels": "project economic trends\neconomic trend forecasting\nforecast economic trends\nanalyse economic trends\npredict economic trends\nforecasting of economic trends\neconomic trend forecasts", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f2a34d6b-131a-4b8f-a110-898b9c91d18f", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Gather and analyse economic data in order to predict economic trends and events.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5e187514-cb05-4521-94d0-8f854d9e197b\nbb6b2ce8-10c6-4707-b1b4-1bfb511fffd4", "preferredlabel": "forecast economic trends"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Choisissez une ville ou une région spécifique et effectuez une analyse des tendances économiques actuelles, en mettant l''accent sur les secteurs clés tels que l''emploi, l''immobilier, le commerce de détail, etc. Utilisez des données publiques disponibles et des entretiens avec des acteurs locaux pour obtenir des informations pertinentes.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 49, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Data Analysis", "applications": ["Interpreting economic indicators to inform policy decisions", "Developing economic models to forecast market trends", "Evaluating the impact of economic policies on various sectors"], "justification": "Considering the user''s interest in economics, analytical thinking, and desire to work in a complex environment, data analysis is a foundational technical skill. It involves interpreting and making sense of numerical information, which is essential for understanding market trends, making informed decisions, and creating value in the business world.", "esco_description": "Analyzing data to identify trends, patterns, and insights, enabling evidence-based decision-making and strategic planning.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1018", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "developing objectives and strategies", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "cdfe83e4-83d0-416b-be7a-2e178c68f3de", "metadata": {"code": "S4.1.0", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "developing objectives and strategies", "altlabels": "strategic planning\ndeveloping objectives and strategies", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6ee936b0-4e0c-4e04-97c7-1f4ee9230d67", "scopenote": "", "description": "Envisioning a future state and developing strategies, goals, objectives and action plans to achieve it.", "uuidhistory": "3a012fff-b177-4cf7-950f-8ebb35fe3510\nf020253a-e05c-4447-82bd-777648b45045", "preferredlabel": "developing objectives and strategies"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14598", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "make strategic business decisions", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "cdfe83e4-83d0-416b-be7a-2e178c68f3de", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "make strategic business decisions", "altlabels": "make tactical business decisions\npay per click\nmake strategic business decisions\nmake strategic business choices\nPPC", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f60c9e52-95fc-4ca1-a73c-18a491153b63", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Analyse business information and consult directors for decision making purposes in a varied array of aspects affecting the