. Artistic directors also manage staff, finances and policies.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "d06ee6cd-d430-4efe-bc61-4c4baf39f005\n1a212651-2ff8-4cab-a2ae-6aebe829fe47", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "artistic director", "occupationgroupcode": "1349", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16170", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "producer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cdfe83e4-83d0-416b-be7a-2e178c68f3de", "metadata": {"code": "2654.3", "type": "occupation", "label": "producer", "altlabels": "tour production manager\nexecutive producer\nmotion picture manager\nmusic producer\nfilm producer\nfilm director\nproducer\nvideo producer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/52b9e8dc-de6c-41dd-b29a-e1291c273f6f", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Producers are responsible for managing the production of music, motion pictures or series. They plan and coordinate all aspects of the production such as the direction, publication and financing. Producers oversee the production and manage all technical and logistic aspects of recording and editing.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "447cabef-31ce-4010-aa9b-aeb5a9d8737c\n87b61018-7a69-4054-9157-9a87b8da34c3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "producer", "occupationgroupcode": "2654", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16338", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "music producer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cdfe83e4-83d0-416b-be7a-2e178c68f3de", "metadata": {"code": "2654.3.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "music producer", "altlabels": "dance music producer\nproducer\nsound recording engineer and arranger\nvocal producer\nrock music producer\nrecording engineer and arranger\npop music producer\nrecord producer\nmusic publisher\nchill-out & lounge music producer\nmusic producer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/5ff7a990-a306-40c2-9224-b2bf7f15b2f9", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Music producers are responsible for acquiring music to be published. They listen to demos of songs and determine whether they are good enough to be published. Music producers oversee the production of records. They manage the technical aspects of recording and editing.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "176ede41-8b61-451b-a519-99a83042602f\n72e752f3-192f-4e3a-9900-a65e7072f770", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "music producer", "occupationgroupcode": "2654", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17644", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "radio producer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cdfe83e4-83d0-416b-be7a-2e178c68f3de", "metadata": {"code": "2654.4", "type": "occupation", "label": "radio producer", "altlabels": "radio broadcast producer\nradio producer\nradio programme producer\nradio content and production manager\nproducer\nradio show production manager\ncontent and production manager\nproducer in radio\nradio show producer\nradio production manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/ce7d3362-5383-47d1-b66f-57b021c3d862", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": " Radio producers are responsible for organising the making of radio shows. They oversee aspects of radio shows such as content, audio production, resource planning and personnel supervision.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "fbb3ad3a-f530-4051-8ae8-9e8abeecefeb\n0303bc47-88f8-4355-9414-4cbcfd0c6c70", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "radio producer", "occupationgroupcode": "2654", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_18153", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "renewable energy sales representative", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cdfe83e4-83d0-416b-be7a-2e178c68f3de", "metadata": {"code": "3322.1.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "renewable energy sales representative", "altlabels": "renewable energy sales consultant\nresidential alternative energy sales representative\nrenewable energy sales promoter\nresidential renewable energy sales representative\nalternative energy sales consultant\nalternative energy salesman\nalternative energy sales negotiator\nrenewable energy sales negotiator\nrenewable energy seller\nrenewable energy sales representative\nrenewable energy salesperson\nalternative energy saleswoman\nalternative energy sales rep\nrenewable energy saleswoman\nrenewable energy sales rep\nalternative energy salesperson\nalternative energy seller\nrenewable energy salesman\nalternative energy sales promoter", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/ff3a164d-4045-4511-a472-49093dabf9fc", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Renewable energy sales representatives assess clients'' energy supply needs, and attempt to secure sales of renewable energy methods. They promote renewable energy suppliers and the use of renewable energy products, and liaise with consumers to increase sales.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a9633fa7-eb67-4a09-9663-1c6c0311a7c1\naf779695-a7f8-4cc9-b28f-daf9009d9af0", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "renewable energy sales representative", "occupatio