 thinking\nmove strategically\nthink strategically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6c870993-9341-438b-91c0-c7fe4f96d8f5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Apply generation and effective application of business insights and possible opportunities, in order to achieve competitive business advantage on a long-term basis.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a71b991a-32ab-4549-be36-4e1937acc883\n964c1d63-681d-4f91-9a0a-0ab87a57fcd8", "preferredlabel": "apply strategic thinking"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "The challenge is to analyze a real-world case study related to a business or social issue, and develop a strategic plan or decision. The participant must consider various factors, potential risks, and long-term implications before presenting their proposed solution.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 30, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Entrepreneurial Thinking", "applications": ["Developing new business ventures", "Identifying market trends and opportunities", "Driving innovation within existing organizations"], "justification": "With a goal to help create companies and build relations between things, an entrepreneurial mindset will support the user''s interest in business and leadership. This skill will help them develop a strategic approach to identifying opportunities and taking calculated risks.", "esco_description": "The ability to identify opportunities, take calculated risks, and drive innovation within economic contexts. It involves a proactive mindset, strategic decision-making, and the ability to adapt to changing market conditions.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_13533", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "motivate others", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "interpersonal", "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "motivate others", "altlabels": "inspire