se data for policy decisions in trade", "altlabels": "analysing data for policy decisions in trade\nsearch data for policy decisions in trade\ntest data for policy decisions in trade\nanalysis of data for policy decisions in trade\ninvestigate data for policy decisions in trade\nanalyse data for a policy decision in trade\nanalyze  data for policy decisions in trade\nscrutinise data for policy decisions in trade\nanalyse data for policy decisions in trade", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/19aa10ee-35fb-4ba1-b8dc-51525c090ccc", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Analyse data about a specific company, retailer, market or store formula. Process all gathered information into a corporate plan, and use it to prepare upcoming policy decisions.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5056b55b-fab5-454f-8a81-dcd59c8ae0d1\n84a8fa71-b2af-4ace-9073-69de39cba3be", "preferredlabel": "analyse data for policy decisions in trade"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Sélectionnez un ensemble de données sur les importations et les exportations d''un pays au cours des 5 dernières années. Analysez les tendances, identifiez les principaux partenaires commerciaux, et évaluez l''impact de certains accords commerciaux sur le volume des échanges.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 42, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Data Analysis", "applications": ["Economic forecasting and trend analysis", "Market research and competitive analysis", "Policy evaluation and impact assessment"], "justification": "Considering the user''s strength in critical thinking and their interest in economics, data analysis will complement their existing skills and support their goal to work in a complex environment. This skill will enable them to leverage quantitative insights to make informed decisions and identify patterns in market dynamics.", "esco_description": "Utilizing statistical methods and software tools to interpret and extract insights from large datasets, enabling evidence-based decision-making and strategic planning.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_1648", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "creative", "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "altlabels": "propose technical solutions to business problems\npropose ICT solutions to business problems", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/07e51c60-763a-4335-b4ec-70a15f66d328", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Suggest how to solve business issues, using ICT means, so that business processes are improved.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "57bfedf4-70e2-4736-a01e-ed696a50518a\n2949f643-88a5-411e-83d2-109f0749a45a", "preferredlabel": "propose ICT solutions to business problems"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Trouvez un petit commerce local ayant des défis informatiques et proposez une solution ICT adaptée à leur budget et à leurs besoins. Vous devrez analyser leurs besoins, rechercher des solutions existantes et présenter une recommandation claire.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 48, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Problem Solving", "applications": ["Developing new business models in the economics industry", "Designing and implementing cost-effective strategies for resource allocation", "Creating innovative approaches to address economic challenges"], "justification": "Given the user''s high creativity rating and interest in finding meaningful work, creative problem solving will leverage their natural creativity to tackle complex and abstract challenges. This skill aligns with their desire to work in a complex environment and create impact through meaningful solutions.", "esco_description": "The ability t