azine ads, suggest mail packs, email campaigns, websites, stands and other advertising channels", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "4b84c57e-087e-4dce-8b0f-cffe4b6f455c\n8c256d65-5cc6-4514-9a81-d705b92b3493", "preferredlabel": "coordinate advertising campaigns"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_8183", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "manage account department", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "manage account department", "altlabels": "managing account department\nmanage account departments\nmanage account department\ndirect account department\nmanage accounts department\noversee account department", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7e251454-2496-4f09-99fe-3da59bc4c10a", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Oversee the operations of account representatives who act as intermediaries between the client and their creative and media services departments. Make sure the client''s needs and objectives are met.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "8a918369-8ffb-4185-8290-763e0d1ad6fb\ncc020b97-f0af-4638-b507-6eb6ee0832ec", "preferredlabel": "manage account department"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_7738", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "lead others", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "lead others", "altlabels": "guide others\ntake on a leadership role\nleading others\nlead others\ndirect others\nsupervise others\ngive direction\nshow leadership attitude\nmanage people\nlead", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/75d8e5d9-bef3-418b-9011-01bff9f27207", "scopenote": "Excludes people performing management.", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Guide and direct others towards a common goal, often in a group or team.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "e8fb9eed-a125-46dc-8d0c-53582760cb23\n5eb890dd-c84e-485a-a618-6ef056886822", "preferredlabel": "lead others"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_979", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "social and communication skills and competences", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"code": "T4", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "social and communication skills and competences", "altlabels": "interpersonal skills\ninterpersonal abilities\nsocial interactions\nsocial skills\nsocial interaction\nsocial and communication skills and competences", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/552c4f35-a2d1-49c2-8fda-afe26695c44a", "scopenote": "", "description": "Skills and competences relating to the ability to interact positively and productively with others. This is demonstrated by communicating ideas effectively and empathetically, coordinating one’s own objectives and actions with those of others and acting in ways which are structured according to values, ensuring the well-being and progress of others, and offering leadership.", "uuidhistory": "99f558db-6003-4430-8276-32cddba501a0\n3863e8ac-bec0-4e74-bd8f-a165890e9169", "preferredlabel": "social and communication skills and competences"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_10838", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "delegate responsibilities", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "delegate responsibilities", "altlabels": "delegate activities\ndistribute activities\ndelegate tasks\ndelegate activities to others\ndelegate\nshare duties\ndistribute tasks\nshare tasks\ndelegate responsibilities", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b00e948c-19be-4951-8cff-60f88f1046e9", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Delegate responsibilities, activities and tasks to others according to the ability, level of preparation and competence. Make sure that people understand what they should do and when they should do it. ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b5b09184-9feb-459e-b942-699d2c8992fc\n37680638-ff24-46ef-869d-51deba2ca45c", "preferredlabel": "delegate responsibilities"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_901", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "giving feedback", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"code": "S1.8.3", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "giving feedback", "altlabels": "giving feedback", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/23cfb269-eec1-4011-8e57-c86203ce9fd7", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- provide feedback on job performance\n- give constructive feedback", "description": "Providing founded feedback on the performance of subordinates, co-workers and students through both criticism and praise in a respectful, clear, and consistent manner. Highlighting achievements as well as mistakes and set up methods of formative assessment.", "uuidhistory": "94f890f5-db44-4269-8cad-51324e8fdb18\n7a802c76-6b6c-4878-82a2-792d18bb4141", "preferredlabel": "giving feedback"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17961", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "minister of religion", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"code": "2636.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "minister of religion", "altlabels": "nun\nspiritual leader\npastor\nminister of the church\npriest\nmember of the clergy\nreligious minister\nchurch minister\nminister of religion\ndeacon\nmonk\nordained clergyman\nbishop", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/ed256ed0-0432-4969-8544-3e5e01a517a9", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Ministers of religion lead religious organisations or communities, perform spiritual and religious ceremonies and provide spiritual guidance to members of a particular religious group. They may undertake missionary work, pastoral or preaching work, or work within a religious order or community, such as a monastery or convent. Ministers of religion perform duties such as leading worship services, giving religious education, officiating at funerals and marriages, counselling congregation members and offer a range of other community services, both in conjunction with the organisation they work for, and through their own personal day to day activities.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "fd04b352-4b47-49e1-b365-590e4905929e\ne4491189-03bc-4aea-acb2-72c53ae5241e", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "minister of religion", "occupationgroupcode": "2636", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17152", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "chaplain", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"code": "2636.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "chaplain", "altlabels": "imam\nchaplain\nuniversity chaplain\nlay representative\nprison chaplain\nhospital chaplain\nrabbi\nmilitary chaplain", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/a4dd6eae-ca75-456f-829d-333671a7c186", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Chaplains perform religious activities in secular institutions. They perform counselling services and provide spiritual and emotional support to the people in the institution, as well as cooperate with priests or other religious officials to support religious activities in the community.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "cac94741-0d6e-4ed1-9d1a-71795c5d14d0\n466d04c9-eddb-4bbc-8413-389b5c5692de", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "chaplain", "occupationgroupcode": "2636", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1130", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "leading and motivating", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"code": "S4.5.0", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "leading and motivating", "altlabels": "leadership\nleading and motivating", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b7e752ec-7b2e-46e6-ac24-8b1233609c31", "scopenote": "Excludes:\n- Managing, leading or supervising a team or its members.\n\nExamples:\n- Motivate employees\n- Provide leadership\n- Lead board meetings", "description": "Reinforcing an organization''s vision, inspiring and enthusing others to achieve positive outcomes. The focus of this group is on skills in motivating and inspiring others, rather than on managing and supervising a team.", "uuidhistory": "2292ff76-8385-448d-a2cb-be900376cf49\neb25c0a3-5a3b-4b31-af1e-8cd45119eff5", "preferredlabel": "leading and motivating"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17760", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "business coach", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"code": "2424.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "business coach", "altlabels": "professional development coach\nleadership coach\nbusiness development coach\npractitioner of business coaching\ncoach in business development\nbusiness leadership coach\npersonal development coach\nbusiness coach\ncorporate coach\nexecutive coach", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/d9612966-e295-4d81-ba2b-9f36bad0b392", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Business coaches guide employees of a company or other institution in order to improve their personal effectiveness, increase their job satisfaction, and positively impact their career development in the business setting. They do this by leading the coachee (the person who is being coached) to resolution of their challenges by their own means. Business coaches aim to address specific tasks or reach specific goals, as opposed to overall development.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "804d485e-bdc2-4c6f-a796-af0f984715f8\na5c56e8c-cd93-431b-b8b5-f5b987255590", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "business coach", "occupationgroupcode": "2424", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16523", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "marketing manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"code": "1221.3.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "marketing manager", "altlabels": "sales and marketing manager\npromotions manager\ntelemarketing manager\nmarket development manager\nmarketing director\nmarketing and promotions manager\nmarketing manager\nadvertising sales manager\nmarketing executive\nmarket manager\nproduct marketing manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/6fcf4638-e7c7-4978-9302-9a7b63a3d57c", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Marketing managers carry out the implementation of efforts related to the marketing operations in a company. They develop marketing strategies and plans by detailing cost and resources needed. They analyse the profitability of these plans, develop pricing strategies, and strive to raise awareness on products and companies among targeted customers.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "dfe24c26-b6a0-4d18-9c0b-4475aca161a5\n09d60a71-c124-4922-b983-5cfc3d5e2673", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "marketing manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1221", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_1502", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "pass on trade techniques", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "a2c0bff6-305c-4914-8ffe-1600b71fbe83", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "pass on trade techniques", "altlabels": "pass on trade skills\npass on a trade technique\npass on trade procedures\npass on trading techniques\npass on trade routines\npass on trade approaches\npass on trade techniques\npass on techniques of a trade", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/05338a70-1ea1-4c33-a886-1c4f0c7d7241", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Pass on knowledge and skills, explain and demonstrate the application of equipment and materials and answer questions about trade techniques for the manufacturing of products.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b19d8cca-510f-4e4a-8e7e-5ecb40649e8a\n3da9e656-92e9-411e-95df-f715e12ac3ba", "preferredlabel": "pass on trade techniques"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occup