ly strategic thinking\napply techniques for strategic thinking\nmove strategically\nthink strategically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6c870993-9341-438b-91c0-c7fe4f96d8f5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Apply generation and effective application of business insights and possible opportunities, in order to achieve competitive business advantage on a long-term basis.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a71b991a-32ab-4549-be36-4e1937acc883\n964c1d63-681d-4f91-9a0a-0ab87a57fcd8", "preferredlabel": "apply strategic thinking"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "The challenge is to analyze a real-life case study of a business problem and develop a strategic plan to address it. The participant will need to consider various factors such as market trends, competition, and potential risks to come up with a well-thought-out solution.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 22, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Strategic Thinking", "applications": ["Developing long-term business strategies", "Assessing market trends and competitive landscapes", "Identifying opportunities for organizational growth and development"], "justification": "Given the user''s interest in philosophy and complex environments, strategic thinking aligns with their goal to work in complex environments and their self-identification as a thinker. This skill will build on their existing strengths in critical thinking and analytical thinking, supporting their career trajectory in creating companies and establishing relationships between things.", "esco_description": "The ability to analyze complex situations, identify long-term implications, and develop innovative solutions to achieve organizational goals.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_6843", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "entrepreneurship", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "leadership", "graph_id": "e888249a-e76e-434a-87a5-b44f9f66039a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "entrepreneurship", "altlabels": "entrepreneurship\nbusiness initiative\nentrepreneurialism", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/658605f2-1c95-49f0-bd98-0af7b15ad0b0", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The development, organisation and management of an own business venture.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "d5822232-fc8a-48b4-9bf2-a616dbde4bab\na7283b9c-44ac-4d18-849c-d7bba1537276", "preferredlabel": "entrepreneurship"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Créez un plan d''affaires pour une idée de start-up innovante, incluant une analyse de marché, un modèle financier et une stratégie de marketing.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 49, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Entrepreneurship", "applications": ["Developing and implementing business plans", "Seeking and securing funding for new ventures", "Evaluating and managing business risks"], "justification": "As the user aims to help create companies and wants to work in business, entrepreneurship aligns with their career goals. Their leadership skills and desire to inspire others make this skill a solid foundation. It represents an enterprising skill that supports their interest in business and leadership.", "esco_description": "Identifying business opportunities, taking calculated risks, and creating and managing a new venture to achieve success.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_9267", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "influence legislators", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "interpersonal", "graph_id": "e888249a-e76e-434a-87a5-b44f9f66039a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "influence legislators", "altlabels": "pressure law makers\ndominate legislators\ndominate law makers\ncontrol law makers\ncontrol legislators\npressure legislators\ninfluence legislators", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/91fe9c5b-7c12-4835-ad9c-6cae970187fa", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Influence the organisations and individuals involved in the process of making or changing legislation and laws in order to obtain a desired result, by identifying which parties would be best to contact and using persuasive methods to influence their actions and decisions.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "67c90222-9084-4acc-9fde-8168d38c5f71\na6f21ef3-49ec-4e4a-8a37-a36c0cca1beb", "preferredlabel": "influence legislators"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Trouvez le nom et les coordonnées d''un législateur local, rédigez une lettre claire et convaincante sur un sujet qui vous tient à cœur, tel que l''environnement, l''éducation ou la santé, et envoyez-la par courrier postal ou par e-mail.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 44, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Influencing Others", "applications": ["Negotiating business deals", "Leading and motivating teams", "Advocating for policy changes"], "justification": "The user''s ability to attract attention, make connections, and understand others'' motives indicates a strong interpersonal skill set. Developing interpersonal influence will further enhance their ability to inspire and lead others, aligning with their unique quality and career aspirations.", "esco_description": "Influencing others involves persuading and convincing individuals or groups to take a specific course of action or adopt a particular belief. It requires effective communication, negotiation, and interpersonal skills.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14407", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "forecast economic trends", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "technical", "graph_id": "e888249a-e76e-434a-87a5-b44f9f66039a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "forecast economic trends", "altlabels": "project economic trends\neconomic trend forecasting\nforecast economic trends\nanalyse economic trends\npredict economic trends\nforecasting of economic trends\neconomic trend forecasts", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f2a34d6b-131a-4b8f-a110-898b9c91d18f", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Gather and analyse economic data in order to predict economic trends and events.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5e187514-cb05-4521-94d0-8f854d9e197b\nbb6b2ce8-10c6-4707-b1b4-1bfb511fffd4", "preferredlabel": "forecast economic trends"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Effectuer une analyse détaillée des tendances économiques locales en utilisant des données publiques et des rapports gouvernementaux. Identifier les principaux secteurs en croissance et en déclin, ainsi que les facteurs influençant ces tendances.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 21, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Economic Analysis", "applications": ["Assessing market conditions and forecasting economic trends", "Evaluating the impact of policies and regulations on economic activities", "Providing insights for strategic business planning and investment decisions"], "justification": "Given the user''s education and interest in economics, developing expertise in economic analysis will provide them with a technical skill foundation. This skill aligns with their industry, education, and interest in working with numbers, supporting their career trajectory in economics and business.", "esco_description": "Conducting in-depth examination and evaluation of economic data to identify trends, forecast outcomes, and inform decision-making processes in various industries.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_1648", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "creative", "graph_id": "e888249a-e76e-434a-87a5-b44f9f66039a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "altlabels": "propose technical solutions to business problems\npropose ICT solutions to business problems", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/07e51c60-763a-4335-b4ec-70a15f66d328", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Suggest how to solve business issues, using ICT means, so that business processes are improved.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "57bfedf4-70e2-4736-a01e-ed696a50518a\n2949f643-88a5-411e-83d2-109f0749a45a", "preferredlabel": "propose ICT solutions to business problems"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Develop a mobile or web application that provides ICT solutions to common business problems, such as inventory management, customer relationship management, or project tracking. The app should be user-friendly and incorporate relevant ICT tools and techniques.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 45, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Problem Solving", "applications": ["Developing new business strategies in the field of economics", "Designing and implementing innovative economic models", "Creating and optimizing financial processes and systems"], "justification": "With a high rating in creativity and a desire to work in a complex environment, developing creative problem-solving skills will build on their existing creativity and critical thinking. This skill aligns with their interest in meaningful work and their unique quality of attracting attention and making connections.", "esco_description": "The ability to creatively identify, analyze, and solve complex problems by generating innovative and effective solutions.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1018", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "developing objectives and strategies", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "e888249a-e76e-434a-87a5-b44f9f66039a", "metadata": {"code": "S4.1.0", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "developing objectives and strategies", "altlabels": "strategic planning\ndeveloping objectives and strategies", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6ee936b0-4e0c-4e04-97c7-1f4ee9230d67", "scopenote": "", "description": "Envisioning a future state and developing strategies, goals, objectives and action plans to achieve it.", "uuidhistory": "3a012fff-b177-4cf7-950f-8ebb35fe3510\nf020253a-e05c-4447-82bd-777648b45045", "preferredlabel": "developing objectives and strategies"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14598", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "make strategic business decisions", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "e888249a-e76e-434a-87a5-b44f9f66039a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "make strategic business decisions", "altlabels": "make tactical business decisions\npay per click\nmake strategic business decisions\nmake strategic business choices\nPPC", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f60c9e52-95fc-4ca1-a73c-18a491153b63", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Analyse business information and consult directors for decision making purposes in a varied array of aspects affecting the prospect, productivity and sustainable operation of a company. Consider the options and alternatives to a challenge and make sound rational decisions based on analysis and experience.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "71709697-2eda-4fe4-9160-e6a258ea6b0a\n0441380e-ef76-4ac6-b610-8c854edf11df", "preferredlabel": "make strategic business decisions"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17383", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "import export manager", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "e888249a-e76e-434a-87a5-b44f9f66039a", "metadata": {"code": "1324.3.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "import export manager", "altlabels": "senior export manager\ngraduate international trade compliance manager\nassistant international trade compliance manager\nsenior international trade manager\ntrainee import export manager\nsenior import manager\nimport export manager\ngraduate customs compliance manager\ngraduate import export manager\nsenior customs compliance manager\ntrainee international trade manager\nassistant import manager\nassistant export manager\ngraduate import manager\nassistant customs compliance manager\ntrainee international trade compliance manager\ntrainee import manager\nassistant international trade manager\ngraduate export manager\ntrainee customs compliance manager\ntrainee export manager\nsenior international trade compliance manager\ngraduate international trade manager\nassistant import export manager\nsenior import export manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/b87a7a27-ee74-4e5e-b274-84a3cab27bf4", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Import export managers install and maintain procedures for cross-border business, coordinating internal and external parties.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "fb808c05-845b-43da-9947-ae278a842ae8\nee219eb2-8c98-4302-91b0-89b5703904e1", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "import export manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1324", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_694", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "management and administration", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "e888249a-e76e-434a-87a5-b44f9f66039a", "metadata": {"code": "", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "management and administration", "altlabels": "management and administration", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/isced-f/0413", "scopenote": "", "description": "Management and administration is the study of planning, directing and operating the functions and activities of organizations and institutions. Programmes in management also including administration, economics, finance etc. are included here if emphasis is given to management and administration.\nProgrammes and qualifications with the following main content are classified here:\nAdministration\nEducational management\nEmployment management\nEntrepreneurship\nHealth administration\nLogistic management\nManagement science\nOffice management\nOrganizational theory and behaviour\nPersonnel administration\nPersonnel management\n''Start your own business'' courses\nSupply change management\nTraining management\n\n=== Inclusions:\nStudy of leadership in the context of management is included here.\n\n=== Exclusions:\nTraining in leadership in the context of personal development is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0031 ''Personal skills''.\nStudy of administration in the meaning of office work is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0415 ''Secretarial and office work''.", "uuidhistory": "9aaa99f4-d19b-4042-a645-f375a7c49506\na0c8360b-e40e-4383-92cb-6c0ce4fb9e8d", "preferredlabel": "management and administration"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15654", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "drone pilot", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "e888249a-e76e-434a-87a5-b44f9f66039a", "metadata": {"code": "3153.4", "type": "occupation", "label": "drone pilot", "altlabels": "unmanned aircraft pilot\nremote piloted aircraft (RPA) pilot\ndrone operator\nunmanned aircraft systems operator\nunmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs) pilot\ncivil drone operator\ndrone pilot", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/27a88c48-1d09-4a8c-a82a-a61ea16476d9", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Drone pilots remotely operate unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs). They navigate the drone as well as activate other equipment as cameras, sensors as LIDARS to calculate distances, or any other instrumentation.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "6d347e21-40fc-424a-897d-03772c98b6b5\n04197517-7bb3-4864-9b77-2eccf25a1803", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "drone pilot", "occupationgroupcode": "3153", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17928", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "special-interest groups'' official", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "e888249a-e76e-434a-87a5-b44f9f66039a", "metadata": {"code": "1114.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "special-interest groups'' official", "altlabels": "trades union research officer\nspecial-interest groups'' staff member\nlobbying body official\nspecial-interest groups'' worker\nprofessional body official\nspecial-interest group official\nsport governing body official\nspecial-interest groups'' official\nhumanitarian organisation official\nspecial-interest group worker\nindustry association official\ntrades union official\nemployers organisation official\nspecial-interest group staff member\nsports association official\ncampaign group official\ntrade association official", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/e9cf8b24-6b8b-47cc-9dd3-b601aa135960", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Special-interest groups'' officials represent and act on behalf of special-interest groups such as trade unions, employer organisations, trade and industry associations, sports associations and humanitarian organisations. They develop policies and ensure their implementation. Special-interest groups'' officials speak for 