quantitative insights and contribute to complex decision-making processes.", "esco_description": "Analyzing data to identify trends, patterns, and insights, enabling informed decision-making and strategic planning.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14282", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "have emotional intelligence", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "interpersonal", "graph_id": "409280fd-0714-4c86-a60a-443b003de593", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "have emotional intelligence", "altlabels": "recognize other people''s emotions\npossess emotional intelligence\nhave emotional intelligence\nobtain emotional intelligence\nown emotional intelligence\nrecognize other people''s emotion", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f0a84d52-91fd-45ec-9fe9-e363d9318b9e", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Recognize ones own and other people`s emotions, distinguish correctly between them and observing how they can influence one`s environment and social interaction and what can be done about it.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "efb13b41-4eb6-43a3-9127-0303305e705c\n96990a87-f93f-43e2-993f-95abbfd2885e", "preferredlabel": "have emotional intelligence"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Pendant une semaine, engagez-vous à avoir au moins une conversation significative par jour avec une personne de votre entourage. Portez une attention particulière à comprendre ses émotions et à y réagir de manière empathique.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 47, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Emotional Intelligence", "applications": ["Building strong interpersonal relationships in the workplace", "Resolving conflicts and negotiating effectively", "Promoting a positive and collaborative work environment"], "justification": "Given the user''s strong interpersonal skills, interest in understanding others'' motives, and desire to work in complex en