ay to send the cargo to its destination which can be a single customer or a point of distribution. Forwarding managers act as experts in supply chain management. They know and apply the rules and regulations for each specific type of cargo and communicate the conditions and costs to the clients.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "40820e19-c0e7-4601-88b9-6e71ff34edea\n99390e34-48bf-4a7e-a62d-ef6a79952f1d", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "forwarding manager", "occupationgroupcode": "3331", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16370", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "food production planner", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "409280fd-0714-4c86-a60a-443b003de593", "metadata": {"code": "3122.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "food production planner", "altlabels": "food production planning expert\nfood production planner\nfood production planning specialist\nfood manufacturing planner", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/623958d6-775c-4586-b928-86582d9d1b69", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Food production planners prepare production plans, evaluate all the variables in the process and strive to ensure that production objectives be achieved.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "3f56a817-098f-4032-9695-0c29d1d23ea3\n0691ba1e-c0c3-459d-a75f-c7c40d443c62", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "food production planner", "occupationgroupcode": "3122", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1041", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "developing educational programmes", "notes": "", "state": "loc