Strategic Thinking", "applications": ["Developing business strategies to gain competitive advantage", "Assessing market trends and identifying growth opportunities", "Evaluating risks and making informed decisions for long-term success"], "justification": "Given the user''s interest in complex environments and their strong critical thinking and leadership skills, developing strategic thinking will enable them to navigate and create opportunities within dynamic business and organizational settings.", "original_label": "Strategic Thinking", "esco_description": "Strategic Thinking involves analyzing complex situations, identifying key issues, and developing long-term plans to achieve organizational goals. It requires the ability to anticipate future trends and outcomes, and to make decisions that align with the organization''s strategic direction."}, {"id": "skill::key_11531", "score": 0.33517187800000003, "category": "interpersonal", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "show entrepreneurial spirit", "node_id": "skill::key_11531", "altlabels": "identify opportunities\ndemonstrate entrepreneurship\nshow entrepreneurial spirit\ndisplay entrepreneurial spirit\nreveal entrepreneurial spirit\ndemonstrate willingness to take risks\nshowing entrepreneurial spirit\ndemonstrate entrepreneurial spirit\nshowing an entrepreneurial spirit\npursue opportunities\nshow an entrepreneurial spirit\nexhibit entrepreneurial spirit", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/bdcf429c-5ccf-4c3d-bb61-4c987573a35e", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Develop, organise and manage an own business venture, identifying and pursuing opportunities and mobilising resources, keeping in mind a profitability perspective. Demonstrate a proactive attitude and determination to achieve success in business ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "691675d1-3b75-42e3-bbeb-f9bf54929f95\n452294a2-e93a-4bf7-9c1d-0c66372b8f33", "preferredlabel": "show entrepreneurial spirit"}, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Entrepreneurial Thinking", "applications": ["Identifying market opportunities for new products or services", "Developing innovative solutions to business challenges", "Taking calculated risks to pursue business ventures"], "justification": "With a desire to create companies and facilitate connections, enhancing an entrepreneurial mindset will align with the user''s interest in business and leadership, while leveraging their creativity and enterprising personality profile.", "original_label": "Entrepreneurial Mindset", "esco_description": "Demonstrating an entrepreneurial mindset involves identifying opportunities, taking calculated risks, and being proactive in problem-solving. It enables individuals to think creatively, adapt to change, and drive innovation in business and economic contexts."}, {"id": "skill::key_14407", "score": 0.31330752399999995, "category": "technical", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "forecast economic trends", "node_id": "skill::key_14407", "altlabels": "project economic trends\neconomic trend forecasting\nforecast economic trends\nanalyse economic trends\npredict economic trends\nforecasting of economic trends\neconomic trend forecasts", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f2a34d6b-131a-4b8f-a110-898b9c91d18f", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Gather and analyse economic data in order to predict economic trends and events.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5e187514-cb05-4521-94d0-8f854d9e197b\nbb6b2ce8-10c6-4707-b1b4-1bfb511fffd4", "preferredlabel": "forecast economic trends"}, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Data Analysis", "applications": ["Interpreting economic indicators to inform policy decisions", "Developing economic models to forecast market trends", "Evaluating the impact of economic policies on various sectors"], "justification": "As the user has a strong interest in economics and a practical, investigative career profile, developing skills in data analysis will empower them to leverage quantitative insights and contribute to complex decision-making processes.", "original_label": "Data Analysis", "esco_description": "Analyzing data to identify trends, patterns, and insights, enabling informed decision-making and strategic planning."}, {"id": "skill::key_14282", "score": 0.33561384699999997, "category": "interpersonal", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "have emotional intelligence", "node_id": "skill::key_14282", "altlabels": "recognize other people''s emotions\npossess emotional intelligence\nhave emotional intelligence\nobtain emotional intelligence\nown emotional intelligence\nrecognize other people''s emotion", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f0a84d52-91fd-45ec-9fe9-e363d9318b9e", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Recognize ones own and other people`s emotions, distinguish correctly between them and observing how they can influence one`s environment and social interaction and what can be done about it.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "efb13b41-4eb6-43a3-9127-0303305e705c\n96990a87-f93f-43e2-993f-95abbfd2885e", "preferredlabel": "have emotional intelligence"}, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Emotional Intelligence", "applications": ["Building strong interpersonal relationships in the workplace", "Resolving conflicts and negotiating effectively", "Promoting a positive and collaborative work environment"], "justification": "Given the user''s strong interpersonal skills, interest in understanding others'' motives, and desire to work in complex environments requiring psychology, developing emotional intelligence will enhance their ability to connect with and inspire others effectively.", "original_label": "Emotional Intelligence", "esco_description": "Recognizing and managing emotions in oneself and others to facilitate effective communication, teamwork, and conflict resolution."}, {"id": "skill::key_7979", "score": 0.37284064299999997, "category": "creative", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "develop strategy to solve problems", "node_id": "skill::key_7979", "altlabels": "devise strategy\ncome up with strategy to solve problems\nset goals\nset targets\ndesign strategy to solve problems\ndeveloping strategy to solve problems\ndevelop strategy to solve problems\nidentify goals\ndevelop strategies to solve problems\ndevelop strategy to solve problem\ncreate implementation strategy\nadapt implementation strategy\nstrategic thinking\ncreate strategy to solve problems\ndevise action plan\ndevelop objectives\ndevelop problem solving strategy\nidentify tasks\ndecide priorities", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7a8fb784-67fa-41e9-a75c-6b491d91f800", "scopenote": "Excludes <a resource=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d9013e0e-e937-43d5-ab71-0e917ee882b8\" typeOf=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/model#Skill\" href=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d9013e0e-e937-43d5-ab71-0e917ee882b8\"><span property=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label\" xml:lang=\"en\">manage time</span></a>.", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Develop specific goals and plans to prioritise, organise, and accomplish work.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "81c07593-a27d-40d1-a32d-7b746b124422\n2db7ec36-ff4d-4201-aad1-fd487ad16130", "preferredlabel": "develop strategy to solve problems"}, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Problem Solving", "applications": ["Developing innovative strategies to address economic problems", "Designing and implementing new approaches to optimize resource allocation", "Creating unique solutions to improve economic processes and systems"], "justification": "Building on the user''s high creativity and critical thinking ratings, developing creative problem-solving skills