ategically\nthink strategically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6c870993-9341-438b-91c0-c7fe4f96d8f5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Apply generation and effective application of business insights and possible opportunities, in order to achieve competitive business advantage on a long-term basis.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a71b991a-32ab-4549-be36-4e1937acc883\n964c1d63-681d-4f91-9a0a-0ab87a57fcd8", "preferredlabel": "apply strategic thinking"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "In the next 5 days, identify a real-life problem or opportunity and devise a strategic plan to address it. Consider various options, potential risks, and long-term implications before making a decision.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 24, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Strategic Thinking", "applications": ["Developing business strategies to enter new markets", "Creating long-term financial plans to ensure company sustainability", "Identifying opportunities for organizational growth and development"], "justification": "Given the user''s interest in philosophy and complex environments, strategic thinking aligns with their desire to work in a complex environment, requiring psychology, a bit of numbers, and understanding of people. This skill will build on their existing strengths in critical thinking and creativity, and support their career trajectory in creating companies and fostering relations.", "esco_description": "The ability to analyze complex situations, identify key issues, and develop long-term plans to achieve organizational goals.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_12645", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "identify new business opportunities", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "leadership", "graph_id": "cc7c2099-a683-4b4c-a99b-c6758b7de30a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "identify new business opportunities", "