ne evaluation objectives and scope", "altlabels": "define evaluation objectives and scope", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f1f5093b-0b26-4d59-984b-0531c6ccf205", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "occupation-specific", "description": "Clarify the purpose and scope of the evaluation, frame its questions and boundaries.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "0c76d7d1-d4ef-4f98-93c2-b80c66313a91\n5a36201b-8e17-47b7-addc-2df955efddbd", "preferredlabel": "define evaluation objectives and scope"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_11512", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "business strategy concepts", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "cc7c2099-a683-4b4c-a99b-c6758b7de30a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "business strategy concepts", "altlabels": "business strategy concepts", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/bd698bbe-7003-4508-b422-46c2ff4d5e95", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The terminology related to the design and implementation of major trends and aims which are taken by an organisation''s executives, while keeping in mind its resources, competition and environments.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "ee42d3fa-ba4a-427a-bf1f-abbceddcfc98\neceb5ffc-f8c7-45b7-a6c3-b61223c9b66a", "preferredlabel": "business strategy concepts"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16091", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "investor relations manager", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "cc7c2099-a683-4b4c-a99b-c6758b7de30a", "metadata": {"code": "2412.6.4", "type": "occupation", "label": "investor relations manager", "altlabels": "investors relation manager\ninvestment strategy manager\ninvestor relations manager\ninvestor relations director\ninvestor relations supervisor", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/4c715719-3c3f-4058-ba00-9b2ef34848e8", "scopenote": "Includes people working in public relations departments. \nIncludes people working with larger companies'' relations with shareholders and investors through marketing and communication.", "definition": "", "description": "Investor relations managers disseminate the investment strategy of the company and monitor the reactions of the investment community towards it. They use marketing, financial, communications, and security law expertise to ensure transparent communication to the larger community. They respond to inquiries from shareholders and investors in relation to the company''s financial stability, stocks, or corporate policies.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "1763e7f5-248f-4e7e-b8d7-dabc4aafe8e6\n71438621-f76d-44f9-8ed3-c216be5878d3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "investor relations manager", "occupationgroupcode": "2412", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15612", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "corporate investment banker", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cc7c2099-a683-4b4c-a99b-c6758b7de30a", "metadata": {"code": "2412.6.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "corporate investment banker", "altlabels": "operational investment banker\ninvestment banking associate\ninvestment banker\ncorporate investment adviser\ncorporate investment strategist\ncorporate banker\ncorporate investment banker", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/244a79eb-122b-4bee-8065-b4c39efce4ff", "scopenote": "Includes people performing activities to monitor the compliance of legal regulations and to advise on financial transactions and deals. \nIncludes people performing research and analysis. \nExcludes people performing investor relations management.", "definition": "", "description": "Corporate investment bankers offer strategic advice on financial services to companies and other institutions. They ensure that legal regulations are being followed by their clients in their efforts of raising any capital. They provide technical expertise and information on mergers and acquisitions, bonds and shares, privatisations and reorganisation, raising capital and security underwriting, including equity and debt markets.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "e4a8aaef-b4d3-4d33-a383-3034fe444e9a\n09ced50a-6413-4e74-8f31-2de05f0726e5", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "corporate investment banker", "occupationgroupcode": "2412", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_6908", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "export control principles", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cc7c2099-a683-4b4c-a99b-c6758b7de30a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "export control principles", "altlabels": "export control conventions\nexport control foundations\nexport control fundamentals\nexport controls principles\nexport control principles\nexporting control principles\ncontrol export principles\nexport control standards", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/66dd1398-6be6-4a0d-a0d0-4a8b3941963a", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The restrictions a country imposes on its exported products and goods.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "bc0291c6-7d37-4402-8553-781fb75678dd\n0e7f909e-ef25-4eae-9fe7-e8f84018bab9", "preferredlabel": "export control principles"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor":