rnally and in international import and export relations. They analyse the domestic and foreign markets in order to promote and establish business operations, and ensure trade proceedings are compliant with legislation and businesses are protected from distortions.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "1a184c34-b96c-4b6e-8ed8-f43d3c5c6f8b\n384ec32d-4fe1-4a53-a9c8-452102a4466f", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "trade development officer", "occupationgroupcode": "2422", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_4254", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "set import export strategies", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cc7c2099-a683-4b4c-a99b-c6758b7de30a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "set import export strategies", "altlabels": "set import export strategies\nsetting an import export strategy\nsetting import export strategies\nfix import export strategies\nsettle import export strategies\nset an import export strategy\napply import export strategies\nestablish import export strategies", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/363e30cf-b3ec-4b3f-b02c-ac77a5902d15", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Develop and plan the strategies for import and export, according to the size of the company, the nature of its products, expertise and business conditions on the international markets.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b148d817-57ba-43ef-b5f9-28b4a8e2cb5c\n94fb4ef4-30a3-45b2-881e-5077173daccf", "preferredlabel": "set import export strategies"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_2335", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "business intelligence", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cc7c2099-a683-4b4c-a99b-c6758b7de30a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "business intelligence", "altlabels": "business intelligence", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/143769cb-b61e-47d8-a61e-eedfbec1016c", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The tools used to transform large amounts of raw data into relevant and helpful business information.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "13bd846d-6cce-4fb6-af7d-b4f3f3c5dde2\nbcfe0dd3-31c5-4b38-bda2-a3a79351c986", "preferredlabel": "business intelligence"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16575", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "social entrepreneur", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cc7c2099-a683-4b4c-a99b-c6758b7de30a", "metadata": {"code": "1120.6", "type": "occupation", "label": "social entrepreneur", "altlabels": "green entrepreneur\nsocial business founder\neco-entrepreneur \nsocial enterprise founder\nsocial business venture founder\nsocial entrepreneur", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/73b10c97-b003-45dc-a36d-c1d585c04be1", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Social entrepreneurs create innovative products or service models to tackle social and environmental challenges, pursuing through their profits a social mission that benefits a wider community or the environment. They often use a more democratic decision-making system by involving closely their stakeholders, and strive to achieve change at a systems level, by influencing policies, market evolutions and even mentalities.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "0f31713c-079b-4a82-b8c1-508090910547\n1a6b966b-6ce5-44f4-91bb-43f268ef38c2", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "social entrepreneur", "occupationgroupcode": "1120", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_9930", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "business processes", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cc7c2099-a683-4b4c-a99b-c6758b7de30a", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "business processes", "altlabels": "business process\nrefinement a business\nbusiness analysis\na business process\nbusiness measures\nbusiness handling\nbusiness processes", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/9e84a506-df06-4be3-874a-fa01293e3dd5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Processes which an organisation applies to improve efficiency, set new objectives and reach goals in a profitable and timely manner.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "2fc7e660-8933-4ccb-a611-bce16e863f7d\n620c3924-c9d0-46af-b27c-cb683186cd22", "preferredlabel": "business processes"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17782", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "artistic director", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cc7c2099-a683-4b4c-a99b-c6758b7de30a", "metadata": {"code": "1349.3", "type": "occupation", "label": "artistic director", "altlabels": "orchestra artistic director\nballet director\nart director\nartistic director for dance company\nartistic director\ndirector of programming\nvenue programming director\nartistic consultant\nopera director\nvenue programming manager\ntheatre director\nfestival director", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/db4f28ff-c208-4830-ab8b-4b07776db134", "scopenote": "Excludes venue programmer.", "definition": "", "description": "Artistic directors are in charge of the programme of an artistic project or a cultural organisation. They are responsible for the strategic vision, the visibility and the quality of all kind of artistic activities and services such as theatre and dance companies. Artistic directors also manage staff, finances and policies.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "d06ee6cd-d430-4efe-bc61-4c4baf39f005\n1a212651-2ff8-4cab-a2ae-6aebe829fe47", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "artistic director", "occupationgroupcode": "1349", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16170", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "producer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "cc7c2099-a683-4b4c-a99b-c6758b7de30a", "metadata": {"code": "2654.3", "type": "occupation", "label": "producer", "altlabels": "tour production manager\nexecutive producer\nmotion picture manager\nmusic producer\nfilm producer\nfilm director\nproducer\nvideo producer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/52b9e8dc-de6c-41dd-b29a-e1291c273f6f", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Producers are responsible for managing the production of music, motion pictures or series. They plan and coordinate all aspects of the production such as the direction, publication and financing. Producers oversee the production and manage all technical and logistic aspects of recording and editing.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "447cabef-31ce-4010-aa9b-aeb5a9d8737c\n87b61018-7a69-4054-9157-9a87b8da34c3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "producer", "occupationgroupcode": "2654", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16338", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "music producer", "notes