strategic thinking\nmove strategically\nthink strategically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6c870993-9341-438b-91c0-c7fe4f96d8f5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Apply generation and effective application of business insights and possible opportunities, in order to achieve competitive business advantage on a long-term basis.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a71b991a-32ab-4549-be36-4e1937acc883\n964c1d63-681d-4f91-9a0a-0ab87a57fcd8", "preferredlabel": "apply strategic thinking"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "The challenge is to analyze a real-life case study of a company facing strategic decisions, and develop a well-reasoned plan for the company''s future direction. This will involve evaluating market trends, competitive landscape, and internal capabilities to make informed recommendations.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 27, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Strategic Thinking", "applications": ["Developing business strategies", "Identifying opportunities for growth and improvement", "Evaluating market trends and competitive landscape"], "justification": "Given the user''s interest in philosophy, complex environments, and motivation to work in a business context, developing strategic thinking skills will help the user in analyzing complex situations, making decisions, and creating meaningful impact.", "esco_description": "The ability to analyze complex situations, anticipate future outcomes, and make decisions that align with long-term organizational goals.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_9448", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "implement strategic management", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "leadership", "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "implement strategic management", "altlabels": "implement strategic management plan\ndeliver strategic management plan\ndevelop and implement strategic management plan\ndevise company development strategy\ndevise strategy for company development\ndevelop strategy for company development\nformulate and implement company development strategy\nimplement management strategy\nimplement strategic management principles\nformulate strategy for company development\nimplement strategic management", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/953445c0-4770-4be0-91cf-270a64c0e297", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Implement a strategy for the development and transformation of the company. Strategic management involves the formulation and implementation of the major objectives and initiatives of a company by senior management on behalf of the owners, based on consideration of available resources and an assessment of the internal and external environments in which the organisation operates.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5ec05073-a8df-4a0e-9ab2-7721591dd3b6\nb0011391-93ed-4047-b65d-f977fabbe608", "preferredlabel": "implement strategic management"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Conduct a strategic analysis of a local business, identifying its strengths, weaknesses, opportunities, and threats. Develop a SWOT matrix and provide recommendations for strategic improvements.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 38, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Strategic Leadership", "applications": ["Developing and executing business strategies", "Leading and motivating teams towards common goals", "Driving organizational growth and innovation"], "justification": "The user''s interest in creating companies and building relations aligns with the need for entrepreneurial leadership skills. This will enable the user to inspire others, lead teams, and navigate the business landscape to materialize their ideas.", "esco_description": "Strategic leadership involves the ability to envision, plan, and implement business strategies to drive growth and success. It requires the capacity to inspire and guide teams towards achieving organizational objectives.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_13533", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "motivate others", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "interpersonal", "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "motivate others", "altlabels": "inspire others\nmotivate others\nstimulate action\nenergise others\nempower others\nencourage others\nmotivating others\nmotivate staff and colleages", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/e2d44a9b-f28c-489e-9861-b654b5ded507", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Direct other people''s behaviour by providing them with a convincing reason for action.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "59bee618-e902-4c5f-af76-6e70b8b95df3\na8ca50f4-0f97-4961-8d3a-4a5f5f163790", "preferredlabel": "motivate others"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Choisis une action positive que tu souhaites voir dans ton entourage (par exemple, faire du bénévolat, organiser une collecte de fonds, ou aider une personne dans le besoin) et motive au moins 5 personnes de ton entourage à te rejoindre dans cette action. Assure-toi d''expliquer clairement l''impact positif que cette action aura.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 28, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Influencing Others", "applications": ["Negotiating contracts or agreements", "Leading and managing teams", "Convincing stakeholders to support a project or initiative"], "justification": "The user''s ability to attract attention, make connections, and understand others'' motives highlights the importance of developing interpersonal influence skills. This will support the user in building meaningful relationships and effectively communicating their ideas.", "esco_description": "Influencing others involves the ability to persuade and motivate individuals or groups to take a specific course of action or adopt a particular belief or attitude. This skill enables individuals to effectively communicate and negotiate to achieve desired outcomes.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_10726", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "solve problems", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "technical", "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "solve problems", "altlabels": "develop strategies to solve problems\ndemonstrate problem solving skills\nresolve problems\ndevelop strategy to solve problems\ncreate strategies to solve problems\nact intuitevely\ncreate solutions to problems\nmanage problems\ncome up with strategy to solve problems\napply problem solving\nsolve problems", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/adc6dc11-3376-467b-96c5-9b0a21edc869", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Find solutions to practical, operational or conceptual problems in a wide range of contexts.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "7188d9a2-20da-4533-bec8-579ff8a97f91\n921b43ba-e9ab-40d8-92ed-8e20ffafac49", "preferredlabel": "solve problems"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Le défi consiste à résoudre un problème réel qui impacte la vie quotidienne, comme trouver une solution innovante à un défi technologique, environnemental ou social.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 30, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Problem Solving", "applications": ["Analyzing economic data to identify trends and patterns", "Developing economic models to solve real-world problems", "Evaluating policy options and their potential impact on economic outcomes"], "justification": "Given the user''s strengths in critical thinking, creativity, and investigative career interests, honing analytical problem-solving skills will further enhance their ability to approach complex problems with a structured and analytical mindset.", "esco_description": "Analytical problem solving involves identifying complex issues, breaking them down into manageable components, and developing effective solutions using logical reasoning and critical thinking.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_12878", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "make decisions", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "cognitive", "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "make decisions", "altlabels": "take decisions\nchoose\nmake decisions\nmake decision\nmaking decisions\ndecide\nmake choices", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d62d2b4c-a6f8-439e-8a1b-4f29ab5f2c47", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Make a choice from several alternative possibilities.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "10170a3a-17bf-43ac-a683-a0bfb371bcbb\n37f57b39-7c5f-482d-b0b1-2e8c9fc8973d", "preferredlabel": "make decisions"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Over the course of a week, identify and document three real-life dilemmas you encounter, analyze the options available, make a decision, and execute it. Reflect on the outcomes and the impact of your decisions.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 46, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Adaptive Decision Making", "applications": ["Responding to market fluctuations in the economics industry", "Adjusting strategies in response to new economic policies", "Evaluating and adapting to changing consumer behaviors"], "justification": "The user''s experience in navigating conflicting decisions and their interest in working in complex environments necessitates the development of adaptive decision-making skills. This will enable the user to make effective decisions in dynamic and uncertain situations.", "esco_description": "Adaptive Decision Making involves the ability to quickly assess changing situations, analyze available information, and make effective decisions in response to dynamic circumstances. It requires the capacity to remain flexible and open-minded while evaluating various options and their potential outcomes.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1018", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "developing objectives and strategies", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "S4.1.0", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "developing objectives and strategies", "altlabels": "strategic planning\ndeveloping objectives and strategies", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6ee936b0-4e0c-4e04-97c7-1f4ee9230d67", "scopenote": "", "description": "Envisioning a future state and developing strategies, goals, objectives and action plans to achieve it.", "uuidhistory": "3a012fff-b177-4cf7-950f-8ebb35fe3510\nf020253a-e05c-4447-82bd-777648b45045", "preferredlabel": "developing objectives and strategies"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14598", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "make strategic business decisions", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "make strategic business decisions", "altlabels": "make tactical business decisions\npay per click\nmake strategic business decisions\nmake strategic business choices\nPPC", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f60c9e52-95fc-4ca1-a73c-18a491153b63", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Analyse business information and consult directors for decision making purposes in a varied array of aspects affecting the prospect, productivity and sustainable operation of a company. Consider the options and alternatives 