es and instruments for electronic submission and types of contract and contract performance clauses.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "e83f4a44-5024-4173-9368-e836ff01098c\ndeb70c82-3220-40a7-8ca0-c83ea1ff129d", "preferredlabel": "develop procurement strategy"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_7119", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "implement operational business plans", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "implement operational business plans", "altlabels": "implement strategic and operational business plans\nimplement operational business plans\nimplement plans for business operations\nuse business and strategic operational plans\nimplement business operational plans", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6abb92c9-0553-4d3d-add8-8240494e182d", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Implement the strategic business and operational plan for an organisation by engaging and delegating to others, monitoring progress and making adjustments along the way. Evaluate the extent to which strategic objectives have been achieved, learn lessons, celebrate success and recognise people’s contributions.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "3bb06545-dcb9-4a3a-8d1e-0e903cd3c03e\n066d8a79-133c-4c05-9998-fb05902d598f", "preferredlabel": "implement operational business plans"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15769", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "financial manager", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "1211.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "financial manager", "altlabels": "corporate finance manager\nfinancial administrator\nCFO\nchief financial officer\nfinance chief\nfinancial manager\nfinancial director\nfinance manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/30f3ea93-882a-4525-841c-1d5b4b64076f", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Financial managers handle all the matters in reference to the finance and investments of a company. They manage financial operations of companies such as the assets, liabilities, equity and cash flow aiming to maintain the financial health of the company and operative viability. Financial managers evaluate the strategic plans of the company in financial terms, maintain transparent financial operations for taxation and auditing bodies, and create the financial statements of the company at the end of the fiscal year.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "50abb007-8705-4c25-a5a5-0d9bf1b20cc4\n2aa51a19-0e23-4c1d-8257-246ad70d2ac3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "financial manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1211", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16131", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "strategic planning manager", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "1213.2.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "strategic planning manager", "altlabels": "strategic planning manager\nstrategic manager\nbusiness continuity strategy director\ncorporate strategist\nbusiness continuity planning director\nstrategy manager\nstrategic development manager\ninnovation and strategy specialist\nplanning manager\nstrategy adviser\nstrategic business planning manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/4f49df98-98b8-4a9e-98ad-9c5557817eba", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Strategic planning managers create, together with a team of managers, the strategic plans of the company as a whole, and provide coordination in the implementation per department. They help to interpret the overall plan and create a detailed plan for each one of the departments and branches. They ensure consistency in the implementation.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "8c3c9ea3-8453-4409-9419-d9ca909dab20\ne86026ef-9489-4599-a13f-5325397c2113", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "strategic planning manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1213", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_7738", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "lead others", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "lead others", "altlabels": "guide others\ntake on a leadership role\nleading others\nlead others\ndirect others\nsupervise others\ngive direction\nshow leadership attitude\nmanage people\nlead", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/75d8e5d9-bef3-418b-9011-01bff9f27207", "scopenote": "Excludes people performing management.", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Guide and direct others towards a common goal, often in a group or team.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "e8fb9eed-a125-46dc-8d0c-53582760cb23\n5eb890dd-c84e-485a-a618-6ef056886822", "preferredlabel": "lead others"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_979", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "social and communication skills and competences", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "T4", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "social and communication skills and competences", "altlabels": "interpersonal skills\ninterpersonal abilities\nsocial interactions\nsocial skills\nsocial interaction\nsocial and communication skills and competences", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/552c4f35-a2d1-49c2-8fda-afe26695c44a", "scopenote": "", "description": "Skills and competences relating to the ability to interact positively and productively with others. This is demonstrated by communicating ideas effectively and empathetically, coordinating one’s own objectives and actions with those of others and acting in ways which are structured according to values, ensuring the well-being and progress of others, and offering leadership.", "uuidhistory": "99f558db-6003-4430-8276-32cddba501a0\n3863e8ac-bec0-4e74-bd8f-a165890e9169", "preferredlabel": "social and communication skills and competences"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_10838", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "delegate responsibilities", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "delegate responsibilities", "altlabels": "delegate activities\ndistribute activities\ndelegate tasks\ndelegate activities to others\ndelegate\nshare duties\ndistribute tasks\nshare tasks\ndelegate responsibilities", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b00e948c-19be-4951-8cff-60f88f1046e9", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Delegate responsibilities, activities and tasks to others according to the ability, level of preparation and competence. Make sure that people understand what they should do and when they should do it. ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b5b09184-9feb-459e-b942-699d2c8992fc\n37680638-ff24-46ef-869d-51deba2ca45c", "preferredlabel": "delegate responsibilities"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_901", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "giving feedback", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "S1.8.3", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "giving feedback", "altlabels": "giving feedback", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/23cfb269-eec1-4011-8e57-c86203ce9fd7", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- provide feedback on job performance\n- give constructive feedback", "description": "Providing founded feedback on the performance of subordinates, co-workers and students through both criticism and praise in a respectful, clear, and consistent manner. Highlighting achievements as well as mistakes and set up methods of formative assessment.", "uuidhistory": "94f890f5-db44-4269-8cad-51324e8fdb18\n7a802c76-6b6c-4878-82a2-792d18bb4141", "preferredlabel": "giving feedback"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17961", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "minister of religion", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "2636.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "minister of religion", "altlabels": "nun\nspiritual leader\npastor\nminister of the church\npriest\nmember of the clergy\nreligious minister\nchurch minister\nminister of religion\ndeacon\nmonk\nordained clergyman\nbishop", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/ed256ed0-0432-4969-8544-3e5e01a517a9", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Ministers of religion lead religious organisations or communities, perform spiritual and religious ceremonies and provide spiritual guidance to members of a particular religious group. They may undertake missionary work, pastoral or preaching work, or work within a religious order or community, such as a monastery or convent. Ministers of religion perform duties such as leading worship services, giving religious education, officiating at funerals and marriages, counselling congregation members and offer a range of other community services, both in conjunction with the organisation they work for, and through their own personal day to day activities.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "fd04b352-4b47-49e1-b365-590e4905929e\ne4491189-03bc-4aea-acb2-72c53ae5241e", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "minister of religion", "occupationgroupcode": "2636", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17152", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "chaplain", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "2636.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "chaplain", "altlabels": "imam\nchaplain\nuniversity chaplain\nlay representative\nprison chaplain\nhospital chaplain\nrabbi\nmilitary chaplain", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/a4dd6eae-ca75-456f-829d-333671a7c186", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Chaplains perform religious activities in secular institutions. They perform counselling services and provide spiritual and emotional support to the people in the institution, as well as cooperate with priests or other religious officials to support religious activities in the community.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "cac94741-0d6e-4ed1-9d1a-71795c5d14d0\n466d04c9-eddb-4bbc-8413-389b5c5692de", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "chaplain", "occupationgroupcode": "2636", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1130", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "leading and motivating", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "S4.5.0", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "leading and motivating", "altlabels": "leadership\nleading and motivating", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b7e752ec-7b2e-46e6-ac24-8b1233609c31", "scopenote": "Excludes:\n- Managing, leading or supervising a team or its members.\n\nExamples:\n- Motivate employees\n- Provide leadership\n- Lead board meetings", "description": "Reinforcing an organization''s vision, inspiring and enthusing others to achieve positive outcomes. The focus of this group is on skills in motivating and inspiring others, rather than on managing and supervising a team.", "uuidhistory": "2292ff76-8385-448d-a2cb-be900376cf49\neb25c0a3-5a3b-4b31-af1e-8cd45119eff5", "preferredlabel": "leading and motivating"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17760", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "business coach", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "2424.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "business coach", "altlabels": "professional development coach\nleadership coach\nbusiness development coach\npractitioner of business coaching\ncoach in business development\nbusiness leadership coach\npersonal development coach\nbusiness coach\ncorporate coach\nexecutive coach", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/d9612966-e295-4d81-ba2b-9f36bad0b392", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Business coaches guide employees of a company or other institution in order to improve their personal effectiveness, increase their job satisfaction, and positively impact their career development in the business setting. They do this by leading the coachee (the person who is being coached) to resolution of their challenges by their own means. Business coaches aim to address specific tasks or reach specific goals, as opposed to overall development.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "804d485e-bdc2-4c6f-a796-af0f984715f8\na5c56e8c-cd93-431b-b8b5-f5b987255590", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "business coach", "occupationgroupcode": "2424", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16523", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "marketing manager", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "1221.3.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "marketing manager", "altlabels": "sales and marketing manager\npromotions manager\ntelemarketing manager\nmarket development manager\nmarketing director\nmarketing and promotions manager\nmarketing manager\nadvertising sales manager\nmarketing executive\nmarket manager\nproduct marketing manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/6fcf4638-e7c7-4978-9302-9a7b63a3d57c", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Marketing managers carry out the implementation of efforts related to the marketing operations in a company. They develop marketing strategies and plans by detailing cost and resources needed. They analyse the profitability of these plans, develop pricing strategies, and strive to raise awareness on products and companies among targeted customers.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "dfe24c26-b6a0-4d18-9c0b-4475aca161a5\n09d60a71-c124-4922-b983-5cfc3d5e2673", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "marketing manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1221", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1053", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "thinking skills and competences", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "T2", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "thinking skills and competences", "altlabels": "cognitive skills and competences\nuse of reason and logic\nthinking skills and competences", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/8267ecb5-c976-4b6a-809b-4ceecb954967", "scopenote": "", "description": "Skills and competences relating to the ability to apply the mental processes of gathering, conceptualizing, analysing, synthesizing, and/or evaluating information gathered from, or generated by, observation, experience, reflection, reasoning, or communication. They include the ability to evaluate and use information of different kinds to plan activities, achieve goals, solve problems, deal with issues and perform complex tasks in routine and novel ways.", "uuidhistory": "b1109b38-659a-42c5-94f3-51e2a8c37127\n7530b797-2536-40fb-a5dc-def572992988", "preferredlabel": "thinking skills and competences"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_10334", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "identify problems", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "identify problems", "altlabels": "diagnose problems\ndetect problems\nsignal problems\nidentify problems", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/a628d2d1-f40a-4c37-a357-2801726f2996", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Identify and detect problems and issues and decide on the best course of action. Report problems accordingly when needed.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "80dce92c-e0b7-4d19-9c3a-bdf0f36af5c6\nc5ac4ba9-3fe9-4c40-95b5-0134246f04c3", "preferredlabel": "identify problems"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1117", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "developing solutions", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "S1.9.1", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "developing solutions", "altlabels": "developing solutions", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/aca5081a-ceb0-4028-9cc5-1daafd4f86f9", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- troubleshoot\n- identify improvement actions\n- create solutions to problems\n\nExcludes:\n- repair and resolve technical problems with machinery and equipment\n- use ICT tools for problem solving\n", "description": "Developing solutions to practical, operational or conceptual problems which arise in the execution of work in a wide range of contexts.", "uuidhistory": "678d5f38-9778-4d32-a4df-eaeb68cbb785\n6e42e1ab-5b58-48bb-93c1-296066843412", "preferredlabel": "developing solutions"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17736", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "social services policy officer", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "2422.12.15", "type": "occupation", "label": "social services policy officer", "altlabels": "social services policy researcher\npolicy officer at social services\nsocial policy advisor\nsocial policy officer\nsocial policy researcher\nsocial policy development officer\npolicy officer, social services\nsocial policy analyst\nsocial services policy officer\nsocial policy specialist\nsocial services policy advisor", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/d6ef013f-57e9-4100-bbe5-3e4930664dee", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Social services policy officers research, analyse and develop social services policies and implement these policies and services to improve circumstances of disadvantaged and vulnerable members of society such as children and elderly people. They work in the administration of social services and stay in contact with organisations and other stakeholders and provide them with regular updates.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "6df73a5e-d7ec-48d1-8449-e149cd20cabd\n8a227e67-bec3-4b39-a6c4-089b54367423", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "social services policy officer", "occupationgroupcode": "2422", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16152", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "fiscal affairs policy officer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "2422.12.6", "type": "occupation", "label": "fiscal affairs policy officer", "altlabels": "fiscal policy analyst\ntax and development policy officer\npolicy officer, fiscal affairs\nfiscal policy officer\nfiscal policy researcher\nfiscal policy specialist\nfiscal policy consultant\nfiscal policy developer\nfiscal affairs policy officer\ntax policy officer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/50e00fda-ac7c-4bc5-9f19-69a33ff3d6e7", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Fiscal policy officers research, analyse and develop policies related to taxation and government spending in public policy sectors, and implement these policies to improve the existing regulation around the sector. They work closely with partners, external organisations or other stakeholders and provide them with regular updates.   ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "87242c22-db67-40f0-9a55-83eb6f589b69\n430bec35-eac1-45be-ab31-4dd8f5b5c53e", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "fiscal affairs policy officer", "occupationgroupcode": "2422", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_973", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "solving problems", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "S1.9.0", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "solving problems", "altlabels": "problem solving\nsolving problems", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/4feed491-dc09-4218-814a-0146e13ef4fe", "scopenote": "Excludes:\n- Repairing and resolving technical problems with machinery and equipment\n- Using ICT tools for problem solving", "description": "Developing and implementing solutions to practical, operational or conceptual problems which arise in the execution of work in a wide range of contexts.", "uuidhistory": "2876e012-bec0-42c7-a873-8dd139619d0e\nf0f083a8-e3d6-440a-8e0c-ae31f6491d75", "preferredlabel": "solving problems"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15465", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "specialist nurse", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "2221.3", "type": "occupation", "label": "specialist nurse", "altlabels": "nursing specialist\nnurse practitioner\ndiabetes nurse\ncompany nurse\nvascular nurse\nheart failure nurse\nspecialist nurse practitioner\nspecialist nurse\ncardiovascular nurse\nnurse heart diseases\nnurse specialist", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/18e14e61-495b-44cc-a7c6-df4c625934ba", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Specialist nurses promote and restore people''s health, and diagnose and care within a specific branch of the nursing field. Examples of such specialist nursing jobs include but are not restricted to; ambulatory care nurse, advanced practice nurse, cardiac nurse, dental nurse, community health nurse, forensic nurse, gastroenterology nurse, hospice and palliative care nurse, paediatric nurse, public health nurse, rehabilitation nurse, renal nurse and school nurse. Specialist nurses are general care nurses prepared beyond the level of a nurse generalist and authorised to practice as specialists with specific expertise in a branch of the nursing field. \n ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "9d8c96cf-f0ea-49d7-b095-c7dbcb198bc6\nc175bd04-3033-414c-ab84-6268621641d8", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "specialist nurse", "occupationgroupcode": "2221", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16819", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "nurse assistant", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "5321.1.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "nurse assistant", "altlabels": "assistant nursing practitioner\nhealthcare nurse\nstate enrolled nurse\nnurse auxiliary\nnurse assistant\nnursing assistant\nnursing auxiliary\nSEN\nassistant nurse\nauxiliary nurse", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/87d0795a-d41f-47ee-979f-0ab7d73836e7", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Nurse assistants provide basic patient care under direction of nursing staff. They perform duties such as feed, bathe, dress, groom, move patients or change linens and may transfer or transport patients.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "6d0d8517-c120-4842-934e-571dc81843be\nb38f1cf0-bfed-46c5-b68d-db3e3cf1a5b1", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "nurse assistant", "occupationgroupcode": "5321", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16430", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "precious stone setter", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "7313.1.7", "type": "occupation", "label": "precious stone setter", "altlabels": "precious stone setter\ndiamond setter\nprecious stone craftworker\nprecious stone craftswoman\ngem stone setter\ngem setter\njewelery stone setter\ngemsetter\njewellery stone setter\nprecious stone craftsman\ngemstone setter", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/6729aa5a-285f-4baf-a466-c2ccd2f2d96f", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Precious stone setters use tools to insert diamonds and other gemstones into jewellery settings according to specifications. The setting of the gemstone depends on its size and its shape.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a17f11ff-e5d5-45a5-a4de-86c117629ed9\n4c79e3d7-584a-43f2-9df0-e3ac810e7716", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "precious stone setter", "occupationgroupcode": "7313", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16433", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "jewellery assembler", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "8219.5", "type": "occupation", "label": "jewellery assembler", "altlabels": "jewelry craftsperson\njewellery craftsperson\njewellery craftswoman\nbrooch assembler\nassembler jewelry\nearring assembler\njewellery bench worker\njewellery craftsman\nnecklace assembler\njewelry assembler\njewelry craftsman\njewelry bench worker\nassembler of jewelry\njewelry craftswoman\nchain assembler\nbracelet assembler\njewelry repairer\nassembler of jewellery\nassembler jewellery\njewellery assembler", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/67b31696-9722-4b41-84d4-b25657266d59", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Jewellery assemblers assemble jewelry parts to form different types of jewellery such as bracelets, necklaces or earrings. They grip links with pliers or position the link in the slot of a linking ring, twist link joints open using pliers, attach all parts together and repair broken chains.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "ded83997-ed7c-40ab-b815-379b627d5706\ne4276c7c-be54-4b7a-97ff-2112fd47295e", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "jewellery assembler", "occupationgroupcode": "8219", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_967", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "sorting materials or products", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "S6.1.1", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "sorting materials or products", "altlabels": "sorting materials or products", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/485b2e3b-f883-46d8-901f-ab521d4f8e58", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- Differentiate types of packages\n- Sort waste", "description": "Arranging materials into predetermined categories or groups, according to established patterns of procedures.", "uuidhistory": "ca79448d-7ca2-4086-928f-a587fe6a46e1\n261a28c8-7279-44a1-87e7-64d1aca38896", "preferredlabel": "sorting materials or products"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_4219", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "funding methods", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "funding methods", "altlabels": "methods for funding\nfunding method\nfunding methods\nfinancial support methods\nfunding techniques", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/3556c075-eee0-4549-b730-48ae70cb5af9", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The financial possibilities for funding projects such as the traditional ones, namely loans, venture capital, public or private grants up to alternative methods such as crowdfunding.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "9a117328-be0a-4048-90ff-896c1696a98a\ndf6b2615-d097-455c-8bf9-e526feaf0f3a", "preferredlabel": "funding methods"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1165", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 2, "label": "making decisions", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "S4.9.0", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "making decisions", "altlabels": "making decisions", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c7f96545-46c4-451a-b284-014f4baed5ed", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- Decide on loan applications\n- Make legal decisions\n- Decide on products to be stocked", "description": "Making a choice from several alternative possibilities.", "uuidhistory": "a3a68f59-3daa-4e4f-859c-6680bbceba70\n77f4fc50-decd-4ad1-97db-fbcb23fad329", "preferredlabel": "making decisions"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15514", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "EU funds manager", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "1213.6", "type": "occupation", "label": "EU funds manager", "altlabels": "EU funds operational programs manager\neuropean funds policy manager\npolicy officer for EU funds\nEU policy and funding expert\nEU funds policy officer\nregional policy officer\nEU projects supervisor\nEU fund manager in Joint Secretariat\nofficer for EU management and control\nEU projects coordinator\nEU funds manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/1c85eee2-a8ca-4750-a889-10a3e6c17b80", "scopenote": "Does not include regional development policy officers.", "definition": "", "description": "EU funds managers administer EU funds and financial resources in public administrations. They are involved in the definition of investment priorities and are responsible for drafting the Operational Programs, liaising with national authorities for determining the programs ’objectives and priority axes. EU funds managers supervise projects financed through EU funds, monitoring their implementation and the results achieved and are involved in certification and auditing activities. They might also be responsible for managing the relations with the European institutions for issues related to state aids and the grant management.  ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "6a34b62e-a0bc-42d0-b15c-16a204791710\n32b283c1-1c1b-46ea-9e74-58515b5020a8", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "EU funds manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1213", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15821", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "venue programmer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "3332.3", "type": "occupation", "label": "venue programmer", "altlabels": "dance programmer\nvenue programming assistant\nmusic programmer\ntheatre programmer\nvenue programer\nin-house promoter\nvenue booker & promoter\nclub programmer\nvenue booker\nvenue programmer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/35bedc78-1c15-4db7-9c6d-c55e9b5c7b54", "scopenote": "Includes venue booker.", "definition": "", "description": "Venue programmers are in charge of the artistic programme of a venue (theatres, cultural centers, concert halls etc.) or of temporary settings (festivals). They follow artistic trends and up-coming artists, keep in contact with bookers and agents to build a consistent programme and encourage artistic creation. All of this happens within the boundaries of the artistic and financial scope of the organisation they are involved in.  \n ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "f4f3a2a9-f748-4336-bed9-156c44fc1d1d\na563f964-8f50-4e16-80d8-de0be2d8305d", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "venue programmer", "occupationgroupcode": "3332", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_11169", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "take artistic vision into account", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "take artistic vision into account", "altlabels": "bear artistic vision in mind\nrespect artistic vision\ntaking artistic vision into account\nconsider artistic vision\ntake artistic vision into account\nunderstand artistic vision", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b669e7a7-9987-49a2-a918-ba16a19bd55e", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Take the artistic and creative vision of the organisation into account when selecting a project.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "26d7cff3-f1b0-4cb5-8e57-dfd01973d590\n7796f391-3a8a-49d9-87f1-df104c5ea6be", "preferredlabel": "take artistic vision into account"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_1687", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "represent artistic production", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "represent artistic production", "altlabels": "represent the production of artists\nrepresent the artistic production\nrepresent artistic production\nrepresent artistic company\nact on behalf of the production company", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/088c1b82-a759-442e-bb78-128c3ee3a3a8", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Represent the artistic company or production outside your day-to-day activities. Liaise with presenters and their teams. Help direct tours.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "994e5404-ec9a-4efa-afd8-883ae2c84bd8\n01ff81f5-2865-4240-b146-ef8abcb5d9ba", "preferredlabel": "represent artistic production"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1041", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "developing educational programmes", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "S4.1.6", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "developing educational programmes", "altlabels": "developing educational programmes", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7e0b93e0-0de7-4607-b07f-27a6828d3ff0", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- develop curriculum\n- construct individual learning plans\n- develop training programmes", "description": "Developing education and training programs, plans, or procedures for society in general, specific groups or tailored to an individual''s learning needs.", "uuidhistory": "7ac2b79c-f6a6-43cd-980b-11ca6e206966\n773469f7-bf54-4c56-a75a-5a568f5361a9", "preferredlabel": "developing educational programmes"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_937", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "developing financial, business or marketing plans", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "S4.1.2", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "developing financial, business or marketing plans", "altlabels": "developing financial, business or marketing plans", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/37272760-957a-4c34-b4f3-780ee285334d", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- Develop business case\n- Draw up marketing and sales plan\n- Create a financial plan", "description": "Envision and develop strategies and plans for companies and organisations aimed at purposes such as establishing new markets, refurbishing the equipment and machinery of a company, implementing pricing strategies, and restoring or maintaining financial viability.", "uuidhistory": "4666888d-a4b0-41d0-87f3-425bf2e563c2\n55304a64-8d3c-46e8-bd46-4aed8d4116da", "preferredlabel": "developing financial, business or marketing plans"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1172", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "identifying opportunities", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "S4.1.1", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "identifying opportunities", "altlabels": "identifying opportunities", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/cbe1b24e-00f3-4b17-94e9-1fcd34a11c3e", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- identify market niches\n- identify new business opportunities\n- identify process improvements", "description": "Identifying business or organizational opportunities.", "uuidhistory": "45646f20-6181-4980-8302-55acba370a74\ne3847bcd-6f28-4d2c-a3f9-6222f3b1e395", "preferredlabel": "identifying opportunities"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_13027", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "manage time", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "manage time", "altlabels": "draw up time line\nmanaging time\nmeet deadlines\nplan deadlines\nmanage time\ncoordinate actions\nadhere to schedules\nschedule\nprioritise actions\nmanage schedule\nplan time\nwork out time line\nset priorities\nprioritise tasks\ndefine milestones", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d9013e0e-e937-43d5-ab71-0e917ee882b8", "scopenote": "Excludes <a resource=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7a8fb784-67fa-41e9-a75c-6b491d91f800\" typeOf=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/model#Skill\" href=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7a8fb784-67fa-41e9-a75c-6b491d91f800\"><span property=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label\" xml:lang=\"en\">develop strategy to solve problems</span></a>.", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Plan the time sequence of events, programmes and activities, as well as the work of others.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "cc6f8a89-364a-4130-b0db-308faee77993\n32f704ce-2798-4589-9479-9b23c9a5572c", "preferredlabel": "manage time"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14273", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "manage medium term objectives", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "manage medium term objectives", "altlabels": "oversee medium term objectives\nmanaged medium term objectives\nmanage objectives of medium term\nadministration of medium term business objectives\nmanage medium term objectives", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f077719c-82ff-4035-9426-47c5eb554454", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Monitor medium term schedules with budget estimations and reconciliation on a quarterly basis.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "9209a9db-8fb5-4c10-a35b-d9e4566c2e87\n53ac704a-2807-4db3-859a-86a1645713d2", "preferredlabel": "manage medium term objectives"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16482", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "tourism product manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "1221.6", "type": "occupation", "label": "tourism product manager", "altlabels": "tourism product developer\ntourism distribution manager\ntourism product manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/6ce3c372-408b-4c46-86d8-ad6b9255d686", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Tourism product managers analyse the market, research potential offers, develop products, plan and organise the distribution and marketing processes.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b4a7683a-a3e6-4536-8251-6776e1caead5\nf7860433-c081-4c45-be6c-650b36b564e9", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "tourism product manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1221", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16755", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "monitoring and evaluation officer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "2422.10", "type": "occupation", "label": "monitoring and evaluation officer", "altlabels": "M&E officer\nsocial impact assessment analyst\neconomic impact assessment officer\nresearch and evaluation officer\nsocial impact assessment specialist\nevaluation Officer\nevaluator\nmonitoring, evaluation and learning officer\nMEL officer\nimpact assessment manager\nmonitoring evaluation, impact and learning officer\nMEIL officer\nmonitoring and evaluation specialist\nMEL Project Officer\nmonitoring and reporting analyst\nmonitoring and evaluation officer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/8213b4bc-60ce-4ffc-9e00-9758fb2003c6", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Monitoring and evaluation officers are responsible for the conceptualisation, design, implementation and follow-up of the monitoring and evaluation activities of projects, programmes, policies, strategies, institutions or processes, along the relevant programming cycle. They develop monitoring, inspection and evaluation methods and instruments needed to collect and analyse data, and report on results by applying structured M&E frameworks, theories, approaches and methodologies. M&E officers inform decision-making through reporting, learning products or activities and knowledge management. They can also engage in capacity development activities by providing training and capacity building support within their organizations or for clients and partners.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "c8dff0ae-83a1-4db8-bbb4-47e36dd62bd8\n90635fc0-1df3-4190-8ccc-cda73cd66da0", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "monitoring and evaluation officer", "occupationgroupcode": "2422", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17610", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "policy officer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "2422.12", "type": "occupation", "label": "policy officer", "altlabels": "policy analyst\nhealth policy officer\npolicy researcher\npolicy coordinator\npolicy manager\nstrategy advisor\npolicy officer\nstrategy manager\npolicy advisor", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/caf7b8fb-b2d6-46b7-bffa-bea7f8e4aed8", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Policy officers research, analyse and develop policies in various public sectors, and shape and implement these policies to improve the existing regulation around the sector. They evaluate effects of existing policies and report findings to the government and members of the public. Policy officers work closely with partners, external organisations or other stakeholders and provide them with regular updates.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "4e10bba3-027a-4326-9a9f-2eeba0d8c0f8\nf63c7116-8f24-4e24-80e2-5e0e6ac022e4", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "policy officer", "occupationgroupcode": "2422", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16121", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "advertising manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "1222.1.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "advertising manager", "altlabels": "advertising account planner\npromotions manager\nadvertising manager\nadvertising coordinator\nadvertising executive\nadvertising and promotions manager\ncampaigns coordinator\npromotions coordinator\nadvertising campaign manager\nmarketing communication 