\ncake press operative\nhydraulic press worker\nplastic cake press setter\nplastic production process operative\nhydraulic press tender", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/96514fed-b9a9-4df3-ab0b-20676369297d", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Cake press operators set up and tend the hydraulic presses that compress and bake plastic chips into cake moulds to produce plastic sheets. They regulate and adjust the pressure and temperature.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "593191aa-0efb-4d10-8cd2-05bc04d5f96c\nf4b24b04-6594-4419-8bff-6f1a982f03bc", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "cake press operator", "occupationgroupcode": "8142", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17818", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "rubber dipping machine operator", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "8141.1.5", "type": "occupation", "label": "rubber dipping machine operator", "altlabels": "rubber dipping machine operator\nrubber process machine operator\nrubber dipping machine operative\ndrop-machine operator\nrubber processing machine operative\ndrop-machine operative\nrubber processing machine operator", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/df433613-4856-4e50-9be5-7a0ec0f4260a", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Rubber dipping machine operators dip forms into liquid latex to manufacture rubber products such as balloons, finger cots or prophylactics. They mix the latex and pour it into the machine. Rubber dipping machine operators take a sample of latex goods after final dip and weigh it. They add ammonia or more latex to machine if the product does not meet requirements.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b0445ecc-222a-410c-89a3-69777801a4a8\n99e722ff-b086-4eca-b0f8-2f679ea318e3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "rubber dipping machine operator", "occupationgroupcode": "8141", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17238", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "fibre machine tender", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "8181.6", "type": "occupation", "label": "fibre machine tender", "altlabels": "extruding and forming machine setter\nfiber machine operative\nstaple fiber machine tender\nforming machine setter\nfiber machine tender\nstaple fibre machine tender\nfibre machine operative\nglass fibre machine operator\nfiber extruding machine operator\nfibre machine operator\nextruding machine setter\nfibre machine tender", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/ac401ec0-7ce0-423f-b8b5-167da9e046a7", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Fibre machine tenders operate and maintain extrusion machines that form sliver from filaments. They work with synthetic materials such as fiberglass or liquid polymer or non-synthetic materials such as rayon.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "0a25ffa8-d786-4231-b0af-8f5f79e015ec\ne5a51eb4-d97c-4dba-bc34-e5f23110c96f", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "fibre machine tender", "occupationgroupcode": "8181", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_13205", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "food and beverage industry", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "food and beverage industry", "altlabels": "food and beverage trading\nfood and beverage commerce\nfood and beverage business\nthe food and beverage industry\nfood and beverage industries\nfood and beverage industry", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/dc57f705-75b6-4232-b531-1f020afa0364", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "The respective industry and the processes involved in the food and beverage industry, such as raw material selection, processing, packaging, and storage.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "aa90a435-42ba-4262-931d-1c75514ccd5e\na02a22b8-1edf-4c3b-a03d-973235b895df", "preferredlabel": "food and beverage industry"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_5802", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "configure plants for food industry", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "configure plants for food industry", "altlabels": "build plants for food industry\nconfigure plants for food industry\nconfigure plants for the food industry\nconstruct plants for food industry\ndevelop plants for food industry\nset up plants for food industry\nconfigure of plants for the food industry", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/52c3a6cf-90b1-4cba-b5b6-30561f298314", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Design plants configuration, including sources and equipment for the food industry so that they can be readily adapted to suit the product range and the process technologies involved. Take environmental and economic aspects into account.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "9fa4d463-5d03-46d5-8e5d-d31b7e7a2387\n32777e86-bc10-4e0c-b68c-4f1f9d86206c", "preferredlabel": "configure plants for food industry"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17191", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "food production manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "1321.2.1.3", "type": "occupation", "label": "food production manager", "altlabels": "food production manager\nfood production team leader\nfood production supervisor\nproduction manager food and beverages", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/a7d6a377-3d3b-41cf-9301-f4a0a7ad3d96", "scopenote": "Excludes people working in small companies.", "definition": "", "description": "Food production managers oversee and monitor production and have overall responsibility for staffing and related issues. Hence, they have a detailed knowledge of the manufacturing products and their production processes. On the one hand, they control process parameters and their influence on the product and on the other hand, they ensure that staffing and recruitment levels are adequate.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "13740aea-804e-495e-9ae2-e8251dbab3ce\nd54be51e-f742-4166-88c0-236fc7db68ec", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "food production manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1321", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_3898", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "innovation processes", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "innovation processes", "altlabels": "innovation processes", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/2fb8480e-de3c-462b-b169-e8bbb344da68", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "The techniques, models, methods and strategies which contribute to the promotion of steps towards innovation.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "50cab859-5fef-4456-85ba-70d53488a360\nc48829b3-3ddd-4003-9591-81316211fc3d", "preferredlabel": "innovation processes"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16241", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "eBusiness manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "2431.10.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "eBusiness manager", "altlabels": "eBusiness development manager\ne-business managers\neBusiness manager\neCommerce manager\neBusiness managers\ne-commerce manager\nweb business development manager\neBusiness development officer\ne-commerce development manager\ne-business manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/586fe133-1987-41f4-b89a-f39d4bc58e1e", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "eBusiness managers create and execute a company''s electronic strategy plan for selling products and services online. They also improve data integrity, placement of online tools and brand exposure and monitor sales for companies that market products to customers using the internet. They collaborate with the marketing and sales management team using ICT tools to reach sales goals and provide accurate information and offerings to business partners.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "4a9bdc3e-a238-4b4e-b6ea-27488c4e2c8c\nf8818dcc-48e7-4deb-9a88-2bb041eac567", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "eBusiness manager", "occupationgroupcode": "2431", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17813", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "brand manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "2431.4", "type": "occupation", "label": "brand manager", "altlabels": "assistant brand manager\nsenior brand manager\ntrainee brand manager\nbrand manager\nformula manager\nmarketing manager (brand development)\nmarket development executive\ngraduate brand manager\nbrand executive\nmarketing development manager\nbrand development manager\nbrand marketing manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/de80bbf0-447d-4a6a-845a-fdba4e0dc30c", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Brand managers analyse and plan the way a brand is positioned on the market.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "3ba370e5-250d-49e6-990a-5e0a295a660e\n882536f9-ec37-406c-af1a-25db89cdf2b1", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "brand manager", "occupationgroupcode": "2431", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16131", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "occupation::key_16131", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": true, "graph_id": "92622b6f-04be-4212-9489-861ffdb227a7", "metadata": {"code": "1213.2.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "strategic planning manager", "node_id": "occupation::key_16131", "altlabels": "strategic planning manager\nstrategic manager\nbusiness continuity strategy director\ncorporate strategist\nbusiness continuity planning director\nstrategy manager\nstrategic development manager\ninnovation and strategy specialist\nplanning manager\nstrategy adviser\nstrategic business planning manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/4f49df98-98b8-4a9e-98ad-9c5557817eba", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Strategic planning managers create, 