ting market trends and competitive landscape"], "justification": "Given the user''s interest in philosophy, complex environments, and motivation to work in a business context, developing strategic thinking skills will help the user in analyzing complex situations, making decisions, and creating meaningful impact.", "original_label": "Strategic Thinking", "esco_description": "The ability to analyze complex situations, anticipate future outcomes, and make decisions that align with long-term organizational goals."}, {"id": "skill::key_9448", "score": 0.274197876, "category": "leadership", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "implement strategic management", "node_id": "skill::key_9448", "altlabels": "implement strategic management plan\ndeliver strategic management plan\ndevelop and implement strategic management plan\ndevise company development strategy\ndevise strategy for company development\ndevelop strategy for company development\nformulate and implement company development strategy\nimplement management strategy\nimplement strategic management principles\nformulate strategy for company development\nimplement strategic management", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/953445c0-4770-4be0-91cf-270a64c0e297", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Implement a strategy for the development and transformation of the company. Strategic management involves the formulation and implementation of the major objectives and initiatives of a company by senior management on behalf of the owners, based on consideration of available resources and an assessment of the internal and external environments in which the organisation operates.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5ec05073-a8df-4a0e-9ab2-7721591dd3b6\nb0011391-93ed-4047-b65d-f977fabbe608", "preferredlabel": "implement strategic management"}, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Strategic Leadership", "applications": ["Developing and executing business strategies", "Leading and motivating teams towards common goals", "Driving organizational growth and innovation"], "justification": "The user''s interest in creating companies and building relations aligns with the need for entrepreneurial leadership skills. This will enable the user to inspire others, lead teams, and navigate the business landscape to materialize their ideas.", "original_label": "Entrepreneurial Leadership", "esco_description": "Strategic leadership involves the ability to envision, plan, and implement business strategies to drive growth and success. It requires the capacity to inspire and guide teams towards achieving organizational objectives."}, {"id": "skill::key_13533", "score": 0.33238136799999995, "category": "interpersonal", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "motivate others", "node_id": "skill::key_13533", "altlabels": "inspire others\nmotivate others\nstimulate action\nenergise others\nempower others\nencourage others\nmotivating others\nmotivate staff and colleages", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/e2d44a9b-f28c-489e-9861-b654b5ded507", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Direct other people''s behaviour by providing them with a convincing reason for action.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "59bee618-e902-4c5f-af76-6e70b8b95df3\na8ca50f4-0f97-4961-8d3a-4a5f5f163790", "preferredlabel": "motivate others"}, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Influencing Others", "applications": ["Negotiating contracts or agreements", "Leading and managing teams", "Convincing stakeholders to support a project or initiative"], "justification": "The user''s ability to attract attention, make connections, and understand others'' motives highlights the importance of developing interpersonal influence skills. This will support the user in building meaningful relationships and effectively communicating their ideas.", "original_label": "Interpersonal Influence", "esco_description": "Influencing others involves the ability to persuade and motivate individuals or groups to take a specific course of action or adopt a particular belief or attitude. This skill enables individuals to effectively communicate and negotiate to achieve desired outcomes."}, {"id": "skill::key_10726", "score": 0.429118931, "category": "technical", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "solve problems", "node_id": "skill::key_10726", "altlabels": "develop strategies to solve problems\ndemonstrate problem solving skills\nresolve problems\ndevelop strategy to solve problems\ncreate strategies to solve problems\nact intuitevely\ncreate solutions to problems\nmanage problems\ncome up with strategy to solve problems\napply problem solving\nsolve problems", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/adc6dc11-3376-467b-96c5-9b0a21edc869", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Find solutions to practical, operational or conceptual problems in a wide range of contexts.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "7188d9a2-20da-4533-bec8-579ff8a97f91\n921b43ba-e9ab-40d8-92ed-8e20ffafac49", "preferredlabel": "solve problems"}, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Problem Solving", "applications": ["Analyzing economic data to identify trends and patterns", "Developing economic models to solve real-world problems", "Evaluating policy options and their potential impact on economic outcomes"], "justification": "Given the user''s strengths in critical thinking, creativity, and investigative career interests, honing analytical problem-solving skills will further enhance their ability to approach complex problems with a structured and analytical mindset.", "original_label": "Analytical Problem Solving", "esco_description": "Analytical problem solving involves identifying complex issues, breaking them down into manageable components, and developing effective solutions using logic