ompetence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "occupation-specific", "description": "Encourage parties to communicate among them and share their views on events and happenings in order to find cooperation paths.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a7598cf6-f21e-41a5-91e1-37d81bef66e9\nf53fab7a-b3d8-40a5-97f0-b0e4585f65f4", "preferredlabel": "promote communication between parties"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Organisez une séance d''interview croisée avec un(e) ami(e) ou un collègue. Chacun pose des questions à l''autre sur des sujets variés pour promouvoir la communication et la compréhension mutuelle.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 31, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Effective Communication", "applications": ["Conducting meetings and negotiations", "Providing customer service", "Collaborating with colleagues and stakeholders"], "justification": "With a natural ability to understand others'' motives and a desire to work in environments requiring psychology and understanding of people, improving interpersonal communication will enhance their leadership potential and ability to inspire others.", "esco_description": "The ability to convey information clearly and effectively, listen actively, and respond appropriately in various professional contexts. It involves building rapport, resolving conflicts, and fostering positive relationships.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_6843", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "entrepreneurship", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "leadership", "graph_id": "9d6f68a3-5c2e-4541-9189-c747536357d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "entrepreneurship", "altlabels": "entrepreneurship\nbusiness initiative\nentrepreneurialism", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/658605f2-1c95-49f0-bd98-0af7b15ad0b0", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The development, organisation and management of an own business venture.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "d5822232-fc8a-48b4-9bf2-a616dbde4bab\na7283b9c-44ac-4d18-849c-d7bba1537276", "preferredlabel": "entrepreneurship"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Trouvez une idée de start-up, réalisez une étude de marché, rédigez un business plan sommaire et présentez-le à un panel d''entrepreneurs locaux.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 31, "confidence": 0.9, "esco_label": "Entrepreneurship", "applications": ["Developing and launching new business ventures", "Identifying and exploiting market opportunities", "Taking calculated risks in business decision-making"], "justification": "Aligned with their interest in creating companies and their enterprising personality, developing entrepreneurship skills will empower them to bring their ideas to market and build meaningful relations between things.", "esco_description": "Identifying business opportunities, taking calculated risks, and creating new ventures to achieve economic success.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_2631", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "analyse data for policy decisions in trade", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "technical", "graph_id": "9d6f68a3-5c2e-4541-9189-c747536357d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "analyse data for policy decisions in trade", "altlabels": "analysing data for policy decisions in trade\nsearch data for policy decisions in trade\ntest data for policy decisions in trade\nanalysis of data for policy decisions in trade\ninvestigate data for policy decisions in trade\nanalyse data for a policy decision in trade\nanalyze  data for policy decisions in trade\nscrutinise data for policy decisions in trade\nanalyse data for policy decisions in trade", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/19aa10ee-35fb-4ba1-b8dc-51525c090ccc", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Analyse data about a specific company, retailer, market or store formula. Process all gathered information into a corporate plan, and use it to prepare upcoming policy decisions.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5056b55b-fab5-454f-8a81-dcd59c8ae0d1\n84a8fa71-b2af-4ace-9073-69de39cba3be", "preferredlabel": "analyse data for policy decisions in trade"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Collectez des données sur les importations et exportations d''un produit spécifique entre deux pays, analysez les tendances et identifiez les principales conclusions pour éclairer les décisions politiques en matière de commerce.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 22, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Data Analysis", "applications": ["Identifying trends and patterns in economic data", "Developing economic forecasts and models", "Supporting evidence-based policy making"], "justification": "Complementing their strong analytical thinking and investigative interests, improving data analysis skills will provide a solid foundation for making informed decisions and understanding complex economic dynamics.", "esco_description": "Utilizing statistical methods and software to interpret and analyze complex datasets, enabling informed decision-making and strategic planning.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_12014", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "think creatively", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "creative", "graph_id": "9d6f68a3-5c2e-4541-9189-c747536357d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "think creatively", "altlabels": "visualise completed work\nanticipate needs\ninnovate\nbrainstorming\nthink creatively\nwork conceptually\nfind new ideas\nvisualise completed project\nuse imagination\ndesign\nseek out questions\nthinking creatively\nexperiment\nthink in a creative way\nshow originality\ninnovative thinking", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c624c6a3-b0ba-4a31-a296-0d433fe47e41", "scopenote": "Includes people performing activities outside the artistic 