r to resolve a point of difference, without losing sight of one''s own or others'' intentions or goals.\n", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "dd58a9bd-0a4b-4c22-a928-ec8db066e6c7\nd4062440-a20f-4555-8ca8-b5ae11bff0b4", "preferredlabel": "negotiate compromises"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_5522", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "confer with library colleagues", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "9d6f68a3-5c2e-4541-9189-c747536357d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "confer with library colleagues", "altlabels": "confer with library colleagues\nconsult with library colleagues\nconfer with library colleague\ndiscuss with library colleagues\nconferring with library colleagues\nget feedback from library colleagues", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/4e10bb72-d6ba-414d-a9e3-d653cddf7ce3", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Communicate with colleagues and collaborators; make collection decisions and determine present and future library services to offer.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "72de7510-661d-4c20-b15d-bf9fca91b8ad\n94191e39-e74d-4d0e-8871-d92c99a1635b", "preferredlabel": "confer with library colleagues"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15769", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "financial manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "9d6f68a3-5c2e-4541-9189-c747536357d0", "metadata": {"code": "1211.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "financial manager", "altlabels": "corporate finance manager\nfinancial administrator\nCFO\nchief financial officer\nfinance chief\nfinancial manager\nfinancial director\nfinance manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/30f3ea93-882a-4525-841c-1d5b4b64076f", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Financial managers handle all the matters in reference to the finance and investments of a company. They manage financial operations of companies such as the assets, liabilities, equity and cash flow aiming to maintain the financial health of the company and operative viability. Financial managers evaluate the strategic plans of the company in financial terms, maintain transparent financial operations for taxation and auditing bodies, and create the financial statements of the company at the end of the fiscal year.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "50abb007-8705-4c25-a5a5-0d9bf1b20cc4\n2aa51a19-0e23-4c1d-8257-246ad70d2ac3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "financial manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1211", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_13625", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "financial jurisdiction", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "9d6f68a3-5c2e-4541-9189-c747536357d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "financial jurisdiction", "altlabels": "financial control\nfinancial oversight\nfinancial authority\nfinancial jurisdictions\nfinancial jurisdiction\nfinance jurisdiction\nfinancial purview", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/e4c205f6-55ba-4bed-9c5d-2032058300c0", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Financial rules and procedures applicable to a certain location, whose regulatory bodies decide on its jurisdiction", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "38e2f8c9-1487-402e-b341-555583f5cb1c\nd9b815f0-294c-44a5-9a88-a5b15b78c56c", "preferredlabel": "financial jurisdiction"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "oc