tp://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/658605f2-1c95-49f0-bd98-0af7b15ad0b0", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The development, organisation and management of an own business venture.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "d5822232-fc8a-48b4-9bf2-a616dbde4bab\na7283b9c-44ac-4d18-849c-d7bba1537276", "preferredlabel": "entrepreneurship"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Trouvez une idée de startup, réalisez une étude de marché sommaire, identifiez votre public cible et validez l''idée auprès d''au moins 10 personnes de votre entourage.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 26, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Entrepreneurship", "applications": ["Developing business plans and strategies", "Seeking funding and investment opportunities", "Managing business operations and growth"], "justification": "Given the user''s interest in creating companies and their strong leadership and enterprising traits, developing entrepreneurship skills will align with their career goals and enable them to work in complex environments while utilizing their leadership abilities.", "esco_description": "Identifying business opportunities, taking calculated risks, and managing resources to create and develop new ventures.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_9435", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "interpret psychological tests", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "interpersonal", "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "interpret psychological tests", "altlabels": "obtain information from psychological test\ninterpret psychological test\nobtain information from psychological tests\nanalyze psychological tests\ninterpret psychological tests\nanalyse psychological tests", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/94f2935b-b4ac-446e-9775-60b4239d016c", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Interpret psychological tests in order to obtain information on patients'' intelligence, achievements, interests, and personality.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a1ceeb09-8d8c-4f34-97ba-70450ba23f75\n6faf7c00-4b49-494b-991d-da44c5208227", "preferredlabel": "interpret psychological tests"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Select and analyze a psychological test, such as the Myers-Briggs Type Indicator or the Big Five Personality Test. Research the test''s background, administration, scoring, and interpretation. Administer the test to at least 5 willing participants and interpret the results to identify patterns and insights.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 45, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Psychological Analysis", "applications": ["Conducting psychological assessments for economic decision-making", "Applying psychological insights to consumer behavior analysis", "Utilizing psychological understanding to inform economic policy development"], "justification": "With a keen interest in understanding people, the user would benefit from developing skills in psychology to enhance their ability to create relations between things and work in complex environments requiring an understanding of people.", "esco_description": "Utilizing psychological understanding to analyze human behavior, emotions, and thought processes in professional contexts.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_8161", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "think critically", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "cognitive", "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "think critically", "altlabels": "weigh information\nassess information\ncheck facts\nevaluate important information\nevaluating information\ndetect bias\nevaluate opinions\nconsider alternative views\nassess facts\nassess opinions\nevaluate information and its sources\nevaluate information\ndistinguish fact from opinion\nevaluate truth\nassess processes\nverify information\ncritically evaluate information and its sources\nevaluate facts\nreview information\napply critical thinking\nthink critically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7dd94ad3-13d6-43fe-8b94-51fcbf67ced9", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Make and defend judgements based on internal evidence and external criteria. Critically evaluate the credibility and reliability of information before using or passing it on to others. Develop independent and critical thinking.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b49909ff-d5a7-4485-ba38-51806d8f3841\n9cedb574-55f2-4e23-b3fe-3180a0c22259", "preferredlabel": "think critically"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Choisissez un article d''actualité sur un sujet qui vous intéresse. Analysez-le en identifiant les arguments principaux, les sources utilisées, les biais éventuels et les implications. Rédigez un résumé critique de l''article en mettant en évidence les forces et les faiblesses de l''argumentation.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 39, "confidence": 0.9, "esco_label": "Critical Thinking", "applications": ["Analyzing economic data to identify trends and patterns", "Evaluating the impact of policy changes on economic indicators", "Formulating evidence-based recommendations for economic strategies"], "justification": "Building on the user''s existing strength in critical thinking, further developing this skill will support their goal of working in complex environments, as it is essential for analyzing and solving complex problems, which is aligned with their career interests in investigative and enterprising fields.", "esco_description": "Analyzing and evaluating information to make reasoned judgments and decisions. It involves logical reasoning, problem-solving, and the ability to think systematically.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14598", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "make strategic business decisions", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "leadership", "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "make strategic business decisions", "altlabels": "make tactical business decisions\npay per click\nmake strategic business decisions\nmake strategic business choices\nPPC", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f60c9e52-95fc-4ca1-a73c-18a491153b63", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Analyse business information and consult directors for decision making purposes in a varied array of aspects affecting the prospect, productivity and sustainable operation of a company. Consider the options and alternatives to a challenge and make sound rational decisions based on analysis and experience.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "71709697-2eda-4fe4-9160-e6a258ea6b0a\n0441380e-ef76-4ac6-b610-8c854edf11df", "preferredlabel": "make strategic business decisions"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "You will research a real-life business scenario and create a presentation outlining a strategic decision, including the rationale and potential impact on the business.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 20, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Strategic Decision Making", "applications": ["Developing long-term business strategies", "Evaluating investment opportunities", "Assessing market trends and competitive landscapes"], "justification": "With a desire to help create companies and a strong interest in leadership and entrepreneurial endeavors, developing skills in strategic decision making will support the user in making impactful decisions and leading others in the business context.", "esco_description": "The ability to analyze complex situations, consider various options, and make informed decisions that align with organizational goals and objectives.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_1648", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "creative", "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "altlabels": "propose technical solutions to business problems\npropose ICT solutions to business problems", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/07e51c60-763a-4335-b4ec-70a15f66d328", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Suggest how to solve business issues, using ICT means, so that business processes are improved.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "57bfedf4-70e2-4736-a01e-ed696a50518a\n2949f643-88a5-411e-83d2-109f0749a45a", "preferredlabel": "propose ICT solutions to business problems"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Trouvez une petite entreprise locale et proposez une solution TIC pour résoudre l''un de leurs problèmes commerciaux. Identifiez le problème, proposez une solution TIC pertinente et créez un plan d''implémentation.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 33, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Problem Solving", "applications": ["Developing new business models in the economics industry", "Designing and implementing cost-saving measures", "Creating innovative strategies to address economic challenges"], "justification": "Given the user''s high creativity rating and interest in working in complex environments, developing creative problem-solving skills will enable them to apply their creativity to solve complex business and interpersonal challenges, aligning with their career goals and personal strengths.", "esco_description": "The ability to creatively analyze complex issues, identify innovative solutions, and implement effective problem-solving strategies.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_694", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "management and administration", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "management and administration", "altlabels": "management and administration", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/isced-f/0413", "scopenote": "", "description": "Management and administration is the study of planning, directing and operating the functions and activities of organizations and institutions. Programmes in management also including administration, economics, finance etc. are included here if emphasis is given to management and administration.\nProgrammes and qualifications with the following main content are classified here:\nAdministration\nEducational management\nEmployment management\nEntrepreneurship\nHealth administration\nLogistic management\nManagement science\nOffice management\nOrganizational theory and behaviour\nPersonnel administration\nPersonnel management\n''Start your own business'' courses\nSupply change management\nTraining management\n\n=== Inclusions:\nStudy of leadership in the context of management is included here.\n\n=== Exclusions:\nTraining in leadership in the context of personal development is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0031 ''Personal skills''.\nStudy of administration in the meaning of office work is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0415 ''Secretarial and office work''.", "uuidhistory": "9aaa99f4-d19b-4042-a645-f375a7c49506\na0c8360b-e40e-4383-92cb-6c0ce4fb9e8d", "preferredlabel": "management and administration"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15654", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "drone pilot", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "3153.4", "type": "occupation", "label": "drone pilot", "altlabels": "unmanned aircraft pilot\nremote piloted aircraft (RPA) pilot\ndrone operator\nunmanned aircraft systems operator\nunmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs) pilot\ncivil drone operator\ndrone pilot", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/27a88c48-1d09-4a8c-a82a-a61ea16476d9", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Drone pilots remotely operate unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs). They navigate the drone as well as activate other equipment as cameras, sensors as LIDARS to calculate distances, or any other instrumentation.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "6d347e21-40fc-424a-897d-03772c98b6b5\n04197517-7bb3-4864-9b77-2eccf25a1803", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "drone pilot", "occupationgroupcode": "3153", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_969", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "providing psychological and occupational therapies", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "S3.2.4", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "providing psychological and occupational therapies", "altlabels": "providing psychological and occupational therapies", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/4bbdc5eb-b710-4b76-816d-04926f7ac4a1", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- apply psychoanalysis\n- use psychotherapeutic interventions\n- remediate healthcare user''s occupational performance\n- apply music therapy treatment methods", "description": "Treating human health conditions through provision psychological and occupational, music or related therapies.", "uuidhistory": "aa947e2f-efa9-4b41-9a31-cf8a8ccec341\n9f8467d3-706f-4bcf-88e8-2aa5e25c2458", "preferredlabel": "providing psychological and occupational therapies"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_11651", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "psychology", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "psychology", "altlabels": "psychological practice\nstudy of human behaviour and performance\npsychology", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/bfe4f330-d595-48c7-ab3c-f309471d6953", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The human behaviour and performance with individual differences in ability, personality, interests, learning, and motivation.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "6827bb24-ee1f-43a7-9c5e-3113cc6c3f30\ne2b6baab-3043-46d2-9797-5148d1e57e88", "preferredlabel": "psychology"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17521", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "clinical psychologist", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "2634.2.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "clinical psychologist", "altlabels": "practitioner of clinical psychology\nclinical psychologist\nexpert in clinical psychology\nspecialist clinical psychologist\nhospital psychologist\npsychologist in hospital\nclinical psychology practitioner\nexpert clinical psychologist\nhospital psychology practitioner", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/c3c8c56c-b3ab-4425-a38a-abcace020d22", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Clinical psychologists diagnose, rehabilitate, and support individuals affected by mental, emotional, and behavioural disorders and problems as well as mental changes and pathogenic conditions through use of cognitive tools and appropriate intervention. They use clinical psychological resources on the basis of p