ent\nescrow closer\ncloser of titles\nclosing coordinator\nreal estate closer\nescrow officer\ntitle processor\ntitle closer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/b42d8731-386b-4d34-a824-4b736feee1e5", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Title closers handle and investigate all documentation needed for a property sale including the contracts, settlement statements, mortgages, title insurance policies, etc. They ensure compliance with legal requirements and review all the fees related to the real estate sales process.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "c6056054-ff40-4a49-8a2d-d1483160c262\n7887fc75-2e56-4ea1-9050-7b8135f29307", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "title closer", "occupationgroupcode": "3334", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16905", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "real estate agent", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "3334.3", "type": "occupation", "label": "real estate agent", "altlabels": "estate agent\ncommercial building rental agents\nreal estate salesperson\nassociate real estate brokers\ncommercial real estate salespersons\nproperty rental agents\nreal estate dealer\ntitle examiners\ncommercial real estate salesperson\nreal estate dealers\nrealtor\ncommercial real estate agent\nproperty agent\nreal estate salespersons\nreal estate sales agents\nresidential real estate agents\nreal estate sales representatives\nlettings agents\napartment rental agents\nestate agents\nreal estate agent\nreal estate broker\nreal estate rental agents\nproperty agents\nassociate real estate broker\nlettings agent\napartment rental agent\nletting agents\nreal estate sales agent\nreal estate rental agent\ntitle examiner\nestate managers\nproperty rental agent\nreal estate brokers\nreal estate sales representative\nrealtors\nreal estage agent mediators\ncommercial building rental agent\nresidential real estate agent\ncommercial real estate agents\nreal estage agent mediator\nletting agent", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/8ec8df02-e9dd-43b7-b416-5846ae0414ab", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Real estate agents administer the sales or letting process of residential, commercial properties or land on behalf of their clients. They investigate the property''s condition and assess its value in order to offer the best price to their clients. They negotiate, compose a sales contract or a rental contract and liaise with third parties in order to realize the stated objectives during transactions. They undertake research to determine the legality of a property sale before it is sold and make sure the transaction is not subject to any disputes or restrictions.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "aead7085-1c5a-4092-a168-197c43dc533b\n132ae33c-a6a1-4c12-8aae-ebd4adca61b3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "real estate agent", "occupationgroupcode": "3334", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16555", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "personal trust officer", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "2412.8", "type": "occupation", "label": "personal trust officer", "altlabels": "personal trust manager\npersonal trust supervisor\ntrustee officer\npersonal trust officer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/7284ccbf-e2fd-4e2f-8bbf-bc54eab610d5", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Personal trust officers monitor and administer personal trusts. They interpret trust and testamentary documentation accordingly, interact with financial advisors to define the investment goal for the achievement of trust objectives, coordinate the purchase and sale of securities with account executives and review clients'' accounts regularly.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "12d57dfb-df92-4a06-ab68-f3fc6d0cd377\n0aa21cb8-9612-44a2-b3a8-d14c45230f39", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "personal trust officer", "occupationgroupcode": "2412", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17762", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "relationship banking manager", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "2412.4.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "relationship banking manager", "altlabels": "private banker\npersonal financial advisor\ncommercial banking relationship manager\nrelationship manager\nfinancial products relationship manager\nprivate banking relationship manager\nrelationship banking manager\nclient manager\nrelations banker\nrelationship banker", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/d96de969-d43d-4082-8559-7fc35484a217", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Relationship banking managers retain and expand existing and prospective customer relationships. They use cross-selling techniques to advise and sell various banking and financial products and services to customers. They also manage the total relationship with customers and are responsible for optimising business results and customer satisfaction.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "9f3c82a5-33c2-4f37-84ef-eec30092a5b4\n537d0bbd-a4f3-4088-9d9b-15e55a3e384e", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "relationship banking manager", "occupationgroupcode": "2412", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15582", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "financial planner", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "2412.4", "type": "occupation", "label": "financial planner", "altlabels": "wealth adviser\nfinancial planner\nfinancial adviser\npersonal banker\npersonal financial planner\nindependent financial adviser\npersonal financial adviser\nfinancial planning practitioner", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/21de0f3b-a71a-4263-a9ba-90c5f3721b4d", "scopenote": "Includes wealth advisers", "definition": "A financial planner or personal financial planner helps others with their financial issues and planning such as retirement, investments and insurance. They develop strategies according to their clients'' needs.\n\n", "description": "Financial planners assist people dealing with various personal financial issues. They are specialised in financial planning, such as retirement planning, investment planning, risk management and insurance planning, and tax planning. They advise a strategy tailored to the client''s needs. They ensure the accuracy of bank and other financial records while maintaining a customer-orientated approach and following ethical standards.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "43e0ca43-6f8a-4e0b-be20-e7aa2d07f941\n9174970e-0e76-42f9-bf01-786eefe87ada", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "financial planner", "occupationgroupcode": "2412", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16902", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "loan officer", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "3312.5", "type": "occupation", "label": "loan officer", "altlabels": "loans consultant\ncredit officer\nloans controller\nloans adviser\nloan officer\ncommercial lender\nloan processor\nloans agent", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/8e185c49-704e-49c0-8584-a7e0b618f628", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Loan officers assess and authorise the approval of loan applications for individuals and businesses. They ensure complete transactions between loan organisations, borrowers, and sellers. Loan officers are specialists in consumer, mortgage, or commercial lending.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "685fbcf9-d13d-4451-b411-9bb4e2c41c27\n79169839-65c1-4e19-8e6d-8c4506b10ec1", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "loan officer", "occupationgroupcode": "3312", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_12808", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "adopt a person-centred approach to community arts", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "adopt a person-centred approach to community arts", "altlabels": "develop a community arts programme focusing on the individual\nadopt a person-centered approach to community arts\nadopt a community arts'' person-centred approach\nadopt an approach in community arts that is centred on the person\nimplement a client-centred approach for arts discipline\nadopt a person-centred approach to community arts", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d51ba4dc-46a4-43f2-ad60-be7bbe4cc227", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Adopt working methods which aims to create an environment for dance practice that builds upon existing qualities and strengths of each individual encouraging their active exploration of the arts discipline (dance, music, theater, visual arts). Make arts accesible and understable through different pedagogic strategies to facilitate your participants to gain the body knowledge they need for the arts discipline they are doing, by developing a quality in their artistic performance. Recognise and instigate development of participants so they have a more developed range of skill in their artistic performance.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "44d4630a-2717-4dcb-88f6-6b2c6e28de5e\n486d9711-d86f-47cf-bbe6-0a8080f95722", "preferredlabel": "adopt a person-centred approach to community arts"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_5886", "type": "skill", "depth": 2, "label": "direct community arts activities", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "direct community arts activities", "altlabels": "manage community arts activities\ndirect community arts activity\ndirecting community arts activities\ndirect community arts activities\ndirect community art activities\nhead community arts activities\nsupervise community arts activities\nlead community arts activities", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/545f6585-58bc-4ca7-b1b4-1d33fb3664db", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Devise and deliver participatory community arts activities that protect the health and safety of yourself and participants to be able to draw out the most effective learning. Take into account the whole experience of the art session.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "65bf5d56-7bd1-4eef-be6f-9c17c5eb