 procedures. It includes the study of the workings and current trends of the wholesale and retail industries. Selling of buildings and properties is also included.\nProgrammes and qualifications with the following main content are classified here:\nAuctioneering\nConsumer services\nDemonstration techniques\nPurchasing\nReal-estate business\nRetailing\nStock-keeping\nWare-housing\nWholesaling\n\n=== Inclusions\nStudy of buying and selling buildings and properties is included here.", "uuidhistory": "895dfab6-8bc0-4d15-8bc2-33da5db7616c\ndc2180e7-ae93-49ae-96c7-b3e21a180c78", "preferredlabel": "wholesale and retail sales"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_691", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "business and administration not further defined", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "business and administration not further defined", "altlabels": "business and administration not further defined", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/isced-f/0410", "scopenote": "", "description": "", "uuidhistory": "a3c4ee32-16e4-43a4-bdb9-861d56a9b562\n4217456c-be3a-4a1c-b6e1-7c1d364bf4e7", "preferredlabel": "business and administration not further defined"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_699", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "business and administration not elsewhere classified", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "business and administration not elsewhere classified", "altlabels": "business and administration not elsewhere classified", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/isced-f/0419", "scopenote": "", "description": "", "uuidhistory": "91eec490-a7d8-4b66-b1da-1f5497bd368b\nc592b90e-d788-4224-860f-bb781d5fe94a", "preferredlabel": "business and administration not elsewhere classified"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16106", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "beauty vocational teacher", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "2320.1.5", "type": "occupation", "label": "beauty vocational teacher", "altlabels": "cosmetology vocational teacher\nhair and beauty educator\nbeauty vocational teacher\neducator in beauty\nhair and beauty teacher\ncosmetology teacher\nvocational hair and beauty teacher\neducator in hair and beauty\nvocational cosmetology teacher\nvocational beauty teacher\nbeauty teacher\nbeauty educator\nbeauty instructor\nhair and beauty instructor", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/4d6d9057-5167-4158-8bc1-cc2f89d73fd7", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Beauty vocational teachers instruct students in their specialised field of study, beauty, which is predominantly practical in nature. They provide theoretical instruction in service of the practical skills and techniques the students must subsequently master for a cosmetology-related profession, such as manicurist and make-up and hair designer. Beauty vocational teachers monitor the students'' progress, assist individually when necessary, and evaluate their knowledge and performance on the subject of cosmetology through assignments, tests and examinations.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "0b3a501b-35d1-4ec2-9666-f38de6742467\n02607c06-e1dc-4dbb-8b7f-e9c4ba2908ee", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "beauty vocational teacher", "occupationgroupcode": "2320", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15796", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "beauty salon manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "1431.2.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "beauty salon manager", "altlabels": "beauty salon director\nbeauty parlor director\nsalon manager\nbeauty salon manager\nbeauty centre manager\nbeauty spa manager\nbeauty parlour director\nbeauty spa director\nhair salon manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/33e3a746-f209-4a1a-96df-301505531cb2", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Beauty salon managers oversee the daily operations and staff management in a beauty salon. They ensure customer satisfaction, budget control and inventory management. Beauty salon managers set up and enforce salon rules and cleanliness guidelines. They are also in charge of promoting the salon to attract new clients.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b057c7f3-75f8-4917-a52e-1d7809d705ab\n25e63fe0-f2bc-4d91-a21f-c99045ce6f9e", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "beauty salon manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1431", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17434", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "service manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "1349.21", "type": "occupation", "label": "service manager", "altlabels": "service coordinator\nfield service manager\nsupport services manager\nregional service manager\nservice operations manager\ncorporate service coordinator\nservice director\nclient services coordinator\nclient services representative\nclient services manager\nservice manager\ncustomer service manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/bcc2c1db-f969-4355-bebf-4878ff6c2a94", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Service managers are responsible for the supervision and coordination of the provision of different professional and technical services to customers. They ensure a smooth interaction with clients and high levels of satisfaction post-service. This occupation includes the provision of policing, correctional, library, legal and fire services.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "ca780403-9e4f-4c52-9e32-5bf083df821a\ncf14e19f-e9d1-462e-9dca-d74f27c053b3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "service manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1349", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_7750", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "manage educational institution''s administration", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "manage educational institution''s administration", "altlabels": "manage educational institution''s administration\nmanaging educational institution''s administration\noversee educational institution''s administration\nmanages educational institution''s administration\ncoordinate educational institution''s administration\nsupervise educational institution''s administration", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/76161ecd-084a-4caa-9116-3ee05658d8a8", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Administer multiple activities of a school, university or other educational institution such as daily administrative operations.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "49c0ccfe-55f0-405e-91d0-c89e63aa562d\n1f893ffb-6b3b-4f02-93cf-628b1daf7635", "preferredlabel": "manage educational institution''s administration"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16992", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "language school teacher", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "2353.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "language school teacher", "altlabels": "language school educator\nTESOL teacher\ninstructor in language school\nteacher in a language school\nESOL teacher\nEnglish for speakers of other languages teacher\nlanguage school lecturer\nteacher of english to speakers of other languages\nlanguage school instructor\nTESOL practitioner\nlanguage school teacher", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/9711dcfc-d9a8-4fba-9c5e-8428d8bcb53e", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Language school teachers educate non-age-specific students in a language that is not their native language at a specialised school, not bound by a level of education. They focus less on the academic aspect of language teaching, as opposed to language teachers in secondary or higher education, but instead on the theory and practice that will be most helpful to their students in real-life situations since most choose instruction for either business, immigration or leisure reasons. They organise their classes using a variety of lesson materials, work interactively with the group, and assess and evaluate their individual progress through assignments and examinations, putting emphasis on active language skills such as writing and speaking.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "3166f44f-9060-4098-9bd9-746f3ab88b96\n0affee02-95ad-4aa8-a966-2c2fe531737d", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "language school teacher", "occupationgroupcode": "2353", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_18067", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "education policy officer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "2422.12.4", "type": "occupation", "label": "education policy officer", "altlabels": "education policy development officer\neducation policy researcher\neducation policy specialist\neducation policy analyst\npolicy officer, education\npolicy officer\neducation policy officer\npolicy officer for education\neducation policy advisor", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/f817aab2-ec8a-45ec-88ef-c11e0f19fd85", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Education policy officers research, analyse and develop education policies, and implement these policies to improve the existing education system. They try to improve all aspects of education which will impact institutions such as schools, universities and vocational schools. They work closely with partners, external organisations or other stakeholders and provide them with regular updates.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "77834465-2c79-45a6-848f-7b9e5aadb3a6\n6d6cff05-1fab-475d-8275-1f320e094e1f", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "education policy officer", "occupationgroupcode": "2422", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_764", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "building and civil engineering", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "building and civil engineering", "altlabels": "building and civil engineering", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/isced-f/0732", "scopenote": "", "description": "Building is the study of the science, technology and techniques of assembling, erecting and maintaining public, commercial, industrial and residential structures and their fittings. Civil engineering is the study of planning, designing, testing and directing the construction of large scale buildings and structures, including systems for transport, water supply, sewage etc.\nProgrammes and qualifications with the following main content are classified here:\nBricklaying\nBridge construction\nBuilding construction\nBuilding engineering\nBuilding technology\nCarpentry and joinery (building)\nCivil engineering\nConstruction equipment\nConstructional metalwork (building)\nDock and harbour engineering\nFloor and wall tiling\nFloor covering\nHouse building\nIndustrial abseiling (commercial)\nMasonry and tile setting\nPainting and wall covering\nPlastering\nPlumbing and pipefitting\nRoad building\nWater engineering and technology\nWater supply and sewerage engineering\nVentilation\n\n=== Exclusions\nInstallation of electricity is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0713 ''Electricity and energy''. Similarly, installing and repairing of heating, air-conditioning and refrigeration equipment is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0713 ''Electricity and energy''.", "uuidhistory": "afa3d1b6-e20d-4cfa-8a66-bffc187787f5\n8b322893-e381-4d0a-a9ee-d7547b22e9df", "preferredlabel": "building and civil engineering"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17337", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "roofer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "7121.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "roofer", "altlabels": "tinsmith\nhouse roofer\nroof slater\nroofer\nroofing carpenter\ncladding installer\nroof tiler\nasphalt roofer\nfelt roofer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/b4c6d1b0-929e-48be-9f67-47bd8c30658b", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Roofers cover structures with roofs. They install the weight-bearing elements of a roof, either flat or pitched, then cover it with a weatherproof layer.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "7269b208-b6bc-4bd0-87b3-008a84fc8850\n2db2ef2d-1b5e-408a-8848-a9f75852bf5f", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "roofer", "occupationgroupcode": "7121", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17174", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "hop farmer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "6112.3", "type": "occupation", "label": "hop farmer", "altlabels": "organic hop farmer\nhops grower\nhops producer\nhops cultivator\nhops tender\nhop grower\nhop producer\nhops farmer\nhop cultivator\nhop farmer\nhop tender\norganic hops cultivator\norganic hops grower", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/a6af318e-8a3a-4266-a1ef-cf7afe588201", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Hop farmers plant, cultivate and harvest hops for the production of commodities such as beer.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "6fb35d93-d293-4c14-8dd9-d1dce4eea556\n90d0126f-a25e-4543-ba16-75553fae8551", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "hop farmer", "occupationgroupcode": "6112", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17903", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "landscape gardener", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "6113.5", "type": "occupation", "label": "landscape gardener", "altlabels": "landscaper\nlandscaping gardener\nlandscape gardener\nlandscape gardeners", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/e7970c7a-7769-4002-87d3-0a8ea94fdd6f", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Landscape gardeners plan, construct, renovate and maintain parks, gardens and public green spaces.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "0012e641-2d39-4359-8326-fb03d39fd3d5\n9c981ed5-d99b-4667-b49a-69975ffe8e15", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "landscape gardener", "occupationgroupcode": "6113", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15501", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "land-based machinery operator", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "8341.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "land-based machinery operator", "altlabels": "agricultural machinery operator\nland-based machinery operator\nfarm equipment operator\nforest tractor driver\nforestry tractor driver\ncombined driver\nagricultural equipment operator\nlandbased machinery operator\ntractor driver\nland-based machinery operators", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/1b8c75a9-407b-4554-a7d6-df391672c6b1", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Land-based machinery operators operate specialised equipment and machinery for agricultural production and maintenance of landscape.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "7197879d-f150-4ca4-8b4e-91668ce4b6af\n48edd0ff-c2a5-4b1d-b99e-81a6c70de59c", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "land-based machinery operator", "occupationgroupcode": "8341", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17533", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "offshore renewable energy engineer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "2149.9.5", "type": "occupation", "label": "offshore renewable energy engineer", "altlabels": "marine renewable energy engineer\nocean renewable energy engineer\nhydrodynamics engineer\nORE engineer\noffshore renewable energy engineer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/c44c37a2-88c3-4ac2-9cf9-959f42deb02b", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Offshore renewable energy engineers design and supervise the installation of offshore energy farms and equipment. They research and test locations to find the most productive location, ensure the successful execution of the design plan and make any necessary modifications or provide targeted advice. Offshore renewable energy engineers test equipment such as wind-turbine blades, tidal stream and wave generators. They develop strategies for more efficient energy production, and environmental sustainability.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b933c2d5-37aa-4bf2-b21e-21e936a5de5e\n8c73220b-315c-4908-8774-62cce6df5053", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "offshore renewable energy engineer", "occupationgroupcode": "2149", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16025", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "offshore renewable energy plant operator", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "3131.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "offshore renewable energy plant operator", "altlabels": "wave energy plant operator\nmarine wave energy operator\nmarine renewable energy plant operator\nwave farm operator\nocean energy plat operator\nORE plant operator\nmarine wind energy technician\nwave energy operator\nmarine wind energy operator\nmarine tidal stream operator\noffshore wind energy operator\ntidal farm operator\noffshore renewable energy plant operator", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/47af27c4-5b45-4cce-ba01-4e96f8cf97b9", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Offshore renewable energy plant operators operate and maintain equipment which produce electrical energy from marine renewable sources such as offshore wind power, wave power, or tidal currents. They monitor measuring equipment to ensure the safety of operations, and that the production needs are met. They also react to system problems, and repair faults.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "708d9b5a-0c0d-48b6-8621-1242c62e1e1c\n6feb9cb2-f1db-426d-add0-c25db99aa8c7", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "offshore renewable energy plant operator", "occupationgroupcode": "3131", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17180", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "alternative fuels engineer", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "2149.9.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "alternative fuels engineer", "altlabels": "hydrogen engineer\nfuel cell engineer\nalternative fuels engineer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/a75c740c-d8d9-41a7-ab1a-e69a6eb6eac1", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Alternative fuels engineers design and develop systems, components, motors, and equipment which replace the use of conventional fossil fuels as main power source for propulsion and power generation with the feature of using renewable energies and non-fossil fuels. They strive to optimise energy production from renewable sources and reduce production expenses and environmental strain. The alternative fuels employed mainly include Liquefied Natural Gas (LNG), Liquefied Petroleum Gas (LPG), biodiesel, bio-alcohol as well as electricity (i.e., batteries and fuel cells), hydrogen and fuels produced from biomass.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "3c2efd43-c0cd-484c-b2d8-b5a95227e1ab\nacdbb3eb-8eaf-4d1b-b6db-cdf926d7085c", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "alternative fuels engineer", "occupationgroupcode": "2149", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_858", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "providing health care or medical treatments", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "S3.2.0", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "providing health care or medical treatments", "altlabels": "healthcare\nproviding health care or medical treatments", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/0a400212-8693-4b1f-b0ca-d1f82c321916", "scopenote": "Excludes:\n- Veterinary care\n- Diagnosing health conditions", "description": "Treating injuries and health conditions through the provision of health care and medical treatments to people.", "uuidhistory": "79228cc1-3130-43f7-a1a5-4745c0b2a7be\n52a98e03-423f-4d43-b86f-b5319bf644f4", "preferredlabel": "providing health care or medical treatments"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_940", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "providing physical therapies", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "S3.2.3", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "providing physical therapies", "altlabels": "providing physical therapies", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/3926ec7d-64cd-4410-8283-493a1afdd57b", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- apply clinical physiotherapy skills\n- administer hydrotherapy\n- give shiatsu massages\n\nExcludes:\n- veterinary care\n- non-therapeutic massage", "description": "Treating injuries and health conditions through physiotherapy, massage, chiropractic and other physical therapies.", "uuidhistory": "27c46564-3378-4f2c-8da9-33492381a545\n7fef85ce-62cc-4b38-877c-d110a0f8b337", "preferredlabel": "providing physical therapies"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1025", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "providing medical, dental and nursing care", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "16b67717-a56b-48e2-ba7e-a855dee748d0", "metadata": {"code": "S3.2.1", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "providing medical, dental and nursing care", "altlabels": "providing medical, dental and nursing care", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/73e602a0-f80f-4f56-8e21-3db4fd08709d", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- provide professional care in nursing\n- administer prescribed medication\n- carry out wound care\n- manage acute pain\n- rehabilitate worn dentition\n\nExcludes:\n- veterinary care\n- performing surgery\n- physiotherapy\n- occupational therapy\n- psychotherapy\n", "description": "Treating injuries and health conditions among humans, through administering medication and providing other medical treatments and nursing care.", "uuidhistory": "efbb4553-e4c0-4d43-be82-1e26e1c222ed\n8fd28dd8-bd89-465b-b478-8a5a7cea8365", "preferredlabel": "providing medical, dental and nursing care"}, "revealed": false,