hinking\napply techniques for strategic thinking\nmove strategically\nthink strategically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6c870993-9341-438b-91c0-c7fe4f96d8f5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Apply generation and effective application of business insights and possible opportunities, in order to achieve competitive business advantage on a long-term basis.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a71b991a-32ab-4549-be36-4e1937acc883\n964c1d63-681d-4f91-9a0a-0ab87a57fcd8", "preferredlabel": "apply strategic thinking"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "The challenge is to analyze a real-life case study of a company facing a strategic decision, develop a strategic plan of action, and present it in a structured format. The case study will be provided, and the participant will have to apply strategic thinking to identify the key issues, analyze the options, and propose a well-reasoned strategic plan.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 48, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Strategic Thinking", "applications": ["Developing business strategies to gain competitive advantage", "Identifying opportunities for organizational growth and expansion", "Anticipating market trends and adapting business models accordingly"], "justification": "Given the user''s interest in philosophy and complex environments, strategic thinking aligns with their desire to work in complex environments and their strength in critical thinking. This skill will help them analyze situations and make decisions effectively.", "esco_description": "Strategic Thinking involves the ability to analyze complex situations, anticipate future trends, and develop long-term plans to achieve organizational goals. It requires evaluating multiple options and making decisions that align with the organization''s vision and mission.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_12039", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "promote communication between parties", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "interpersonal", "graph_id": "423de973-5e42-42e1-a7fd-bd0f1035f429", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "promote communication between parties", "altlabels": "encourage communication between parties\npromoting communication between parties\nadvocate communication between parties\npromote communication between parties\npromote intra-party communication", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c68af615-b24c-4719-a199-c4141e08f2bd", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "occupation-specific", "description": "Encourage parties to communicate among them and share their views on events and happenings in order to find cooperation paths.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a7598cf6-f21e-41a5-91e1-37d81bef66e9\nf53fab7a-b3d8-40a5-97f0-b0e4585f65f4", "preferredlabel": "promote communication between parties"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Engage in a 30-minute conversation with someone holding differing opinions on a chosen topic. Practice active listening, ask open-ended questions, and express your own viewpoints respectfully.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 40, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Effective Communication", "applications": ["Conducting effective meetings and negotiations", "Building rapport with clients and colleagues", "Resolving conflicts and addressing concerns professionally"], "justification": "The user''s ability to attract attention, make connections, and understand others'' motives indicates a strong foundation in interpersonal skills. Developing this skill further will enhance their ability to create relations between people and companies, aligning with their career goals.", "esco_description": "The ability to convey information clearly and effectively, listen actively, and engage in constructive dialogue to achieve mutual understanding and positive outcomes.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_9448", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "implement strategic management", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "leadership", "graph_id": "423de973-5e42-42e1-a7fd-bd0f1035f429", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "implement strategic management", "altlabels": "implement strategic management plan\ndeliver strategic management plan\ndevelop and implement strategic management plan\ndevise company development strategy\ndevise strategy for company development\ndevelop strategy for company development\nformulate and implement company development strategy\nimplement management strategy\nimplement strategic management principles\nformulate strategy for company development\nimplement strategic management", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/953445c0-4770-4be0-91cf-270a64c0e297", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Implement a strategy for the development and transformation of the company. Strategic management involves the formulation and implementation of the major objectives and initiatives of a company by senior management on behalf of the owners, based on consideration of available resources and an assessment of the internal and external environments in which the organisation operates.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5ec05073-a8df-4a0e-9ab2-7721591dd3b6\nb0011391-93ed-4047-b65d-f977fabbe608", "preferredlabel": "implement strategic management"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "The challenge is to analyze a case study of a company facing strategic decisions, and to propose a detailed plan of action with justifications. The case study will be provided, and the participant will have to present a strategic plan outlining the objectives, actions, and expected outcomes.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 36, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Strategic Leadership", "applications": ["Developing business strategies to enter new markets", "Leading cross-functional teams to drive organizational change", "Aligning organizational resources with strategic objectives"], "justification": "With a strong interest in business and leadership, the user can benefit from developing entrepreneurial leadership skills. This will support their goal of creating companies and relationships between things and help them inspire others in a business context.", "esco_description": "Strategic leadership involves the ability to set a vision, develop strategies, and guide a team towards achieving long-term organizational goals. It requires making critical decisions, fostering innovation, and adapting to dynamic market conditions.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14407", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "forecast economic trends", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "technical", "graph_id": "423de973-5e42-42e1-a7fd-bd0f1035f429", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "forecast economic trends", "altlabels": "project economic trends\neconomic trend forecasting\nforecast economic trends\nanalyse economic trends\npredict economic trends\nforecasting of economic trends\neconomic trend forecasts", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f2a34d6b-131a-4b8f-a110-898b9c91d18f", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Gather and analyse economic data in order to predict economic trends and events.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5e187514-cb05-4521-94d0-8f854d9e197b\nbb6b2ce8-10c6-4707-b1b4-1bfb511fffd4", "preferredlabel": "forecast economic trends"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Sélectionnez 5 indicateurs économiques locaux pertinents (chômage, croissance du PIB, inflation, etc.) et analysez leur évolution sur les 6 derniers mois. Identifiez les tendances et préparez un rapport sur l''impact potentiel de ces tendances sur l''économie locale.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 20, "confidence": 0.7, "esco_label": "Data Analysis", "applications": ["Identifying trends and patterns in economic data", "Developing forecasting models for economic indicators", "Evaluating the impact of policy changes on economic outcomes"], "justification": "The user''s interest in economics and their strength in critical thinking align well with the analytical and investigative aspects of data analysis. Developing this skill will provide them with a solid foundation in understanding and interpreting data, which is valuable in complex environments.", "esco_description": "Utilizing statistical methods and software to interpret and draw conclusions from datasets, enabling evidence-based decision-making and strategic planning.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_7935", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "optimise production", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "creative", "graph_id": "423de973-5e42-42e1-a7fd-bd0f1035f429", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "optimise production", "altlabels": "maximise production efficiency\noptimising production\noptimising production efficiency\nproduction efficiency optimising\nproduction optimising\noptimize  production\noptimise production", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/798d427e-51b3-4cd4-8b24-1357015e9ae7", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "sector-specific", "description": "Analyse and identify the strengths and weaknesses of solutions, conclusions or approaches to problems; formulate and plan alternatives.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "1acb1829-f5e6-4e17-b334-aee681737e22\n08fa422b-1a94-4df5-90ef-facbbaa08827", "preferredlabel": "optimise production"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Pendant une semaine, identifiez une tâche récurrente dans votre environnement de travail ou d''étude et développez un plan pour l''optimiser. Mettez en œuvre ce plan et suivez ses résultats.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 38, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Problem Solving", "applications": ["Developing new strategies to address economic challenges", "Designing innovative approaches to optimize resource allocation", "Creating unique solutions to improve economic processes"], "justification": "Given the user''s high rating in creativity and their interest in finding meaningful and impactful work, developing creative problem-solving skills will allow them to approach complex situations with innovative and meaningful solutions.", "esco_description": "The ability to creatively identify and implement effective solutions to complex issues, using innovative and analytical approaches.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1018", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "developing objectives and strategies", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "423de973-5e42-42e1-a7fd-bd0f1035f429", "metadata": {"code": "S4.1.0", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "developing objectives and strategies", "altlabels": "strategic planning\ndeveloping objectives and strategies", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6ee936b0-4e0c-4e04-97c7-1f4ee9230d67", "scopenote": "", "description": "Envisioning a future state and developing strategies, goals, objectives and action plans to achieve it.", "uuidhistory": "3a012fff-b177-4cf7-950f-8ebb35fe3510\nf020253a-e05c-4447-82bd-777648b45045", "preferredlabel": "developing objectives and strategies"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14598", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "make strategic business decisions", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "423de973-5e42-42e1-a7fd-bd0f1035f429", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "make strategic business decisions", "altlabels": "make tactical business decisions\npay per click\nmake strategic business decisions\nmake strategic business choices\nPPC", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f60c9e52-95fc-4ca1-a73c-18a491153b63", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Analyse business information and consult directors for decision making purposes in a varied array of aspects affecting the prospect, productivity and sustainable operation of a company. Consider the options and alternatives to a challenge and make sound rational decisions based on analysis and experience.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "71709697-2eda-4fe4-9160-e6a258ea6b0a\n0441380e-ef76-4ac6-b610-8c854edf11df", "preferredlabel": "make strategic business decisions"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_17383", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "import export manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "423de973-5e42-42e1-a7fd-bd0f1035f429", "metadata": {"code": "1324.3.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "import export manager", "altlabels": "senior export manager\ngraduate international trade compliance manager\nassistant international trade compliance manager\nsenior international trade manager\ntrainee import export manager\nsenior import manager\nimport export manager\ngraduate customs compliance manager\ngraduate import export manager\nsenior customs compliance manager\ntrainee international trade manager\nassistant import manager\nassistant export manager\ngraduate import manager\nassistant customs compliance manager\ntrainee international trade compliance manager\ntrainee import manager\nassistant international trade manager\ngraduate export manager\ntrainee customs compliance manager\ntrainee export manager\nsenior international trade compliance manager\ngraduate international trade manager\nassistant import export manager\nsenior import export manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/b87a7a27-ee74-4e5e-b274-84a3cab27bf4", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Import export managers install and maintain procedures for cross-border business, coordinating internal and external parties.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "fb808c05-845b-43da-9947-ae278a842ae8\nee219eb2-8c98-4302-91b0-89b5703904e1", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "import export manager", "occupationgroupcode": "1324", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1119", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "collaborating and liaising", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "423de973-5e42-42e1-a7fd-bd0f1035f429", "metadata": {"code": "S1.2.5", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "collaborating and liaising", "altlabels": "collaborating and liaising", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/af84405b-896d-4ed3-9462-077ea9a2a188", "scopenote": "Examples: \n- contact event speakers\n- liaise with auditors", "description": "Reaching out to outside agencies, clients and other organisational units to facilitate exchange of information. Collaborating and engaging with external and internal agencies and departments to adapt the timing and nature of the activities.", "uuidhistory": "ed2a8e7c-a98d-4885-8c03-a594784da771\na8fc43d3-0ef2-47af-8f36-43ec997ed7b1", "preferredlabel": "collaborating and liaising"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15952", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "mediator", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "423de973-5e42-42e1-a7fd-bd0f1035f429", "metadata": {"code": "2619.9", "type": "occupation", "label": "mediator", "altlabels": "alternative dispute resolution coordinator\nmediator\nadvice worker\nlabour mediator\nfamily mediator\nlegal intermediary\nconciliator\nmediation commissioner\nlabor mediator\narbitrator\nconflict mediator", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/403be630-8d1e-43b7-9f07-098aca5bb689", "scopenote": "Excludes people performing resolution of legal process by making the final decision. \n Excludes <a resource=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/666846b2-01ce-43f6-8cb7-f3be09fac4a2\" typeOf=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/model#Occupation\" href=\"http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/666846b2-01ce-43f6-8cb7-f3be09fac4a2\"><span property=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label\" xml:lang=\"en\">ombudsman</span></a>.", "definition": "", "description": "\nMediators resolve disputes between two parties by examining the case, interviewing both parties, and advising on a solution which would be the most beneficial for them. They listen to both parties in order to facilitate communication and find a fair agreement and organise meetings. They aim at resolving disputes through dialogue and alternative solution without having to take the case to litigation and courts. Mediators ensure that the resolution is compliant with legal regulations and is also enforced.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "3de2e976-d6a3-4811-8e95-49798a4d1f26\nf804c80a-dc7a-467e-8852-83a108b1b3e3", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "mediator", "occupationgroupcode": "2619", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1107", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "implementing new procedures or processes", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "423de973-5e42-42e1-a7fd-bd0f1035f429", "metadata": {"code": "S1.9.2", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "implementing new procedures or processes", "altlabels": "implementing new procedures or processes", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/a6c3bda0-