implementing strategic planning\nadminister strategic planning\nintroduce strategic planning\nimplement strategic planning", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f7b5d916-52f0-4865-b6a6-e1a3b711cb5e", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Take action on the goals and procedures defined at a strategic level in order to mobilise resources and pursue the established strategies.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "b35fdeee-2cc6-4078-a446-18208811360a\n107b354a-daa2-4030-bd4d-fc86b5cde23b", "preferredlabel": "implement strategic planning"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15863", "type": "occupation", "depth": 1, "label": "economic policy officer", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "423de973-5e42-42e1-a7fd-bd0f1035f429", "metadata": {"code": "2631.1", "type": "occupation", "label": "economic policy officer", "altlabels": "economic policy analyst\neconomic policy specialist\neconomic policy officer\nfinance policy officer\neconomic policy advisor\npolicy officer economics\npolicy officer for economy\neconomical policy officer\neconomic policy researcher", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/394a4bdd-7032-4d87-89a2-9d937cebdd09", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Economic policy officers develop economic strategies. They monitor aspects of economics such as competitiveness, innovation and trade. Economic policy officers contribute to the development of economic policies, projects and programs. They research, analyse and assess public policy problems and recommend appropriate actions.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a1cb6d98-7916-45a7-a744-bdf3a8066178\n678d9535-e52c-4e6d-9cc6-3a3b0fac1ae4", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "economic policy officer", "occupationgroupcode": "2631", "regulatedprofessionno