 new business opportunities\nidentifying a new business opportunity\ndetermine new business opportunities\nidentify new business opportunities\nanalyse new business opportunities", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d207a30b-2f80-4138-9b77-f88d549b8768", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Pursue potential customers or products in order to generate additional sales and ensure growth.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "abdb4e2f-3780-4e3c-bd6d-1282f9d4b531\n184d0ed3-30ec-4414-aa4e-025fc90ecf7c", "preferredlabel": "identify new business opportunities"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Conduct a market research to identify potential business opportunities in a specific industry or niche. Analyze competitors, target audience, and market trends to pinpoint new areas for business growth.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 32, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Business Development", "applications": ["Developing new markets and customer segments", "Creating business plans and strategies", "Negotiating partnerships and collaborations"], "justification": "Considering the user''s goal of creating companies and their interest in business and economics, entrepreneurship is a key anchor skill. It aligns with their leadership qualities and desire to work in complex environments, and supports their career trajectory in business and leadership roles.", "esco_description": "Identifying new business opportunities, creating strategies for growth, and taking calculated risks to achieve business success.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_5147", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "communicate with stakeholders", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "interpersonal", "graph_id": "51f9ef1f-eaa2-4ef2-badb-bc3236c86b8e", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "communicate with stakeholders", "altlabels": "communicate with stakeholders\ninform stakeholders of