urship", "esco_description": "Identifying new business opportunities, creating strategies for growth, and taking calculated risks to achieve business success."}, {"id": "skill::key_5147", "score": 0.398932815, "category": "interpersonal", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "communicate with stakeholders", "node_id": "skill::key_5147", "altlabels": "communicate with stakeholders\ninform stakeholders of ideas and objectives\ncommunicate to stakeholders\ncommunicating with stakeholders\ncommunicate with providers of business support services", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/477173ca-5fc2-406b-9122-95d92811f284", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Facilitate communication between organisations and interested third parties such as suppliers, distributors, shareholders and other stakeholders in order to inform them of the organisation and its objectives.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "f67a321a-98be-45ca-bde1-9a97061b49da\n0e9b4d9d-327e-4211-a6f2-80b0d944c386", "preferredlabel": "communicate with stakeholders"}, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Effective Communication", "applications": ["Conducting negotiations with clients and stakeholders", "Collaborating with team members to achieve project goals", "Presenting complex economic concepts in a clear and accessible manner"], "justification": "The user''s ability to attract the attention of people and make connections aligns with the anchor skill of interpersonal communication. This skill supports their interest in creating relations between things, and their confidence in inspiring and understanding others.", "original_label": "Interpersonal Communication", "esco_description": "The ability to convey information clearly and effectively, listen actively, and engage in constructive dialogue to achieve mutual understanding and positive outcomes."}, {"id": "skill::key_1648", "score": 0.385693312, "category": "creative"