b3abe2097", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- implement transport strategy\n- apply crisis intervention\n\nExcludes:\n- repair and resolve technical problems with machinery and equipment\n- use ICT tools for problem solving\n", "description": "Implementing new business procedures or processes to resolve practical, operational or conceptual problems which arise in the execution of work in a wide range of contexts.", "uuidhistory": "6b6535ca-d2e6-4b58-9c8f-f68e232f1278\nc23c9fcb-39fb-482e-86ff-fdb95f7eea0a", "preferredlabel": "implementing new procedures or processes"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16370", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "food production planner", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "8143df11-a044-474d-8305-883999879f3c", "metadata": {"code": "3122.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "food production planner", "altlabels": "food production planning expert\nfood production planner\nfood production planning specialist\nfood manufacturing planner", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/623958d6-775c-4586-b928-86582d9d1b69", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Food production planners prepare production plans, evaluate all the variables in the process and strive to ensure that production objectives be achieved.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "3f56a817-098f-4032-9695-0c29d1d23ea3\n0691ba1e-c0c3-459d-a75f-c7c40d443c62", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "food production planner", "occupationgroupcode": "3122", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15865", "type": "occupation", "depth": 2, "label": "forwarding manager", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "8143df11-a044-474d-8305-883999879f3c", "metadata": {"code": "3331.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "forwarding manager", "altlabels": "freight forwarding agent\nforwarding manager\nexport manager\nfreight forwarding, head\nhead of freight forwarding\nfreight forwarding manager\nforwarding supervisor\nlogistics line manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/39803100-c338-4f01-ad2c-085d488920ca", "scopenote": "Includes freight forwarding agents.", "definition": "", "description": "Forwarding managers plan and organise cargo shipments within national and international areas. They communicate with carriers and negotiate the best way to send the cargo to its destination which can be a single customer or a point of distribution. Forwarding managers act as experts in supply chain management. They know and apply the rules and regulations for each specific type of cargo and communicate the conditions and costs to the clients.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "40820e19-c0e7-4601-88b9-6e71ff34edea\n99390e34-48bf-4a7e-a62d-ef6a79952f1d", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "forwarding manager", "occupationgroupcode": "3331", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_6716", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "business analysis", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "8143df11-a044-474d-8305-883999879f3c", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "business analysis", "altlabels": "analysis of businesses\nbusiness analyses\nbusiness analysis\ncompany analysis\nenterprise analysis", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/633a3637-2c6b-40ae-ac38-289eb2a62aa6", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The research field which addresses the identification of business needs and problems and the determination of the solutions that would mitigate or prevent the smooth functioning of a business. Business analysis comprises IT solutions, market challenges, policy development and strategic matters.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "ecfd6d9c-df15-4c00-b9b1-41c15fd6cd3b\n8c4ffa03-f864-46eb-994e-b32909e38c4a", "preferredlabel": "business analysis"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_3440", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "perform business analysis", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "8143df11-a044-474d-8305-883999879f3c", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "perform business analysis", "altlabels": "perform analysis of a business\nundertake business analysis\nperform business analysis\ncomplete business analysis\nperforming business analysis\nperform a business analysis\nimplement business analysis", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/27ed854c-15b8-4ba2-90e9-ae888a219703", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Evaluate the condition of a business on its own and in relation to the competitive business domain, performing research, placing data in context of the business'' needs and determining areas of opportunity.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "34b91e91-0989-4e50-a175-f43ef8233f84\ncd263082-8147-4829-9fd5-b85cd678499a", "preferredlabel": "perform business analysis"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_6398", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "analyse business plans", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "8143df11-a044-474d-8305-883999879f3c", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "analyse business plans", "altlabels": "analyse business plan\nanalyse business plan feasibility\ngauge business plans\nanalyse business formal statements\nevaluate business plans\nanalyze  business plans\nanalyse business plans", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/5da3c765-10a3-49eb-934c-ec401ceb1a34", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Analyse the formal statements from businesses which outline their business goals and the strategies they set in place to meet them, in order to assess the feasibility of the plan and verify the business'' ability to meet external requirements such as the repayment of a loan or return of investments.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "0d5735af-55e5-48ef-836d-52dfeda7253a\nae3f6516-8518-4fe7-a569-9a2e1801ad44", "preferredlabel": "analyse business plans"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_4791", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "analyse business objectives", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "8143df11-a044-474d-8305-883999879f3c", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "analyse business objectives", "altlabels": "examine project objectives, output and activities\ndefine and validate business needs and goals\nanalyze  business objectives\nanalyse a business objective\nanalyse objectives of business\nanalyse business objectives", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/408fcc8e-d4e6-43e7-ab27-b617a1dced98", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Study data according to business strategies and objectives and make both short-term and long-term strategic plans.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "52d04b3f-a606-4b12-b574-8759dc9f16f9\n8258e386-da7c-4b3d-b82f-21dd5130c115", "preferredlabel": "analyse business objectives"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_9930", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "business processes", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "8143df11-a044-474d-8305-883999879f3c", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "business processes", "altlabels": "business process\nrefinement a business\nbusiness analysis\na business process\nbusiness measures\nbusiness handling\nbusiness processes", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/9e84a506-df06-4be3-874a-fa01293e3dd5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Processes which an organisation applies to improve efficiency, set new objectives and reach goals in a profitable and timely manner.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "2fc7e660-8933-4ccb-a611-bce16e863f7d\n620c3924-c9d0-46af-b27c-cb683186cd22", "preferredlabel": "business processes"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_10859", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "analyse business requirements", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "8143df11-a044-474d-8305-883999879f3c", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "analyse business requirements", "altlabels": "analyse customer product risks\nanalyze  business requirements\nbusiness requirements analysis\nanalyse business requirements", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b04f377b-ee80-4b38-aca1-19d266a23b17", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Study clients'' needs and expectations for a product or service in order to identify and resolve inconsistencies and possible disagreements of involved stakeholders.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "3e2c24f5-18ff-4e70-9c33-daaf2e88fe09\n2cfcdc66-da35-4644-930e-0a439af292ef", "preferredlabel": "analyse business requirements"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15704", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "enterprise architect", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "8143df11-a044-474d-8305-883999879f3c", "metadata": {"code": "2511.6", "type": "occupation", "label": "enterprise architect", "altlabels": "enterprise architects\nenterprise architect\nenterprise architecture manager\nenterprise developer\nenterprise designer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/2bef94db-0088-4507-982a-2ca717529adb", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Enterprise architects balance technological opportunities with business requirements. They also maintain a holistic view of the organisation''s strategy, processes, information and ICT assets and link the business mission, strategy and processes to the ICT strategy.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "949dd982-d18e-4509-ae4e-5539cb865761\n7a3c0e91-58ab-48f9-8019-b84575428c85", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "enterprise architect", "occupationgroupcode": "2511", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16241", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "eBusiness manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "8143df11-a044-474d-8305-883999879f3c", "metadata": {"code": "2431.10.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "eBusiness manager", "altlabels": "eBusiness development manager\ne-business managers\neBusiness manager\neCommerce manager\neBusiness managers\ne-commerce manager\nweb business development manager\neBusiness development officer\ne-commerce development manager\ne-business manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/586fe133-1987-41f4-b89a-f39d4bc58e1e", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "eBusiness managers create and execute a company''s electronic strategy plan for selling products and services online. They also improve data integrity, placement of online tools and brand exposure and monitor sales for companies that market products to customers using the internet. They collaborate with the marketing and sales management team using ICT tools to reach sales goals and provide accurate information and offerings to business partners.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "4a9bdc3e-a238-4b4e-b6ea-27488c4e2c8c\nf8818dcc-48e7-4deb-9a88-2bb041eac567", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "eBusiness manager", "occupationgroupcode": "2431", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_18148", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "ICT business analyst", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "8143df11-a044-474d-8305-883999879f3c", "metadata": {"code": "2511.9", "type": "occupation", "label": "ICT business analyst", "altlabels": "ICT business analyst\nICT business analysts\nbusiness process specialist\nIT business analyst", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/fe0fa514-b48d-4a53-9757-a283c0baacf0", "scopenote": "Excludes people performing development activities.", "definition": "", "description": "ICT business analysts are in charge of analysing and designing an organisation''s processes and systems, assessing the business model and its integration with technology. They also identify change needs, assess the impact of the change, capture and document requirements and then ensure that these requirements are delivered whilst supporting the business through the implementation process.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "f163e862-fee0-4010-a717-6baba039227c\nc84230b4-e268-4567-b54c-f54e53126bdd", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "ICT business analyst", "occupationgroupcode": "2511", "regulatedprofessionnote": 