ncial plans to ensure company sustainability", "Identifying opportunities for organizational growth and development"], "justification": "Given the user''s interest in complex environments and psychology, strategic thinking aligns with their goal of working in a role that requires understanding of people and a bit of numbers. It builds on their existing strengths in critical thinking and problem solving, and supports their career trajectory in creating companies and building relationships.", "original_label": "Strategic Thinking", "esco_description": "Strategic Thinking involves the ability to analyze complex situations, identify key issues, and develop long-term plans to achieve organizational goals. It requires evaluating multiple options and anticipating future trends to make informed decisions."}, {"id": "skill::key_11531", "score": 0.359928787, "category": "leadership", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "show entrepreneurial spirit", "node_id": "skill::key_11531", "altlabels": "identify opportunities\ndemonstrate entrepreneurship\nshow entrepreneurial spirit\ndisplay entrepreneurial spirit\nreveal entrepreneurial spirit\ndemonstrate willingness to take risks\nshowing entrepreneurial spirit\ndemonstrate entrepreneurial spirit\nshowing an entrepreneurial spirit\npursue opportunities\nshow an entrepreneurial spirit\nexhibit entrepreneurial spirit", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/bdcf429c-5ccf-4c3d-bb61-4c987573a35e", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "transversal", "description": "Develop, organise and manage an own business venture, identifying and pursuing opportunities and mobilising resources, keeping in mind a profitability perspective. Demonstrate a proactive attitude and determination to achieve success in business ", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "691675d1-3b75-42e3-bbeb-f9bf54929f95\n452294a2-e93a-4bf7-9c1d-0c66372b8f33", "preferredlabel": "show entrepreneurial spirit"}, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Entrepreneurial Skills", "applications": ["Developing and launching new business ideas", "Identifying market trends and opportunities", "Managing resources and taking calculated risks"], "justification": "The user''s interest in creating companies and their self-identification as a leader make entrepreneurship a key anchor skill. It aligns with their enterprising career interest and their goal of working in a complex environment. This skill also leverages their existing strengths in creativity and leadership.", "original_label": "Entrepreneurship", "esco_description": "The ability to identify business opportunities, take calculated risks, and drive innovation to create new ventures or improve existing ones."}, {"id": "skill::key_12039", "score": 0.35270124700000005, "category": "interpersonal", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "promote communication between parties", "node_id": "skill::key_12039", "altlabels": "encourage communication between parties\npromoting communication between parties\nadvocate communication between parties\npromote communication between parties\npromote intra-party communication", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c68af615-b24c-4719-a199-c4141e08f2bd", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "occupation-specific", "description": "Encourage parties to communicate among them and share their views on events and happenings in order to find cooperation paths.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a7598cf6-f21e-41a5-91e1-37d81bef66e9\nf53fab7a-b3d8-40a5-97f0-b0e4585f65f4", "preferredlabel": "promote communication between parties"}, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Effective Communication", "applications": ["Conducting successful negotiations with clients and stakeholders", "Resolving conflicts and mediating disputes within a team", "Delivering persuasive presentations and influencing decision-making"], "justification": "The user''s ability to attract attent