e, "category": "cognitive", "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "apply strategic thinking", "altlabels": "apply strategic thinking techniques\napply strategic thinking\napply techniques for strategic thinking\nmove strategically\nthink strategically", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6c870993-9341-438b-91c0-c7fe4f96d8f5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Apply generation and effective application of business insights and possible opportunities, in order to achieve competitive business advantage on a long-term basis.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "a71b991a-32ab-4549-be36-4e1937acc883\n964c1d63-681d-4f91-9a0a-0ab87a57fcd8", "preferredlabel": "apply strategic thinking"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "The challenge is to research and analyze a real-life case study of a company facing strategic decisions. Identify the key challenges, options, and potential outcomes, and develop a strategic plan with recommendations for the company.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 44, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Strategic Thinking", "applications": ["Developing business strategies to gain competitive advantage", "Evaluating market trends and identifying growth opportunities", "Anticipating potential challenges and devising proactive measures"], "justification": "Given the user''s interest in philosophy and complex environments, strategic thinking will help them analyze and synthesize information to make informed decisions. It aligns with their critical thinking and problem-solving skills, and supports their career goal of working in complex environments.", "esco_description": "Strategic thinking involves analyzing complex situations, anticipating future trends, and making informed decisions to achieve long-term goals. It enables professionals to develop innovative solutions and adapt to changing market conditions.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_9448", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "implement strategic management", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "leadership", "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "implement strategic management", "altlabels": "implement strategic management plan\ndeliver strategic management plan\ndevelop and implement strategic management plan\ndevise company development strategy\ndevise strategy for company development\ndevelop strategy for company development\nformulate and implement company development strategy\nimplement management strategy\nimplement strategic management principles\nformulate strategy for company development\nimplement strategic management", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/953445c0-4770-4be0-91cf-270a64c0e297", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Implement a strategy for the development and transformation of the company. Strategic management involves the formulation and implementation of the major objectives and initiatives of a company by senior management on behalf of the owners, based on consideration of available resources and an assessment of the internal and external environments in which the organisation operates.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "5ec05073-a8df-4a0e-9ab2-7721591dd3b6\nb0011391-93ed-4047-b65d-f977fabbe608", "preferredlabel": "implement strategic management"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Conduct a strategic analysis of a local business, identifying its strengths, weaknesses, opportunities, and threats. Create a SWOT analysis report outlining your findings and recommendations for strategic management.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 26, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Strategic Leadership", "applications": ["Developing and implementing business strategies", "Leading cross-functional teams to drive innovation", "Negotiating and forming strategic partnerships"], "justification": "The user''s interest in creating companies and their self-identification as a leader align with the development of entrepreneurial leadership. This skill will help them inspire and lead others in business ventures, combining their leadership strength with business acumen.", "esco_description": "Strategic leadership involves the ability to set a clear vision, make sound decisions, and inspire others to achieve organizational goals. It includes the capacity to identify opportunities, take calculated risks, and adapt to changing market conditions.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_15055", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "perform market research", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "interpersonal", "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "perform market research", "altlabels": "market research performance\nimplement market research\ncomplete market research\nperform market research\nperforming market research\nundertake market research", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/fe39d4db-4cb5-4299-bb9f-896c8fd6ab13", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Gather, assess and represent data about target market and customers in order to facilitate strategic development and feasibility studies. Identify market trends.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "9e2e0e43-e393-4129-b205-e1d3985e6413\n7057f16c-7df2-4197-8a2e-ee22804ac9ab", "preferredlabel": "perform market research"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Conduct market research to identify customer needs and preferences for a specific product or service. Create a survey or interview questions, collect data, and analyze the results to gain insights into the target market.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 35, "confidence": 0.75, "esco_label": "Market Analysis", "applications": ["Developing targeted marketing campaigns", "Predicting market trends and consumer behavior", "Advising on investment decisions based on market sentiment"], "justification": "The user''s desire to work in complex environments requiring psychology and understanding of people makes market psychology a valuable skill. It will enable them to analyze consumer behavior, understand motives, and create meaningful relations between products and people.", "esco_description": "Analyzing market psychology involves understanding consumer behavior, market trends, and the impact of psychological factors on purchasing decisions. It enables professionals to make informed marketing strategies and investment decisions.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_1648", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "creative", "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "altlabels": "propose technical solutions to business problems\npropose ICT solutions to business problems", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/07e51c60-763a-4335-b4ec-70a15f66d328", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Suggest how to solve business issues, using ICT means, so that business processes are improved.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "57bfedf4-70e2-4736-a01e-ed696a50518a\n2949f643-88a5-411e-83d2-109f0749a45a", "preferredlabel": "propose ICT solutions to business problems"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Identifiez une entreprise locale et proposez une solution technologique pour améliorer un processus existant. Vous devrez analyser le processus actuel, identifier les lacunes et proposer une solution basée sur les technologies de l''information et de la communication.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 34, "confidence": 0.8, "esco_label": "Problem Solving", "applications": ["Developing new business strategies", "Designing economic models", "Creating innovative solutions for economic issues"], "justification": "With a strong creativity rating and interest in philosophy, the user can benefit from developing creative problem-solving skills. This skill will allow them to think outside the box and find innovative solutions to complex issues in their career trajectory.", "esco_description": "The capability to identify and implement innovative solutions to complex challenges, by thinking critically and creatively.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_9586", "type": "skill", "depth": 0, "label": "data analytics", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "category": "technical", "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "data analytics", "altlabels": "data analytics", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/97bd1c21-66b2-4b7e-ad0f-e3cda590e378", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "The science of analysing and making decisions based on raw data collected from various sources. Includes knowledge of techniques using algorithms that derive insights or trends from that data to support decision-making processes.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "ebe344b9-3c0a-4668-8a10-dd3f35f47ee2\n0b1b5779-e955-499f-a50d-e69ea698ba46", "preferredlabel": "data analytics"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Analyser les données de ventes d''une entreprise locale sur les 6 derniers mois pour identifier les tendances, les pics de vente, et proposer des pistes d''amélioration. Utiliser un tableur ou un outil d''analyse de données pour visualiser les résultats.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 27, "confidence": 0.7, "esco_label": "Data Analysis", "applications": ["Identifying trends and patterns in economic data", "Developing economic forecasts based on historical data", "Evaluating the impact of economic policies using statistical analysis"], "justification": "To excel in the business and economics field and make informed decisions, the user should enhance their data analysis skills. This will complement their strengths in critical thinking and analytical thinking, enabling them to leverage data for strategic business decisions.", "esco_description": "Data Analysis involves examining, cleansing, transforming, and modeling data to discover useful information, inform conclusions, and support decision-making processes.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14598", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "make strategic business decisions", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "make strategic business decisions", "altlabels": "make tactical business decisions\npay per click\nmake strategic business decisions\nmake strategic business choices\nPPC", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f60c9e52-95fc-4ca1-a73c-18a491153b63", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Analyse business information and consult directors for decision making purposes in a varied array of aspects affecting the prospect, productivity and sustainable operation of a company. Consider the options and alternatives to a challenge and make sound rational decisions based on analysis and experience.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "71709697-2eda-4fe4-9160-e6a258ea6b0a\n0441380e-ef76-4ac6-b610-8c854edf11df", "preferredlabel": "make strategic business decisions"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1018", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 1, "label": "developing objectives and strategies", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8