gic plans.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "52d04b3f-a606-4b12-b574-8759dc9f16f9\n8258e386-da7c-4b3d-b82f-21dd5130c115", "preferredlabel": "analyse business objectives"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_9930", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "business processes", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "business processes", "altlabels": "business process\nrefinement a business\nbusiness analysis\na business process\nbusiness measures\nbusiness handling\nbusiness processes", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/9e84a506-df06-4be3-874a-fa01293e3dd5", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "knowledge", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Processes which an organisation applies to improve efficiency, set new objectives and reach goals in a profitable and timely manner.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "2fc7e660-8933-4ccb-a611-bce16e863f7d\n620c3924-c9d0-46af-b27c-cb683186cd22", "preferredlabel": "business processes"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_5982", "type": "skill", "depth": 3, "label": "analyse business processes", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "analyse business processes", "altlabels": "analyze  business processes\nanalyse business processes", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/56042303-972b-41be-9310-58467599ff7e", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Study the contribution of the work processes to the business goals and monitor their efficiency and productivity.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "35178510-475b-44b0-b62e-eb4fd8988e7a\n87e15277-a050-4178-9501-e2c339ce798d", "preferredlabel": "analyse business processes"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_15704", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "enterprise architect", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"code": "2511.6", "type": "occupation", "label": "enterprise architect", "altlabels": "enterprise architects\nenterprise architect\nenterprise architecture manager\nenterprise developer\nenterprise designer", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/2bef94db-0088-4507-982a-2ca717529adb", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "Enterprise architects balance technological opportunities with business requirements. They also maintain a holistic view of the organisation''s strategy, processes, information and ICT assets and link the business mission, strategy and processes to the ICT strategy.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "949dd982-d18e-4509-ae4e-5539cb865761\n7a3c0e91-58ab-48f9-8019-b84575428c85", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "enterprise architect", "occupationgroupcode": "2511", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "occupation::key_16241", "type": "occupation", "depth": 3, "label": "eBusiness manager", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"code": "2431.10.2", "type": "occupation", "label": "eBusiness manager", "altlabels": "eBusiness development manager\ne-business managers\neBusiness manager\neCommerce manager\neBusiness managers\ne-commerce manager\nweb business development manager\neBusiness development officer\ne-commerce development manager\ne-business manager", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/586fe133-1987-41f4-b89a-f39d4bc58e1e", "scopenote": "", "definition": "", "description": "eBusiness managers create and execute a company''s electronic strategy plan for selling products and services online. They also improve data integrity, placement of online tools and brand exposure and monitor sales for companies that market products to customers using the internet. They collaborate with the marketing and sales management team using ICT tools to reach sales goals and provide accurate information and offerings to business partners.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "4a9bdc3e-a238-4b4e-b6ea-27488c4e2c8c\nf8818dcc-48e7-4deb-9a88-2bb041eac567", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "preferredlabel": "eBusiness manager", "occupationgroupcode": "2431", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_694", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "management and administration", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"code": "", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "management and administration", "altlabels": "management and administration", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/isced-f/0413", "scopenote": "", "description": "Management and administration is the study of planning, directing and operating the functions and activities of organizations and institutions. Programmes in management also including administration, economics, finance etc. are included here if emphasis is given to management and administration.\nProgrammes and qualifications with the following main content are classified here:\nAdministration\nEducational management\nEmployment management\nEntrepreneurship\nHealth administration\nLogistic management\nManagement science\nOffice management\nOrganizational theory and behaviour\nPersonnel administration\nPersonnel management\n''Start your own business'' courses\nSupply change management\nTraining management\n\n=== Inclusions:\nStudy of leadership in the context of management is included here.\n\n=== Exclusions:\nTraining in leadership in the context of personal development is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0031 ''Personal skills''.\nStudy of administration in the meaning of office work is excluded from this detailed field and included in detailed field 0415 ''Secretarial and office work''.", "uuidhistory": "9aaa99f4-d19b-4042-a645-f375a7c49506\na0c8360b-e40e-4383-92cb-6c0ce4fb9e8d", "preferredlabel": "management and administration"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_937", "type": "skillgroup", "depth": 3, "label": "developing financial, business or marketing plans", "notes": "", "state": "locked", "visible": false, "graph_id": "f4557296-1cde-4d76-8c6f-9e56b2516ddb", "metadata": {"code": "S4.1.2", "type": "skillgroup", "label": "developing financial, business or marketing plans", "altlabels": "developing financial, business or marketing plans", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/37272760-957a-4c34-b4f3-780ee285334d", "scopenote": "Examples:\n- Develop business case\n- Draw up marketing and sales plan\n- Create a financial plan", "description": "Envision and develop strategies and plans for companies and organisations aimed at purposes such as establishing new markets, refurbishing the equipment and machinery of a company, implementing pricing strategies, and restoring or maintaining financial viability.", "uuidhistory": "4666888d-a4b0-41d0-87f3-425bf2e563c2\n55304a64-8d3c-46e8-bd46-4aed8d4116da", "preferredlabel": "developing financial, business or marketing plans"}, "revealed": false, "challenge": "", "is_anchor": false, "xp_reward": 25, "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skillgroup::key_1154", "type": 