"skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "Suggest how to solve business issues, using ICT means, so that business processes are improved.", "islocalized": "false", "uuidhistory": "57bfedf4-70e2-4736-a01e-ed696a50518a\n2949f643-88a5-411e-83d2-109f0749a45a", "preferredlabel": "propose ICT solutions to business problems"}, "revealed": true, "challenge": "Trouvez une petite entreprise locale qui rencontre des problèmes informatiques et proposez une solution technologique adaptée à leur besoin. Rencontrez le propriétaire pour comprendre les défis auxquels il est confronté et proposez une solution complète comprenant matériel, logiciel et éventuellement formation.", "is_anchor": true, "xp_reward": 28, "confidence": 0.85, "esco_label": "Problem Solving", "applications": ["Developing new business strategies", "Designing economic models", "Creating innovative solutions for economic challenges"], "justification": "Given the user''s high creativity rating and interest in finding meaningful impact, developing creative problem-solving skills will allow them to approach challenges with fresh perspectives and innovative solutions.", "esco_description": "The ability to identify and analyze complex issues, develop innovative solutions, and implement them effectively in a professional context.", "similarity_score": 0.5}, {"id": "skill::key_14598", "type": "skill", "depth": 1, "label": "make strategic business decisions", "notes": "", "state": "available", "visible": true, "graph_id": "7bcdafac-17ac-4177-9ff0-f9a285d55b56", "metadata": {"type": "skill", "label": "make strategic business decisions", "altlabels": "make tactical business decisions\npay per click\nmake strategic business decisions\nmake strategic business choices\nPPC", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f60c9e52-95fc-4ca1-a73c-18a491153b63", "scopenote": "", "skilltype": "skill/competence", "definition": "", "reuselevel": "cross-sector", "description": "A