96, "metadata": {"altlabels": "ICT research advisor\nIT research consultant\nIT research advisor\nICT research consultant\nICT research consultants\nICT research specialist\nIT research specialist", "code": "2511.12", "definition": "", "description": "ICT research consultants perform targeted ICT research and provide a final report to the client. They also use ICT tools to design questionnaires for surveys, analyse the results, write reports, present the results and make recommendations based on the research findings.", "islocalized": "false", "label": "ICT research consultant", "node_id": "occupation::key_16513", "occupationgroupcode": "2511", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/6e92d4b5-3167-4166-802f-da7753951a31", "preferredlabel": "ICT research consultant", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated", "scopenote": "Includes people performing outsourced activities. \nExcludes people performing in-house research.", "type": "occupation", "uuidhistory": "eb7b0597-5790-4b2e-bc06-73cb54a4b462\nb7acb387-ea78-48fc-b66f-843c311743de"}}, {"id": "occupation::key_16460", "score": 0.447506249, "metadata": {"altlabels": "business consultant\nbusiness process consultant", "code": "2421.2", "definition": "", "description": "Business consultants analyse the position, structure and processes of businesses and companies and offer services or advice to improve them. They research and identify business processes such as financial inefficiencies or employee management and devise strategical plans to overcome these difficulties. They work in external consulting firms where they provide an objective view on a business and or company''s structure and methodological processes.", "islocalized": "false", "label": "business consultant", "node_id": "occupation::key_16460", "occupationgroupcode": "2421", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/6a29d804-f775-446c-bec7-35fc4e28ac97", "preferredlabel": "business consultant", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated", "scopenote": "", "type": "occupation", "uuidhistory": "3e3a36bc-199a-4fb9-a3fa-cf27cd12f9d0\n40a08cf1-51ab-41e4-b917-aead4c203dc0"}}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', NULL, false, '[]', NULL, 0.00, '{}', NULL, false, 4, false, '{}', NULL, '{}', '{online,classroom}', '{}');

Hobbies: Curating playlists, gaming (especially strategy-based), occasionally drawing in a sketchpad

Favorite Game: Stardew Valley (loves the calmness and control it gives)

Enjoyed Class (surprisingly): Ethics—he liked the moral debates, even if he didn’t speak up

Biggest Joy This Year: Designing a fake app logo as part of a school art project', 'Canada', 'QC', '“I don’t know what I want to do. Every time I think of something, I think of five reasons why I can’t. I wish I could just try without failing.”', 'Alex is a quiet, reflective teen who often feels like he''s lagging behind his peers. School has been a challenge—not because he doesn''t care, but because he’s unsure why any of it matters. He''s shy in class, avoids group work, and feels overwhelmed when asked to talk about the future. He believes he''s “not good at anything,” yet he''s often the one classmates turn to when they’re stuck on a phone issue or need a playlist that perfectly fits the mood.

He’s trapped in a cycle of preconceptions:

“You need to be naturally smart to succeed.”

“Art isn''t a real career.”

“I’m too quiet to do anything that matters.”

These beliefs hold him back from even trying.

I have a shitload of money to invest.', 'Student', 'None', 1, 'High School', ' “I want to design music covers.”

“I want to build a quiet creative job where I can focus on my own projects.”

“I want to understand how apps or games are made.”', '{"Digital Curation","Strategic Thinking","Visual Creativity","Focus & Calm Under Low Pressure","Pattern Recognition"}', '[0.22565489,0.034169525,-0.38669175,-0.24242039,-0.014050245,0.10591768,0.3716079,0.0972246,-0.15312284,0.15190849,-0.36496016,-0.06267765,-0.17283095,0.04297197,-0.05798434,0.16867717,-0.42814857,-0.1084664,-0.20316923,0.35481822,-0.7738351,-0.037919804,-0.09384775,0.43152422,0.035104156,0.26436815,0.14570704,0.3107605,-0.22613034,0.09137889,0.6170889,-0.123285726,0.23757944,0.09275577,0.29049698,-0.09279629,0.28092432,-0.082924895,-0.21010986,0.37856716,0.0030217394,-0.27339405,0.033548504,-0.19321646,-0.28024483,0.091269284,-0.5974996,-0.18869026,-0.38493395,0.7383895,-0.4191349,-0.13625708,-0.5174231,-0.6195643,0.113810435,-0.026200011,-0.33240741,-0.21450242,0.34032235,0.46617782,-0.34506026,0.3822756,-0.3915524,0.1404947,0.027122915,0.13781488,-0.044812787,0.3948029,0.24354833,0.124490686,-0.33310002,0.10172747,0.41321725,0.029788256,-0.4087225,-0.058698855,-0.112399995,-0.73526,-0.16083735,0.29640025,0.059907448,-0.49256968,0.01572831,-0.073652014,0.13469774,0.11212821,-0.41006094,0.3428851,0.09679511,0.81311023,-0.45766374,0.045974493,0.015454054,0.4352199,-0.047692,0.046551123,0.3220016,-0.35535753,0.11499214,0.1974464,0.18804806,-0.06372317,0.5162591,0.4332596,-0.45722166,-0.77222717,0.59918267,-0.2145849,0.30141473,-0.052776016,0.22800948,-0.23362583,0.015312791,-0.39821118,-0.0020410866,0.27829215,0.2482705,-0.28950182,0.21334161,0.02087298,0.17992413,-0.4182426,0.30669838,0.12349342,-0.17268032,-0.28580916,-0.2930299,-0.50236493,0.12301798,-0.35234663,0.2179333,0.3859688,-0.6855887,0.5242141,-0.25302112,0.13608554,-0.062004045,0.28503972,0.08972715,-0.19811161,0.34628406,0.017698385,0.0015196651,-0.517166,0.14007716,0.5932191,0.06771268,-0.063228086,0.01991494,-0.032177,-0.08096904,-0.67291814,0.46776772,0.31234238,0.28747934,-0.67527145,-0.14226013,0.19155055,0.7386273,0.16583791,