774,-0.0068518515,-0.074762836,-5.8080396e-08,-0.04810829,-0.027010076,-0.027902536,-0.043631066,-0.008991364,-0.030675702,-0.08410417,-0.045864645,0.036718894,-0.0037924151,0.06748208,-0.024571564,-0.0904201,-0.025447108,0.031078802,-0.08047945,-0.0074655362,0.035352606,0.010427102,0.0010128444,0.14463694,-0.016229788,-0.04047427,-0.019078808,0.028922481,-0.06678913,-0.014751618,0.07103356,0.012073223,-0.0052229105,-0.042989686,0.028894791,0.02434781,-0.036530405,-0.048933852,0.039871078,0.10522973,-0.012553888,-0.0045841723,0.07616643,-0.0625884,-0.03345368,-0.016853267,-0.012587093,0.0008851917,0.01611142,-0.006827755,0.039046694,0.065118976,0.026208859,0.0049288943,0.023524716,0.057754807,0.06444133,0.05430079,0.03644245,-0.058405586,0.034270737,-0.05438068,0.012458233,0.0747515,-0.036220837,-0.016649207,0.009463117]', '[{"id": "occupation::key_15612", "score": 0.316586554, "metadata": {"altlabels": "operational investment banker\ninvestment banking associate\ninvestment banker\ncorporate investment adviser\ncorporate investment strategist\ncorporate banker\ncorporate investment banker", "code": "2412.6.1", "definition": "", "description": "Corporate investment bankers offer strategic advice on financial services to companies and other institutions. They ensure that legal regulations are being followed by their clients in their efforts of raising any capital. They provide technical expertise and information on mergers and acquisitions, bonds and shares, privatisations and reorganisation, raising capital and security underwriting, including equity and debt markets.", "islocalized": "false", "label": "corporate investment banker", "node_id": "occupation::key_15612", "occupationgroupcode": "2412", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/244a79eb-122b-4bee-8065-b4c39efce4ff", "preferredlabel": "corporate investment banker", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated", "scopenote": "Includes people performing activities to monitor the compliance of legal regulations and to advise on financial transactions and deals. \nIncludes people performing research and analysis. \nExcludes people performing investor relations management.", "type": "occupation", "uuidhistory": "e4a8aaef-b4d3-4d33-a383-3034fe444e9a\n09ced50a-6413-4e74-8f31-2de05f0726e5"}}, {"id": "occupation::key_17377", "score": 0.432883, "metadata": {"altlabels": "investment operations analyst\ninvestment specialist\nportfolio analyst\ninvestment banking business analyst\ninvestment analyst\ninvestment accounting analyst\ninvestment officer\noil and gas investment banking analyst\ninvestment banking analyst\ninvestment compliance analyst", "code": "2413.1.2", "definition": "", "description": "Investment analysts undertake research to make informed recommendations to fund managers. They research investments globally but depending on the nature and field of their employer they can specialise in fields like retail, infrastructure, energy, banking and financial services. They focus on financial and economical information such as the political and economic developments that can impact financial markets, the financial performance of the target companies and use the interpretation of data from different sources to understand how it affects investment decision making.", "islocalized": "false", "label": "investment analyst", "node_id": "occupation::key_17377", "occupationgroupcode": "2413", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/b7f47c25-bdf3-42fa-a68e-ad32754b2dba", "preferredlabel": "investment analyst", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated", "scopenote": "", "type": "occupation", "uuidhistory": "1e721a76-bf95-4c7c-ac7e-e493af42e95e\n5a9ccb37-54e8-44cd-b283-fe15acc92ced"}}, {"id": "occupation::key_16895", "score": 0.43396413300000003, "metadata": {"altlabels": "company analyst\nstructured finance analyst\nfinancial markets researcher\nfinancial researcher\nm&a analyst\nbanking analyst\neconomic analyst\nfinancial analyst\nfinancial markets report writer\nfinancial markets analyst\ncredit analyst\ntreasury analyst\nstock market analyst\ncapital markets analyst\nfinancial markets specialist\nfinancial markets forecaster", "code": "2413.1", "definition": "", "description": "\nFinancial analysts conduct economic research and elicit valuable analyses on financial matters such as profitability, liquidity, solvency, and asset management. They provide recommendations on financial matters for decision-making processes. Financial analysts work in both the public and the private sector.", "islocalized": "false", "label": "financial analyst", "node_id": "occupation::key_16895", "occupationgroupcode": "2413", "occupationtype": "escooccupation", "originuri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/8d586ee9-0ab1-4155-a3b0-2ca786c8e48c", "preferredlabel": "financial analyst", "regulatedprofessionnote": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/regulated-professions/unregulated", "scopenote": "", "type": "occupation", "uuidhistory": "62325c25-056a-482b-890f-b05e1b7dd45a\nab4dedb3-5215-4e7a-a98f-d519597bdca5"}}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', NULL, false, '[]', NULL, 0.00, '{}', NULL, false, 4, false, '{}', NULL, '{}', '{online,classroom}', '{}');

He may not express himself with words or excel in academic settings, but he has a natural ability to understand how things work just by observing them—and the determination to fix or build without fanfare. People trust him not because he talks a lot, but because he gets things done.', 'Jordan isn’t a fan of sitting in classrooms. He finds most academic subjects frustrating and often zones out during long explanations. Reading and writing are hard work for him, and standardized tests feel like traps. But give him something to build, fix, or figure out with his hands, and he lights up. He’s curious, mechanically inclined, and learns best by doing.

He’s not a talker, but people trust him to get things done. He doesn’t need recognition—he just wants to be useful, independent, and real.', 'Student', 'None', 1, 'High School', 'Jobs that use his hands, not textbooks

Clear, visible results (e.g., building a thing, fixing something broken)

Working outside or in a workshop, not an office

