I love seducing girls, I am very good looking.  ', 'Canada', 'QC', 'I can attract the attention of people, I am very good at making connections and understanding others'' motives. ', 'At 15 years old, I was deeply scare of dying, my journey started at this age and I came to the realization that what I should do is to help others, limit their suffering. From that age I was really drawn to the question of meaning, why should we act, why should we hold these values, why should we follow the rules. Why all these authority can command me when they don''t know what they are talking about. I came convince that I should go on and do philosophy, but I never actually sit down and started reading avidly. I''ve always been more of a general thinker, trying to put the missing pieces together. Everything is truly about doing things that are meaningful, where I can have impact on others. 

When I got my letter of admission to the university of Montreal for Philosophy, I decided I couldn''t do it, I really felt that this was wrong and I immediately applied for a business bachelor with a major in economics at concordia university and mcgill. Although, I didn''t have the grade to go to mcgill, I got rejected there. 

I was never a truly gifted students, I could always get surprisingly good grades in econ, math, literature, but I generally didn''t perform well. I''ve never listen in class, and always waited to the last minute to study. I was so conflicted into what I should be doing and if I should really get into the race. 

But now that I am at the university in commerce, I am somewhat lost, I don''t know how to sell myself and show what can I bring to the market. 

I have to create myself a narrative, but I have always somewhat rebel against the status quo, while not fully rejecting it as I need to earn my living. 

I have always felt like I am a leader and can inspire others, but I have wait to materialize this in university. ', 'Thinker', 'Economics', 1, 'Bachelor''s Degree', 'I am looking to help create companies and people to create relations between things. I am not truly good at school, but I am motivated and deeply want to find what I could be good at. I consider myself a thinker and want to work in complex environment, requiring psychology, a bit of numbers and understanding of people. ', '{"Ability to connect with people","good at simplifying complex things","I am a bit a of a dreamer","I understand people and their motives and why they act."}', '[-0.224622,0.28845856,0.5694605,-0.51206017,-0.15929002,0.3461306,0.47256517,-0.20213833,-0.19616772,-0.37313882,-0.06074819,-0.16383865,-0.19724655,-0.32874924,0.320199,-0.26742882,-0.2510883,-0.12089093,0.27407813,0.12910411,-0.4060688,-0.4489675,-0.27217656,0.1049943,-0.05748923,0.14922088,-0.22058214,0.36306065,0.07537758,-0.34591788,0.41819078,0.2937339,-0.305077,-0.33558166,0.4675595,-0.27654094,-0.029364884,-0.20795812,0.082463205,0.20510902,0.24367952,0.024125095,-0.021954589,0.25278938,-0.0976316,-0.6432567,0.015668115,-0.24259982,0.3200189,0.0059051663,-0.23746175,0.24461016,0.18748423,-0.38828784,-0.15685867,-0.40148968,0.09671128,0.24891432,0.57543945,-0.029559284,0.63937527,-0.5963433,-0.1808604,-0.022527516,0.0023794323,-0.010152113,-0.044647954,0.13591862,0.260953,0.20670138,-0.13520049,0.5050906,0.4056592,-0.2882375,0.46204776,0.22438404,-0.31177098,-0.3602038,-0.27205318,0.10407433,0.65482146,-0.55000496,0.6339718,-0.11934401,0.25302836,0.4470986,0.17923987,0.03089872,0.235488,0.4614734,-0.38687745,0.21879286,0.14673108,-0.03353694,0.20312472,0.70238245,0.08515261,-0.47684968,-0.4168532,0.33564252,-0.13603994,0.19389242,0.3048479,-0.20773521,0.14016429,0.02545539,0.4521796,0.17933954,0.2716907,-0.4660583,0.3571375,0.12770402,-0.047475748,-0.0073189065,-1.0409863,0.39271367,-0.15934262,-0.18660581,0.19982246,0.